msgid "当前 / 有效 / 最大"
msgstr "Current / Effective / Max"

msgid "当前是眼下的数；有效是受伤压低的上限，歇着会慢慢长回来，疗伤更快；最大是你的本钱。"
msgstr "Current is what you have right now. Effective is the cap your wounds hold down — it creeps back as you rest, faster if you treat them. Max is your full measure."

msgid "学武功、自学、修行都耗精，歇着慢慢回来；归零就昏倒。"
msgstr "Learning, studying on your own and cultivation all spend it. It comes back as you rest. Hit zero and you pass out."

msgid "挨打、练功、打坐都耗气，歇着慢慢回来；归零就昏倒。"
msgstr "Taking hits, training and meditating all spend it. It comes back as you rest. Hit zero and you pass out."

msgid "研读、冥思都耗神，歇着慢慢回来；归零就昏倒。"
msgstr "Reading and contemplation spend it. It comes back as you rest. Hit zero and you pass out."

msgid "打坐得来，运功和加力都要用它；上限看基本内功。"
msgstr "Built up by meditating. Exerting and Extra Force both draw on it; its cap depends on Basic Force."

msgid "每一击多灌进这么多内力，打得更重，内力也耗得更快。"
msgstr "This much more Inner Force goes into every blow: you hit harder, and burn through it faster."

msgid "施法要用。冥思得来，上限看基本咒文。"
msgstr "Spells need it. Built up by contemplation; its cap depends on Basic Incantation."

msgid "施展神通要用。修行得来，上限看基本法术。"
msgstr "Mystic powers need it. Built up through cultivation; its cap depends on Basic Mysticism."

msgid "杀气"
msgstr "Bloodlust"

msgid "杀人会涨，胆气也跟着壮；太重学不了佛道心法，还可能失控伤人。运功或捐香火能压下去。"
msgstr "Killing raises it, and your nerve with it. Too much and the Buddhist and Daoist arts are closed to you — you may even lash out. Exerting your Inner Force or giving incense money brings it down."

msgid "随时间消耗，吃东西补；见底后内力、法力、灵力不再恢复。"
msgstr "Drains over time; eat to fill it. Once it runs dry, Inner Force, Arcane Power and Mystic Power stop coming back."

msgid "饮水"
msgstr "Water"

msgid "随时间消耗，喝东西补；见底后什么都不再恢复。"
msgstr "Drains over time; drink to fill it. Once it runs dry, nothing comes back at all."

msgid "打架、办事得来；武功能练到多高看它。"
msgstr "Earned from fights and errands. How far your martial arts can go depends on it."

msgid "打架、办事得来，请教和自学要花它；没用掉的有上限。"
msgstr "Earned from fights and errands, and spent when you learn from a shifu or study on your own. Unspent Potential has a cap."

msgid "综合评价"
msgstr "Standing"

msgid "江湖上对你的总评：办成差事会涨，认输会掉。"
msgstr "What the jianghu thinks of you, all told. Getting jobs done raises it; conceding a fight lowers it."

msgid "杀过的人"
msgstr "Kills"

msgid "你亲手杀过多少人。"
msgstr "How many people you have killed with your own hands."

msgid "负重"
msgstr "Load"

msgid "身上东西的总重和能背的上限，上限看膂力。"
msgstr "What you're carrying, and how much you can carry. The limit depends on Strength."

msgid "体重"
msgstr "Weight"

msgid "你自己的分量，也决定肚子能装多少吃喝。"
msgstr "Your own weight. It also decides how much food and drink your stomach can hold."

msgid "膂力"
msgstr "Strength"

msgid "力气：打得更重，背得更多，拿得动沉重的兵器。"
msgstr "Muscle: you hit harder, carry more, and can wield heavy weapons."

msgid "敢不敢抢攻：自动对打时，胆识高的人出手更勤；不少师父也看它。"
msgstr "Whether you dare strike first: in a straight fight the bold attack more often. Plenty of shifu look at it, too."

msgid "悟性"
msgstr "Wits"

msgid "天资：学武功更快，耗精更少，打架时也更容易长进。"
msgstr "Talent: you pick up martial arts faster, spend less Essence doing it, and grow more from every fight."

msgid "精神方面的体质：冥思和修行涨得更快，不少法门也看它。"
msgstr "Your spiritual makeup: contemplation and cultivation come faster, and many mystic arts look at it."

msgid "临危不乱：对手抢攻前要过你这一关，定力越高他们越容易转为守势；打空时也不易露破绽，还压得住杀气。"
msgstr "Nerve under pressure: an opponent has to get past it before seizing the initiative — the higher it is, the more often they fall back to guarding. You leave fewer openings when you miss, and you keep your Bloodlust in check."

msgid "容貌"
msgstr "Looks"

msgid "长相：有人看脸说话，也有师父看长相收人；容貌高，杀气重的人也不易对你翻脸。"
msgstr "Appearance: some folk judge by faces, and some shifu take students by looks. Good looks also make the bloodthirsty slower to turn on you."

msgid "根骨"
msgstr "Constitution"

msgid "体质：精气神恢复得更快，打坐涨内力更快，昏倒后醒得更早，酒量也大。"
msgstr "Physique: Essence, Qi and Spirit recover faster, meditation builds Inner Force faster, you come round sooner after passing out — and you hold your drink better."

msgid "福缘"
msgstr "Fortune"

msgid "运气：容易遇上一般人碰不到的机缘，好事坏事都有。"
msgstr "Luck: you stumble on chances most people never meet. Good ones and bad."

msgid "东方故事"
msgstr "Eastern Stories"

msgid "雪亭镇"
msgstr "Snow Pavilion"

msgid "正纷扰间，一匹快马冲进了广场，两名老者立即站了起来。"
msgstr "In the middle of the commotion, a fast horse galloped into the square, and the two old men rose at once."

msgid "不料一名老者忽然说道：「大声点，让众位兄弟都听见了。」"
msgstr "But one of the old men suddenly said, \"Louder. Let all the brothers hear it.\""

msgid "那人一怔，随即大声说道：「方位是在西南二十四里，黄石隘口。」"
msgstr "The rider faltered, then called out, \"The bearing is southwest, twenty-four li — Yellow Rock Pass.\""

msgid "时间是天朝佑圣元年，岁次甲子，年仅十六岁的皇帝刚刚登基，雪亭镇上熙来攘往，一队身著白衣的朝廷武官和两名老者在镇前的广场中坐著，四面来来往往的人当中，有不少显然是武林中人，正探头探脑地向著广场张望。"
msgstr "It was the first year of the Yousheng reign. The Emperor, only sixteen, had just taken the throne. Snow Pavilion bustled with comings and goings. In the square at the edge of town sat a troop of imperial officers in white, and two old men. Among the people drifting past, more than a few were plainly of the wulin, craning their necks toward the square."

msgid "马上乘客一跃而下，快步走到老者身前，躬身说道：「禀将军，时辰已到，白道长命下官回禀，方位是在....」，说著压低了声音。"
msgstr "The rider leapt from the saddle, strode up to the old men and bowed. \"General, the hour has come. Daoist Bai sends me to report that the bearing is....\" And here he lowered his voice."

msgid "广场西边一家小客栈里，一个年约十四岁的少年问店里的小二道：「这些人神秘得紧，却不知到底在玩什麽把戏？」"
msgstr "In a small inn on the west side of the square, a youth of about fourteen asked the waiter, \"These folks are awful mysterious. What game are they playing?\""

msgid "小二抄起脖子上的毛巾，抹了抹脸，说道：「小哥您有所不知，这些个爷儿们可是大内来的高手，这次是奉了咱们皇上的命令，要去岚城找一把叫做什麽『旋芒宝剑』的，那骑马的官爷所称的白道长，便是咱们这附近有名的太乙观观主....」"
msgstr "The waiter pulled the towel off his neck and mopped his face. \"You wouldn't know, friend — these fine gentlemen are masters from the Palace itself. His Majesty sent them to Lancheng, the Wind City, to find some sword they call the Whirling Edge. And the Daoist Bai that rider mentioned, he's the abbot of Taiyi Abbey, famous round these parts....\""

msgid "少年奇道：「岚城？那是什麽地方？怎麽我从小到大不曾听过有这个地方？」"
msgstr "The youth was puzzled. \"Lancheng? Where's that? I've never heard of it in my whole life.\""

msgid "少年听著出了神，怔怔地望著外面的天空，一朵朵的浮云飘来飘去，他的心思也不由自主地飞了起来。"
msgstr "The youth listened, spellbound, gazing at the sky outside. Cloud after cloud drifted past, and the youth's thoughts drifted off with them."

msgid "那少年，便是你。"
msgstr "That youth was you."

msgid "寻剑令"
msgstr "The Sword Decree"

msgid "大内高手在找一把剑。去西南二十四里的黄石隘口，看他们找什么。"
msgstr "Palace masters are hunting for a sword. Go to Yellow Rock Pass, twenty-four li southwest, and see what they're after."

msgid "在黄石隘口看着官队挖出石匣、又被黑衣道士抢走"
msgstr "Watched the officials dig up a stone casket at Yellow Rock Pass — and a Daoist in black snatch it away"

msgid "跟店小二打听广场上的「官爷」。"
msgstr "Ask the waiter about the \"officials\" in the square."

msgid "店小二说外头广场上来了大内的官爷，叫你去瞧瞧。"
msgstr "The waiter says officials from the Palace have turned up in the square outside, and you should go take a look."

msgid "去镇前的广场，看看官爷们在做什么。"
msgstr "Go to the square at the edge of town and see what the officials are up to."

msgid "冯策叫信使大声报了方位：西南二十四里，黄石隘口。"
msgstr "Feng Ce had the messenger call out the bearing: southwest, twenty-four li, Yellow Rock Pass."

msgid "在广场上当面向大内的总教头问了寻剑的事"
msgstr "Asked the Palace's chief instructor about the sword hunt, face to face in the square"

msgid "围观的江湖客悄悄告诉你：官爷们要去西南二十四里的黄石隘口。"
msgstr "A wanderer in the crowd tells you quietly: the officials are headed for Yellow Rock Pass, twenty-four li southwest."

msgid "在广场上向围观的江湖人打听了官队的去处"
msgstr "Asked the onlookers in the square where the officials were headed"

msgid "去西南二十四里的黄石隘口，看他们找什么。"
msgstr "Go to Yellow Rock Pass, twenty-four li southwest, and see what they're after."

msgid "你到了黄石隘口。官队正在山壁下挖土，白道长守在坑边。"
msgstr "You reach Yellow Rock Pass. The officials are digging at the foot of the cliff, and Daoist Bai stands watch by the pit."

msgid "看官队在山壁下挖什么。"
msgstr "See what the officials are digging for under the cliff."

msgid "官队挖出一只刻着风纹的石匣；一个黑衣黑冠的道士从崖上掠下，抢了匣子就逃，掉下一块布条。白道长说匣里是岚城的风铃。"
msgstr "The officials unearth a stone casket carved with wind patterns. A Daoist in a black robe and black cap swoops down from the cliff, grabs the casket and runs, dropping a strip of cloth. Daoist Bai says the casket held Lancheng's wind bells."

msgid "拾起黑衣道士掉下的布条。"
msgstr "Pick up the strip of cloth the Daoist in black dropped."

msgid "布条上刻着老松寨的记号：黑衣道士往老松岭去了。"
msgstr "The strip bears the mark of Old Pine Stockade: the Daoist in black went toward Old Pine Ridge."

