msgstr "{npc}{action}"

msgid "{npc}说道：{line}"
msgstr "{npc} says, \"{line}\""

msgid "{npc}在你的耳边悄声说道：{line}"
msgstr "{npc} whispers in your ear, \"{line}\""

msgid "这里"
msgstr "Here"

msgid "名字"
msgstr "Name"

msgid "传闻"
msgstr "Rumors"

msgid "%s摇摇头，说道：没听说过。"
msgstr "\"Never heard of it,\" says %s, with a shake of the head."

msgid "%s睁大眼睛望著你，显然不知道你在说什麽。"
msgstr "%s stares at you wide-eyed, plainly with no idea what you're on about."

msgid "%s耸了耸肩，很抱歉地说：无可奉告。"
msgstr "%s shrugs apologetically. \"Nothing I can tell you.\""

msgid "%s说道：嗯....这我可不清楚，你最好问问别人吧。"
msgstr "\"Hmm... can't say I know,\" says %s. \"Better ask someone else.\""

msgid "%s想了一会儿，说道：对不起，你问的事我实在没有印象。"
msgstr "%s thinks for a moment. \"Sorry — I can't recall a thing about that.\""

msgid "你向{npc}问道：敢问{respect}尊姓大名？"
msgstr "You ask {npc}, \"May I ask your name, {respect}?\""

msgid "你向{npc}问道：这位{respect}，{self}初到贵宝地，不知这里有些什麽风土人情？"
msgstr "You ask {npc}, \"I'm new to these parts, {respect}. What should I know about the place?\""

msgid "你向{npc}问道：这位{respect}，不知最近有没有听说什麽消息？"
msgstr "You ask {npc}, \"Heard any news lately, {respect}?\""

msgid "你向{npc}打听有关『{topic}』的消息。"
msgstr "You ask {npc} about \"{topic}.\""

msgid "但是很显然的，%s现在的状况没有办法给你任何答覆。"
msgstr "But plainly, %s is in no state to give you any answer."

msgid "{npc}对你把眼一瞪：{self}的名字是可以随便提的吗？！我看你这{rude}是活腻了！"
msgstr "{npc} glares at you. \"Who are you to throw my name around?! Tired of living, you {rude}?\""

msgid "{npc}对你哈哈一笑：{npc}便是{self}！"
msgstr "{npc} laughs. \"{npc}? That'd be me!\""

msgid "{npc}对你作了一揖：这位{respect}可真会开玩笑，怎么会突然问起{self}的名字？"
msgstr "{npc} clasps hands and bows. \"You're quite the joker, {respect}. Why ask my name all of a sudden?\""

msgid "{npc}对你说道：这里是{place}，至于其它的，{self}不便多说。"
msgstr "{npc} tells you, \"This is {place}. As for the rest — not for me to say.\""

