msgid "他没手了，你还有 {left} 手"
msgstr "Opponent's out of beats — you have {left} left"

msgid "他起手：%s"
msgstr "Opponent opens with: %s"

msgid "；出手后自己要忙 {busy} 手"
msgstr "; then busy for {busy}"

msgid "不够：{name}要 {cost} 手，你还剩 {left} 手"
msgstr "Not enough: {name} needs {cost}, you have {left}"

msgid "{name}占 {cost} 手，出完还剩 {after} 手"
msgstr "{name} takes {cost}, leaving {after}"

msgid "{name}占 {cost} 手，出完你这回合没手了，他连出 {theirs} 手"
msgstr "{name} takes {cost} — you're out after it, and they get {theirs} in a row"

msgid "{name}占 {cost} 手，出完你这回合没手了"
msgstr "{name} takes {cost} — you're out after it"

msgid "忙"
msgstr "Busy"

msgid "停"
msgstr "Stopped"

msgid "加力 +%d"
msgstr "Extra Force +%d"

msgid "改为自动"
msgstr "Switch to Auto"

msgid "改为手动"
msgstr "Switch to Manual"

msgid "现在：每一手等你出招；按下后战斗自己打，手自动补满、演出加快。"
msgstr "Now: every beat waits for your move. Press to let the fight play itself — beats refill on their own and the show speeds up."

msgid "现在：战斗自己打；按下后每一手等你出招。"
msgstr "Now: the fight plays itself. Press to choose every beat yourself."

msgid "{tag} · {cost} 手"
msgstr "{tag} · ×{cost}"

msgid "等你空下来"
msgstr "Waiting till you're free"

msgid "就绪"
msgstr "Ready"

msgid "战斗记录"
msgstr "Battle Log"

msgid "天邪虎啸要耗 {force} 点内力。啸声会震伤这里每一个人的神；没能抵住的人，不管是谁，都会对你下杀手，切磋也会变成生死相搏。\n确定要发出虎啸吗？"
msgstr "The Wayward Tiger Roar costs {force} Inner Force. The roar wounds the Spirit of everyone here; anyone who can't withstand it — whoever they are — will try to kill you, and even a spar becomes a fight to the death.\nRoar anyway?"

msgid "在战斗中运功压制杀气，可能当场昏倒：以你现在的定力和内功，{odds}。昏倒以后，要杀你的人不会停手。\n确定要压制杀气吗？"
msgstr "Suppressing your Bloodlust mid-fight may knock you out on the spot. With your Resolve and inner arts as they are, {odds}. Once you're out, anyone trying to kill you won't stop.\nSuppress your Bloodlust?"

msgid "召天将要耗 {mana} 点法力和 {sen} 点神。天将一来就会对你的对手下杀手，对手也会杀它，切磋就变成生死相搏，你的对手可能会死。天将杀的人都算在你头上，杀了师父便是弑师。\n确定要召唤天将吗？"
msgstr "Summoning a heavenly general costs {mana} Arcane Power and {sen} Spirit. The general will try to kill your opponent the moment it arrives, and your opponent will fight back — a spar becomes a fight to the death, and your opponent may die. Every kill it makes counts as yours; if it kills your shifu, you've killed your own master.\nSummon a heavenly general?"

msgid "召护法要耗 {mana} 点法力和 {sen} 点神。来的天将或阴鬼卒会对你的对手下杀手，对手也会杀它，切磋就变成生死相搏，你的对手可能会死。它杀的人都算在你头上，杀了师父便是弑师。\n确定要召护法吗？"
msgstr "Calling a guardian costs {mana} Arcane Power and {sen} Spirit. The heavenly general or ghost soldier that comes will try to kill your opponent, and your opponent will fight back — a spar becomes a fight to the death, and your opponent may die. Every kill it makes counts as yours; if it kills your shifu, you've killed your own master.\nCall a guardian?"

msgid "来相助的护法会替你杀{npc}。{npc}不是你亲手杀的，你会昏倒，也悟不到咒术的道理。\n确定要召唤吗？"
msgstr "The guardian that comes will kill {npc} for you. Since {npc} won't die by your own hand, you'll pass out, and you won't grasp the secret of the spell.\nSummon anyway?"

msgid "胜"
msgstr "Won"

msgid "败"
msgstr "Lost"

msgid "失衡"
msgstr "Off balance"

msgid "露空"
msgstr "Exposed"

msgid "{name}又出{count}招 {results}"
msgstr "{name} throws {count} more: {results}"

msgid "战斗无法正常结束，不会自动重试。"
msgstr "The fight couldn't end properly. It won't be retried on its own."

msgid "目标：%s"
msgstr "Target: %s"

msgid "战斗描写会显示在这里。"
msgstr "The fight's blow-by-blow shows up here."

msgid "换目标"
msgstr "Switch Target"

msgid "（-%d）"
msgstr "(-%d)"

msgid "换目标：%s"
msgstr "Switch target: %s"

msgid "召唤天将"
msgstr "Summon a Heavenly General"

msgid "确定施展"
msgstr "Cast It"

msgid "确定攻击"
msgstr "Attack"

msgid "发出虎啸"
msgstr "Roar"

msgid "一定会昏倒"
msgstr "You will pass out"

msgid "昏倒的可能很小"
msgstr "Little chance of passing out"

msgid "约有 {tenths} 成会昏倒"
msgstr "About {tenths} in 10 that you pass out"

msgid "下令：%s"
msgstr "Command: %s"

msgid "对手倒下了，先在右边的旗上选「了结」或「放过」。"
msgstr "Your opponent is down. First choose Finish or Spare on the banner to the right."

msgid "取消：%s"
msgstr "Cancel: %s"

msgid "饮风客栈"
msgstr "Drinkwind Inn"

msgid "你现在正站在雪亭镇南边的一家小客栈里，这家客栈虽小，却是方圆\n五百里内最负盛名的一家，客栈的主人据说是一位云游四海的仙人，如果\n你的福缘深厚的话，也许可以在这里遇到他。除此之外，来自各地的旅人\n都喜欢聚集在这里交换旅途上的见闻，你也可以在这里打听到许多有趣的\n消息。靠近门口的地方有一块乌木雕成的招牌(sign)。\n西北边有一个红木门(door)，门上泛著一层白色的光晕，一种令人感觉\n很有力量，又很柔和的光芒。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in a small inn on the south side of Snow Pavilion. Small as it is, it's the best-known inn for five hundred li around. Its owner, they say, is an immortal who wanders the four seas — if your Fortune runs deep, you might meet him here. Travelers from all over gather here to swap news of the road, so you can pick up plenty of interesting gossip too. Near the door hangs a signboard carved from ebony (sign). To the northwest is a redwood door (door), glowing with a faint white halo — a light that feels both powerful and gentle."

msgid "广场"
msgstr "Town Square"

msgid "这里是雪亭镇镇前广场的空地，地上整齐地铺著大石板。广场中央有\n一个木头搭的架子，经过多年的风吹日晒雨淋，看来非常破旧。四周建筑\n林立。往西你可以看到一间客栈，看来生意似乎很好。\n"
msgstr "This is the open square at the front of Snow Pavilion, paved with neat flagstones. In the middle stands a wooden rack, so weathered by years of wind, sun and rain that it looks ready to fall apart. Buildings crowd round on every side. To the west you can see an inn that seems to be doing good business."

msgid "雪亭镇街道"
msgstr "Snow Pavilion Street"

msgid "你现在正走在雪亭镇的街道上，东边不远处有一间高大的院子，门\n口立著一根粗大的旗杆，旗子上写著「淳风武馆」，往南只听得人声鼎\n沸，是个五十尺见方的广场，人来人往相当热闹。往北可望见一座牌坊\n，年代久远，上面的字迹早已看不出是什么字，出了牌坊就是镇外。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a street in Snow Pavilion. Not far to the east is a tall compound; a thick flagpole stands at its gate, and the banner reads \"Pure Wind Hall.\" To the south comes the roar of a crowd — a square fifty feet on a side, busy with people coming and going. To the north you can see an archway, so old its inscription has long worn away. Past the archway lies the open country."

msgid "淳风武馆大门"
msgstr "Pure Wind Hall Gate"

msgid "你现在正站在一间大宅院的入口，两只巨大的石狮镇守在大门的两\n侧，一阵阵吆喝与刀剑碰撞的声音从院子中传来。通过红漆大门(door)\n往东可以望见许多身穿灰衣的汉子正在操练。\n"
msgstr "You stand at the entrance of a great compound. Two huge stone lions guard either side of the gate, and shouts and the clash of blades drift out from the yard. Through the red-lacquered door (door) to the east, you can see a crowd of men in grey at their drills."

msgid "淳风武馆教练场"
msgstr "Pure Wind Hall Training Ground"

msgid "你现在正站在一个宽敞的教练场中，地上铺著黄色的细砂，许多人\n正在这里努力地操练著，北边是一间高大的兵器厅，往东则是武馆师父\n们休息的大厅。\n"
msgstr "You stand on a wide training ground covered in fine yellow sand, where many people are hard at their drills. To the north is a tall armory; to the east, the hall where the teachers rest."

msgid "淳风武馆大厅"
msgstr "Pure Wind Hall, Main Hall"

msgid "这里是淳风武馆的正厅，五张太师椅一字排开面对著门口，这是武\n馆中四位大师傅与馆主柳淳风的座位，和一般武馆不同的是，墙上竟然\n挂著几幅风骨颇为不俗的书画，显示这里的主人并非大字不识的粗汉，\n而是文武双全的高人。\n"
msgstr "This is the main hall of Pure Wind Hall. Five grand armchairs stand in a row facing the door — the seats of the four senior teachers and the master, Liu Chunfeng. Unlike most martial halls, the walls here hang with paintings and calligraphy of real character: the master of this house is no unlettered brawler, but a man of both pen and sword."

msgid "饮风客栈二楼"
msgstr "Drinkwind Inn, Upstairs"

msgid "你现在来到了饮风客栈的二楼，这家客栈有个很奇怪的规矩，就是只留宿\n名头够大的客人，如果你只是一个无名小卒，不论出再多银两都租不到一间空\n房，墙边有一道楼梯通往一楼的茶座。\n"
msgstr "You've come up to the second floor of Drinkwind Inn. The inn has one odd rule: it only lodges guests with a big enough name. If you're a nobody, no amount of silver will get you an empty room. A staircase along the wall leads down to the tea room."

msgid "客房"
msgstr "Guest Room"

msgid "这是一间打扫得相当乾净的客房，虽然所有的家俱看起来都相当朴\n素，比不上县城里几家著名的大酒馆，但是自有一种敦厚亲切的感觉，\n你在这里相信可以安心的休息。\n"
msgstr "A guest room swept quite clean. The furniture is plain — nothing to match the famous taverns in the county town — but there's a warm, honest homeliness to it. You can rest easy here."

msgid "天井"
msgstr "Courtyard"

msgid "这里是淳风武馆中的天井，往西走可以回到正厅，往北边是书房，\n南边是招待客人的厢房，往东一条长廊通往武馆内院，天井中种满了许\n多奇花异草，中央立著一根石柱(pillar)，上面似乎刻著字。\n"
msgstr "This is the courtyard of Pure Wind Hall. West leads back to the main hall; north is the study; south, the guest wing. To the east a long gallery runs to the hall's inner court. The courtyard is full of rare flowers and plants, and in the middle stands a stone pillar (pillar) that seems to have words carved on it."

msgid "武馆内院"
msgstr "Inner Court"

msgid "这里是淳风武馆的内院，平常武馆弟子没有馆主的允许是不敢到这\n里来的，往东是柳家的祠堂，馆主和家眷的卧房分别位于往北一条走道\n的两旁，厨房以及柴房、仆役的卧房都在往南的走道两旁，往西则是天\n井。\n"
msgstr "This is the inner court of Pure Wind Hall. Disciples don't dare come here without the master's leave. To the east is the Liu family shrine; the bedrooms of the master and his family line the passage to the north, while the kitchen, woodshed and servants' rooms line the passage to the south. West is the courtyard."

msgid "刘安禄是淳风武馆的门房，除了馆主柳淳风没有人知道他的出身来历，只知\n到他的武艺不弱，一手快刀在这一带罕有敌手。\n"
msgstr "Liu Anlu is the gatekeeper of Pure Wind Hall. Nobody but the master, Liu Chunfeng, knows where he came from — only that his martial skill is no joke, and few in these parts can match his quick saber."

msgid "刘安禄说道：你当这里是什么地方，敢来这里撒野？\n"
msgstr "Liu Anlu says, \"What do you take this place for? Come to make trouble, have you?\""

msgid "刘安禄说道：想我堂堂....呃....连我这个淳风武馆的小小的门房都可以收拾你！\n"
msgstr "Liu Anlu says, \"I, the great... er... even a lowly gatekeeper of Pure Wind Hall can deal with the likes of you!\""

msgid "刘安禄忽然挥出一刀，招数精奇，但是刀到中途忽然像是想起什么，急忙收招。\n"
msgstr "Liu Anlu suddenly lashes out with his saber — a strange, clever stroke — but halfway through he seems to remember something and hastily pulls it back."

msgid "刘安禄说道：你快走吧，就算我输了你啦....\n"
msgstr "Liu Anlu says, \"Just go, would you. Fine — call it your win...\""

msgid "刘老三"
msgstr "Liu the Third"

msgid "大寨主"
msgstr "The Chief"

msgid "刘安禄望着北边，低声道：大哥……\n"
msgstr "Liu Anlu looks north and says under his breath, \"Big Brother...\""

msgid "刘安禄叫道：老子已经认输了，你还要怎样！\n"
msgstr "Liu Anlu shouts, \"I already gave up! What more d'you want from me?!\""

msgid "你看到一位身材高大的汉子，正在辛苦地操练著。\n"
msgstr "You see a big, strapping man hard at his drills."

msgid "这位店小二正笑咪咪地忙著，还不时拿起挂在脖子上的抹布擦脸。\n"
msgstr "The waiter is bustling about with a grin, now and then wiping his face with the cloth hung round his neck."

msgid "老鼠"
msgstr "Rats"

msgid "楼上"
msgstr "Upstairs"

msgid "白衣人"
msgstr "Men in White"

msgid "官爷"
msgstr "The Officials"

msgid "请柬"
msgstr "Invitation"

msgid "柳绘心是淳风武馆馆主柳淳风的独生女。\n"
msgstr "Liu Huixin is the only daughter of Liu Chunfeng, master of Pure Wind Hall."

msgid "柳绘心秀眉微蹙，说道：喂！我哪里得罪你了？干嘛这样跟我拼死拼活？\n"
msgstr "Liu Huixin knits her brows. \"Hey! What did I ever do to you? Why fight me like your life depends on it?\""

msgid "柳绘心不住地望著窗外：你还是快走吧，我没空陪你练功夫！\n"
msgstr "Liu Huixin keeps glancing out the window. \"You'd better go. I don't have time to train with you!\""

msgid "竹书"
msgstr "The Bamboo Book"

msgid "北宗"
msgstr "North Branch"

msgid "跟柳绘心立北宗：封山的剑往外传。\n你转入封山剑派北宗，和她同辈；她把自己悟出来的「点」字诀教给你。柳淳风不再教你武功，「掌门传人」的名分没有了。这不算叛师：评价不清零，也不记背叛。封山在虹台上的那一票，会被颜违拿「给北宗一个座」来换（已经入了虹台的席的，这一票不再跟着变）。\n这是封山这条线的大分裂，选了不能改。要跟她吗？"
msgstr "Stand with Liu Huixin and found the North Branch: Empty Mountain's sword will be taught to outsiders.\nYou move to the Empty Mountain School's North Branch, as her equal, and she teaches you the \"Point\" technique she worked out herself. Liu Chunfeng will teach you no more, and the title of Master's heir is gone. This doesn't count as betraying your shifu: your Standing isn't wiped and no betrayal is recorded. Yan Wei will trade Empty Mountain's vote on the Rainbow Terrace for \"a seat for the North Branch\" (once seats are taken on the Rainbow Terrace, the vote no longer changes).\nThis is the great split in the Empty Mountain line, and it can't be undone. Go with her?"

msgid "点字诀"
msgstr "The Point Technique"

msgid "虹台"
msgstr "Rainbow Terrace"

msgid "这一票"
msgstr "This Vote"

msgid "请柳绘心把北宗这一票交给你：正月十七虹台上，封山的座听你的——颜违许的那个座还是北宗的，这一票不再投他。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Ask Liu Huixin to hand the North Branch's vote to you: on the seventeenth, on the Rainbow Terrace, Empty Mountain's seat goes the way you say. The seat Yan Wei promised stays with the North Branch, but the vote no longer goes to him.\nSay it?"

msgid "把《悟疾风劲竹书》交给柳绘心。\n她会头一回读到父亲年轻时写的字。书只有这一本，给出去就读不到了；柳淳风不会再见到它。\n要交给她吗？"
msgstr "Give \"Bamboo Against the Gale\" to Liu Huixin.\nShe'll read her father's young hand for the first time. There's only this one copy: once you give it away you can't read it, and Liu Chunfeng will never see it again.\nGive it to her?"

msgid "柳淳风是个相当高大的中年儒生，若不是从他腰间挂著的「玄苏剑」你\n大概猜不到眼前这个温文儒雅的中年人竟是家大武馆的馆主。\n"
msgstr "Liu Chunfeng is a tall, middle-aged scholar. If not for the sword hanging at his waist, you'd hardly guess that this gentle, cultured man is master of a great martial hall."

msgid "本宗"
msgstr "Our School"

msgid "跟柳淳风守本宗：封山的剑不外传。\n他亲传你「点」字诀，你是掌门传人；柳绘心会离开武馆，带着「北宗」两个字去绮云镇。封山在虹台上的那一票跟着柳淳风——等盟主回来（已经入了虹台的席的，这一票不再跟着变）。\n这是封山这条线的大分裂，选了不能改。要跟师父吗？"
msgstr "Keep faith with Liu Chunfeng and the school: Empty Mountain's sword is not taught to outsiders.\nHe personally teaches you the \"Point\" technique, and you become the Master's heir. Liu Huixin will leave the hall, taking the name \"North Branch\" with her to Cloudweave Town. Empty Mountain's vote on the Rainbow Terrace follows Liu Chunfeng — it waits for the Alliance Leader to return (once seats are taken on the Rainbow Terrace, the vote no longer changes).\nThis is the great split in the Empty Mountain line, and it can't be undone. Stand with your shifu?"

msgid "武馆的事"
msgstr "The Hall's Business"

msgid "腰牌"
msgstr "Waist Token"

msgid "逄义"
msgstr "Pang Yi"

msgid "淳风武馆"
msgstr "Pure Wind Hall"

msgid "先人遗志"
msgstr "Our Forebears' Wishes"

msgid "隘口"
msgstr "The Pass"

msgid "老松寨"
msgstr "Old Pine Stockade"

msgid "黑衣道士"
msgstr "The Daoist in Black"

msgid "荐信"
msgstr "Letter of Introduction"

msgid "水烟阁"
msgstr "Waterfog Pavilion"

msgid "请柳淳风把封山这一票交给你：正月十七虹台上，封山听你的——你要站出来，这一票就是你的；不站，就由你说投谁。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Ask Liu Chunfeng to hand Empty Mountain's vote to you: on the seventeenth, on the Rainbow Terrace, Empty Mountain goes the way you say. Stand up yourself and the vote is yours; if not, you decide who gets it.\nSay it?"

msgid "把《悟疾风劲竹书》交给柳淳风。\n他会把它收进匣里，不再示人。书只有这一本，给出去就读不到了；柳绘心也读不到。\n要交给他吗？"
msgstr "Give \"Bamboo Against the Gale\" to Liu Chunfeng.\nHe'll lock it in his box and show it to no one. There's only this one copy: once you give it away you can't read it, and Liu Huixin won't either.\nGive it to him?"

msgid "雪亭镇的头几天"
msgstr "First Days in Snow Pavilion"

msgid "你在饮风客栈醒来，店小二笑着招呼了你。"
msgstr "You wake up in Drinkwind Inn, and the waiter greets you with a grin."

msgid "跟店小二打听「楼上」。"
msgstr "Ask the waiter about \"Upstairs.\""

msgid "店小二说楼上客房闹老鼠，请你上去收拾。"
msgstr "The waiter says the guest rooms upstairs have rats, and asks you to go deal with them."

msgid "上楼收拾老鼠。"
msgstr "Go upstairs and deal with the rats."

msgid "楼上的老鼠都收拾干净了。"
msgstr "The rats upstairs are all cleared out."

msgid "下楼找店小二。"
msgstr "Go back down and find the waiter."

msgid "店小二谢了你一根烤鸡腿。"
msgstr "The waiter thanks you with a roast chicken leg."

msgid "去淳风武馆拜柳淳风为师。"
msgstr "Go to Pure Wind Hall and become Liu Chunfeng's disciple."

msgid "你拜入了封山剑派。"
msgstr "You joined the Empty Mountain School."

msgid "向柳淳风请教基本剑法。"
msgstr "Ask Liu Chunfeng to teach you Basic Sword."

msgid "你跟柳淳风学了基本剑法。"
msgstr "You learned Basic Sword from Liu Chunfeng."

msgid "去武馆和弟子切磋一场，胜了算。"
msgstr "Go to the hall and spar with a disciple. A win counts."

msgid "你第一次在切磋中胜过了武馆弟子。"
msgstr "You beat a hall disciple in a spar for the first time."

msgid "到武学页打坐，把内力练到 10。"
msgstr "Meditate on the Martial Arts page until your Inner Force reaches 10."

msgid "你的内力练到了 10。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force has reached 10."

msgid "再切磋，再打坐：内力练到 25。"
msgstr "Spar again, meditate again: get your Inner Force to 25."

msgid "你的内力练到了 25。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force has reached 25."

msgid "向李教头讨教一场，然后打坐到内力 50。"
msgstr "Ask Instructor Li for a bout, then meditate until your Inner Force reaches 50."

msgid "你的内力练到了 50，够学封山剑法了。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force has reached 50 — enough to learn Empty Mountain Sword."

msgid "向柳淳风请教封山剑法；教练场的木人也等着你。"
msgstr "Ask Liu Chunfeng to teach you Empty Mountain Sword. The wooden dummies on the training ground are waiting for you too."

msgid "你学会了封山剑法。"
msgstr "You learned Empty Mountain Sword."

