msgid "{master}是你的师父。攻击就是生死相搏；若你亲手杀了{master}，便是弑师，等同背叛师门：\n· 被逐出{family}，门派、师父和称号都没有了。\n· 综合评价清零（现在是 {score}）。\n· 背叛师门的次数变成 {next} 次。\n确定要攻击吗？"
msgstr "{master} is your shifu. Attacking means a fight to the death; if you kill {master} with your own hand, you've killed your own master, which counts as betraying your school:\n· You'll be cast out of {family}: no school, no shifu, no title.\n· Your Standing is wiped (it's {score} now).\n· Your count of betrayals becomes {next}.\nAttack anyway?"

msgid "消息记录"
msgstr "Message Log"

msgid "刀剑无眼：有人手持兵刃时，切磋中挨的刀剑会留下真伤，伤重了一样会丧命。\n确定要和{npc}切磋吗？"
msgstr "Blades have no eyes: when someone holds a weapon, cuts taken in a spar are real wounds, and bad enough ones can still kill.\nSpar with {npc}?"

msgid "{npc}不会只跟你点到为止：这一场切磋会变成生死相搏。\n确定要和{npc}切磋吗？"
msgstr "{npc} won't stop at a touch: this spar will turn into a fight to the death.\nSpar with {npc}?"

msgid "{npc}看起来比你强得多：即使只是切磋，一招就可能把你打昏。\n确定要和{npc}切磋吗？"
msgstr "{npc} looks far stronger than you: even in a spar, one blow could knock you out.\nSpar with {npc}?"

msgid "{npc}看起来比你强得多，而且有人手持兵刃：切磋中挨的刀剑会留下真伤，伤重了一样会丧命。\n确定要和{npc}切磋吗？"
msgstr "{npc} looks far stronger than you, and someone holds a weapon: cuts taken in a spar are real wounds, and bad enough ones can still kill.\nSpar with {npc}?"

msgid "施法驱尸要耗去 {sen} 点神，你现在撑不住，会当场昏过去。\n确定要施法吗？"
msgstr "Raising the corpse costs {sen} Spirit, more than you can take right now — you'll pass out on the spot.\nCast anyway?"

msgid "运功「疗伤他人」：把真气输入对方体内，为他疗伤（耗 150 点内力，内力须比最大内力多 150 以上；双方都不能在战斗中）。"
msgstr "Exert \"Heal Another\": pour your true qi into them to heal their wounds (costs 150 Inner Force, and your Inner Force must be at least 150 over its max; neither of you can be in a fight)."

msgid "施展「心识神通」：救醒昏迷的人（50 灵力、30 神）。最大灵力不过 101 必定失败，失败时你自己会昏倒。"
msgstr "Use \"Mind Sense\": revive someone who's unconscious (50 Mystic Power, 30 Spirit). With max Mystic Power of 101 or less it always fails, and when it fails you pass out yourself."

msgid "心识神通要耗去 {atman} 点灵力和 {sen} 点神。能否救醒{npc}，全看你的灵力修为（最大灵力 {max_atman}）：{odds}\n确定要施展吗？"
msgstr "Mind Sense costs {atman} Mystic Power and {sen} Spirit. Whether you can revive {npc} depends entirely on your Mystic Power (max {max_atman}): {odds}\nUse it?"

msgid "最大灵力不过 101 必定失败，失败时你自己会当场昏过去。"
msgstr "With max Mystic Power of 101 or less it always fails, and when it fails you pass out on the spot."

msgid "约有 {percent}% 的机会失败，失败时你自己会当场昏过去。"
msgstr "About a {percent}% chance it fails, and if it does, you pass out on the spot."

msgid "你现在的神撑不住这一下，无论成败都会当场昏过去。"
msgstr "Your Spirit can't take this right now — success or not, you'll pass out on the spot."

msgid "偷窃：从对方身上偷一样东西（三秒后见分晓）。失手被发现，对方会和你拼命，城里的巡捕也会把你当贼抓。"
msgstr "Steal: lift one thing off them (you'll know in three seconds). Get caught, and they'll fight you to the death — and the town's constables will treat you as a thief."

msgid "行贿：塞钱给押着你的巡捕，钱给够了他就放你走；给少了反倒罪加一等。"
msgstr "Bribe: slip money to the constable holding you. Give enough and he lets you go; give too little and it only makes things worse."

msgid "{npc}看起来比你强得多：要是失手被发现，{npc}会和你拼个你死我活。\n确定要下手吗？"
msgstr "{npc} looks far stronger than you: get caught, and {npc} will fight you to the death.\nGo ahead?"

msgid "施法「驱尸」：让这具尸体站起来跟着你（50 法力、30 神）。僵尸靠吸你的灵力维持，灵力不足时就会倒下化为血水。"
msgstr "Cast \"Raise Corpse\": make this body stand up and follow you (50 Arcane Power, 30 Spirit). The zombie lives on your Mystic Power; when that runs low, it falls and melts into blood."

msgid "确定施法驱尸吗？"
msgstr "Cast Raise Corpse?"

msgid "确定施法"
msgstr "Cast It"

