msgid "起身"
msgstr "Get Up"

msgid "正在打斗，歇不下来。"
msgstr "You can't rest in the middle of a fight."

msgid "你精神饱满，用不着歇。"
msgstr "You're full of life. No need to rest."

msgid "你口干舌燥，歇着也回不过精神来：先找水喝。"
msgstr "Your mouth is parched. Rest won't bring you round: find some water first."

msgid "现在歇不下来。"
msgstr "You can't rest right now."

msgid "你歇了{time}，精、气、神都回满了。"
msgstr "You rest for {time}. Essence, Qi and Spirit are full again."

msgid "你歇了{time}，起身活动活动。精、气、神还没全回满：伤要慢慢养，金疮药和运功疗伤快得多。"
msgstr "You rest for {time} and get up to stretch. Essence, Qi and Spirit aren't all back: wounds heal slowly, and wound salve or healing with your inner art is much faster."

msgid "你歇了{time}，站了起来。"
msgstr "You rest for {time}, then stand up."

msgid "你歇了{time}，忽然有人来袭，你一跃而起！"
msgstr "You rest for {time} - then someone attacks, and you leap to your feet!"

msgid "你歇了{time}，身上一阵难受，歇不下去了。"
msgstr "You rest for {time}, but a wave of sickness runs through you and you can't rest on."

msgid "你歇了{time}，口干舌燥，再歇也回不过来：先找水喝。"
msgstr "You rest for {time}. Your mouth is parched and more rest won't help: find some water first."

msgid "你歇了{time}，听见动静，站了起来。"
msgstr "You rest for {time}, hear something and get up."

msgid "你歇了{time}。"
msgstr "You rest for {time}."

msgid "连"
msgstr "Chain"

msgid "对方打空得 1 手"
msgstr "+1 beat when they miss"

msgid "近身打中得 1 手"
msgstr "+1 beat on a close hit"

msgid "换招连打得 1 手"
msgstr "+1 beat for chaining moves"

msgid "够不着"
msgstr "Out of reach"

msgid "{name}打了个隔，不过依然烂醉如泥。"
msgstr "{name} hiccups, but is still dead drunk."

msgid "你觉得脑中昏昏沉沉，身子轻飘飘地，大概是醉了。"
msgstr "Your head's foggy and your body feels light. You're probably drunk."

msgid "{name}摇头晃脑地站都站不稳，显然是喝醉了。"
msgstr "{name} sways and can barely stand. Plainly drunk."

msgid "你觉得一阵酒意上冲，眼皮有些沉重了。"
msgstr "The wine goes to your head and your eyelids grow heavy."

msgid "{name}脸上已经略显酒意了。"
msgstr "{name} is already looking a little tipsy."

msgid "你中的意寒掌毒发作了！"
msgstr "The Chill Palm poison in you flares up!"

msgid "意寒掌毒"
msgstr "Chill Palm poison"

msgid "你中的火玫瑰毒发作了！"
msgstr "The Fire Rose poison in you flares up!"

msgid "火玫瑰毒"
msgstr "Fire Rose poison"

msgid "你觉得脑中昏昏沉沉，心中空荡荡的，直想躺下来睡一觉。"
msgstr "Your head's foggy and your heart feels hollow. All you want is to lie down and sleep."

msgid "{name}摇头晃脑地站都站不稳，显然是蒙汗药的药力发作了。"
msgstr "{name} sways and can barely stand: the knockout drug is taking hold."

msgid "你中的蛇毒发作了！"
msgstr "The snake venom in you flares up!"

msgid "蛇毒"
msgstr "snake venom"

msgid "{name}({id})。\n"
msgstr "{name} ({id}).\n"

msgid "僵尸追魂符（{name}）"
msgstr "Corpse-Chasing Charm ({name})"

msgid "断掉的{weapon}"
msgstr "broken {weapon}"

msgid "歇到回满's pace and longest rest must not be negative"
msgstr "歇到回满's pace and longest rest must not be negative"

msgid "a run that rests by itself needs 歇到回满 (rest_world_scale)"
msgstr "a run that rests by itself needs 歇到回满 (rest_world_scale)"

msgid "恭喜你！你又完成了一项任务！"
msgstr "Well done! Another task completed!"

msgid "你被奖励了：\n{exp}点实战经验\n{pot}点潜能\n{score}点综合评价"
msgstr "Your reward:\n{exp} Combat Experience\n{pot} Potential\n{score} Standing"

msgid "你亲手杀了自己的师父，被逐出了{family}！"
msgstr "You killed your own Shifu with your own hands and have been thrown out of {family}!"

msgid "弑师等同背叛师门：综合评价清零，背叛师门的次数变成 {count} 次。"
msgstr "Killing your Shifu counts as betraying your school: your Standing drops to zero, and your betrayals now number {count}."

msgid "「意寒睨」之术只能在战斗中使用。"
msgstr "Chill Gaze can only be used in a fight."

msgid "你的内力不够。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force isn't enough."

msgid "你要对谁施展「意寒睨」之术？"
msgstr "Use Chill Gaze on whom?"

msgid "$N眼神忽然发出异光，双瞳犹如两把利刃般盯著$n！"
msgstr "A strange light flares in $N's eyes, and {N:his} pupils fix on $n like two blades!"

msgid "$N很快地转过头去，避开了$n的目光。"
msgstr "$N quickly {N:turn|turns} away from $n's gaze."

msgid "但是$N对$n的注视视若无睹....。"
msgstr "But $N {N:shrug|shrugs} off $n's stare...."

msgid "$N被$n的目光所摄，不自禁地打了个寒噤。"
msgstr "$N {N:are|is} caught by $n's gaze and can't help shivering."

msgid "$N闭目凝神，用谷衣心法的内力运转了一次「灵神诀」..."
msgstr "$N {N:close|closes} {N:his} eyes and {N:run|runs} the Spirit Formula once through the Grain Robe Heart Method..."

msgid "一股青气从$N身上散出，汇聚在$P的顶心，然後缓缓淡去。"
msgstr "A greenish vapor rises off $N, gathers at the crown of {N:his} head, then slowly fades."

msgid "你必须先 enable 一种内功。"
msgstr "You must choose an inner art to use first."

msgid "你只能用 none 表示不运内力，或数字表示每一击用几点内力。"
msgstr "Write \"none\" for no Inner Force, or a number for how many points go into each blow."

msgid "疗伤他人"
msgstr "Heal Another"

msgid "灵神诀"
msgstr "Spirit Formula"

msgid "恢复气"
msgstr "Restore Qi"

msgid "恢复神"
msgstr "Restore Spirit"

msgid "恢复精"
msgstr "Restore Essence"

msgid "提升战斗力"
msgstr "Power Up"

msgid "天邪虎啸"
msgstr "Wayward Tiger Roar"

msgid "意寒睨"
msgstr "Chill Gaze"

msgid "你的气已经恢复到上限了。"
msgstr "Your Qi is already full."

msgid "$N深深吸了几口气，脸色看起来好多了。"
msgstr "$N {N:take|takes} a few deep breaths and {N:look|looks} much better."

msgid "你的神已经恢复到上限了。"
msgstr "Your Spirit is already full."

msgid "$N微一凝神，缓缓地吸了口气，看起来有精神多了。"
msgstr "$N {N:gather|gathers} {N:his} thoughts, {N:draw|draws} a slow breath, and {N:look|looks} far more alert."

msgid "你的精力已经恢复到上限了。"
msgstr "Your Essence is already full."

msgid "$N深深地吸了口气，手脚活动了几下，看起来有活力多了。"
msgstr "$N {N:take|takes} a deep breath, {N:stretch|stretches} {N:his} arms and legs, and {N:look|looks} full of life again."

msgid "( 你上一个动作还没有完成，不能施用内功。)"
msgstr "( You haven't finished what you were doing; you can't use your inner art yet. )"

msgid "你请先用 enable 指令选择你要使用的内功。"
msgstr "Choose the inner art you want to use first."

msgid "你所学的内功中没有这种功能。"
msgstr "None of the inner arts you know can do that."

msgid "战斗中运功疗伤？找死吗？"
msgstr "Heal yourself mid-fight? Got a death wish?"

msgid "你的真气不够。"
msgstr "Your true qi isn't enough."

msgid "你已经受伤过重，只怕一运真气便有生命危险！"
msgstr "Your wounds are too deep: stirring your true qi now could kill you!"

msgid "你全身放松，坐下来开始运功疗伤。"
msgstr "You relax your whole body, sit down and begin to heal yourself with your inner art."

msgid "$N坐了下来运起内功，将手掌贴在$n背心，缓缓地将真气输入$n体内...."
msgstr "$N {N:sit|sits} down, {N:summon|summons} {N:his} inner art, and {N:lay|lays} a palm on $n's back, easing true qi into $n's body...."

msgid "过了不久，$N额头上冒出豆大的汗珠，$n吐出一口瘀血，脸色看起来红润多了。"
msgstr "Before long, beads of sweat stand out on $N's brow; $n {n:cough|coughs} up a mouthful of bad blood and {n:look|looks} much healthier."

msgid "你要用真气为谁疗伤？"
msgstr "Heal whom with your true qi?"

msgid "战斗中无法运功疗伤！"
msgstr "You can't heal with your inner art in the middle of a fight!"

msgid "{name}已经受伤过重，经受不起你的真气震荡！"
msgstr "{name} is too badly hurt to stand the shock of your true qi!"

msgid "你已经在运功中了。"
msgstr "You're already exerting your inner art."

msgid "你现在毫无杀气。"
msgstr "You have no Bloodlust at all right now."

msgid "$N微一凝神，运起天邪神功，放慢呼吸，开始收敛自己的杀气 ...."
msgstr "$N {N:focus|focuses}, {N:summon|summons} the Wayward Art, slows {N:his} breathing and {N:begin|begins} to rein in {N:his} Bloodlust...."

msgid "$N微一凝神，运起天邪神功，全身骨节发出一阵爆豆般的声响！"
msgstr "$N {N:focus|focuses} and {N:summon|summons} the Wayward Art - every joint in {N:his} body cracks like popping beans!"

msgid "天邪虎啸只能在战斗中使用。"
msgstr "Wayward Tiger Roar can only be used in a fight."

msgid "$N深深地吸一口气，开始发出有如猛虎般的啸声！"
msgstr "$N {N:draw|draws} a deep breath and {N:let|lets} out a roar like a tiger's!"

msgid "吃"
msgstr "Eat"

msgid "使用"
msgstr "Use"

msgid "你没有中蛇毒。"
msgstr "You haven't been bitten by a snake."

msgid "但是你中的蛇毒并没有完全清除。"
msgstr "But the venom isn't all gone."

msgid "你终于清除了体内所有的蛇毒！"
msgstr "At last the snake venom is gone from your body!"

msgid "你服下蛇药，顿时感觉好多了。{after}"
msgstr "You take the snake antidote and feel much better at once.{after}"

msgid "体内的蛇毒还剩 {left} 分：每服一剂解去一分，每次毒发也会消退一分。"
msgstr "Venom left in you: {left}. Each dose clears one, and each flare-up burns one off too."

msgid "战斗中不能用药治伤!"
msgstr "You can't treat wounds with medicine mid-fight!"

msgid "你没有受伤啊?"
msgstr "You're not hurt, are you?"

msgid "你敷上金疮药 ."
msgstr "You spread on the wound salve."

msgid "你拿出一朵小花蕊，一口给吞了下去。"
msgstr "You take out a little flower heart and swallow it in one gulp."

msgid "只见你脸上泛起一阵红晕，整个人看起来好多了!"
msgstr "A flush spreads over your face, and you look much better!"

msgid "你拿出一粒仙丹，纳入口中. 吃的太急, 鼻涕眼泪流了满脸.."
msgstr "You take out an elixir and pop it in your mouth. You eat it too fast - snot and tears all over your face..."

msgid "清水"
msgstr "clear water"

msgid "你向{npc}请教有关「{skill}」的疑问。"
msgstr "You ask {npc} about \"{skill}\"."

msgid "你要向谁求教？"
msgstr "Learn from whom?"

msgid "嗯....你得先把%s弄醒再说。"
msgstr "Hmm.... you'd better wake %s up first."

msgid "这项技能你恐怕必须找别人学了。"
msgstr "You'll have to learn this skill from someone else."

msgid "%s神色间似乎对你不是十分信任，也许是想起你从前背叛师门的事情 ...。"
msgstr "%s doesn't seem to trust you much. Perhaps they remember how you once betrayed your school..."

msgid "%s说道：嗯 .... 师父能教你的都教了，其他的你自己练吧。"
msgstr "\"Hmm...,\" says %s. \"I've taught you all a Shifu can. The rest you'll have to practice yourself.\""

msgid "%s说道：虽然你是我门下的弟子，可是并非我的嫡传弟子 ...."
msgstr "\"You're a disciple of my school,\" says %s, \"but not my direct disciple....\""

msgid "%s说道：我只能教你这些粗浅的本门功夫，其他的还是去找你师父学吧。"
msgstr "\"I can only teach you these basic arts of our school,\" says %s. \"For the rest, go to your own Shifu.\""

msgid "%s不愿意教你这项技能。"
msgstr "%s won't teach you this skill."

msgid "这项技能你的程度已经不输你师父了。"
msgstr "You're already as good at this as your Shifu."

msgid "依你目前的能力，没有办法学习这种技能。"
msgstr "With what you can do now, there's no way to learn this skill."

msgid "%s说道：%s"
msgstr "%s says, \"%s\""

msgid "但是%s现在并不准备回答你的问题。"
msgstr "But %s isn't ready to answer your questions just now."

msgid "但是%s显然太累了，没有办法教你什麽。"
msgstr "But %s is plainly too tired to teach you anything."

msgid "你向%s请教，但这次请教无法进行。"
msgstr "You ask %s, but the lesson can't go ahead this time."

msgid "也许是缺乏实战经验，你对%s的回答总是无法领会。"
msgstr "Maybe it's a lack of combat experience, but you can't make sense of %s's answers."

msgid "你听了%s的指导，似乎有些心得。"
msgstr "You listen to %s's guidance and seem to pick something up."

msgid "还能学到 {level} 级（{why}）"
msgstr "Can learn up to level {level} ({why})"

msgid "学不了：{why}"
msgstr "Can't learn: {why}"

msgid "{head}；{problem}。"
msgstr "{head}; {problem}."

msgid "{npc}自己是 {teacher} 级"
msgstr "{npc} is level {teacher}"

msgid "你已学到{npc}的 {teacher} 级"
msgstr "You've reached {npc}'s level {teacher}"

msgid "背叛师门 {count} 次，{npc}只教到 {teacher} - 20×{count} = {cap} 级"
msgstr "Betrayed a school {count} times: {npc} teaches only to {teacher} - 20×{count} = {cap}"

msgid "不是{npc}的嫡传弟子，只学得到{npc}等级（{teacher}）的三分之一左右"
msgstr "Not {npc}'s direct disciple: you can reach only about a third of {npc}'s level ({teacher})"

msgid "背叛师门 {count} 次，{npc}能教你的都教了"
msgstr "Betrayed a school {count} times: {npc} has taught you all {npc} will"

msgid "{level} 级要再学，须实战经验 ≥ {required}"
msgstr "To go past level {level} you need Combat Experience ≥ {required}"

msgid "经验不足，要再学须实战经验 ≥ {required}（你 {have}）"
msgstr "Not enough experience: to learn more you need Combat Experience ≥ {required} (you have {have})"

msgid "学不了：{npc}不肯指点你。"
msgstr "Can't learn: {npc} won't guide you."

msgid "潜能已经用完"
msgstr "Potential is used up"

msgid "{npc}太累了"
msgstr "{npc} is too tired"

msgid "{npc}现在不答问题"
msgstr "{npc} isn't answering questions now"

msgid "精不够：每次耗精 {cost}，精须多于此数"
msgstr "Not enough Essence: each lesson costs {cost}, and you need more than that"

msgid "%s说道：您太客气了，这怎麽敢当？"
msgstr "\"You're too kind,\" says %s. \"I couldn't possibly.\""

msgid "%s像是受宠若惊一样，说道：请教？这怎麽敢当？"
msgstr "%s looks flattered beyond words. \"Learn from me? I couldn't possibly.\""

msgid "%s笑著说道：您见笑了，我这点雕虫小技怎够资格「指点」您什麽？"
msgstr "%s laughs. \"You flatter me. My little tricks are hardly fit to 'guide' someone like you.\""

