msgid "你现在并没有拜任何人为师的意思。"
msgstr "You're not looking to take anyone as your Shifu right now."

msgid "你改变主意不想拜%s为师了。"
msgstr "You change your mind about becoming %s's disciple."

msgid "你恭恭敬敬地向%s磕头请安，叫道：「师父！」"
msgstr "You kowtow to %s with great respect and call out, \"Shifu!\""

msgid "你想拜%s为师，但是对方还没有答应。"
msgstr "You want to become %s's disciple, but they haven't said yes yet."

