msgstr "Choose the mystic powers you want to use first."

msgid "你所选用的法术系中没有这种法术。"
msgstr "The spells you chose have no such spell."

msgid "「封」字诀"
msgstr "\"Seal\" Secret"

msgid "牵制攻击只能对战斗中的对手使用。"
msgstr "A pinning attack only works on someone you're fighting."

msgid "$n目前正自顾不暇，放胆攻击吧！"
msgstr "$n {n:have|has} {n:his} hands full - attack boldly!"

msgid "$N使出封山剑法「封」字诀，连递数个虚招企图扰乱$n的攻势，结果$p被$P攻了个措手不及！"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} the \"Seal\" secret of Empty Mountain Sword, throwing out feint after feint to break up $n's attack - and $n {n:are|is} caught completely off guard!"

msgid "$N使出封山剑法「封」字诀，连递数个虚招企图扰乱$n的攻势，可是$p看破了$P的企图，并没有上当。"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} the \"Seal\" secret of Empty Mountain Sword, throwing out feint after feint to break up $n's attack, but $n {n:see|sees} through it and {n:don't|doesn't} take the bait."

msgid "游识神通"
msgstr "Drifting Sense"

msgid "你要移动到哪一个人身边？"
msgstr "Whose side do you want to move to?"

msgid "你无法感受到这个人的灵力 ...."
msgstr "You can't feel this person's Mystic Power...."

msgid "中止施法。"
msgstr "You stop casting."

