msgstr "You can't use the Drifting Sense in a fight!"

msgid "你的灵力不够！"
msgstr "You don't have enough Mystic Power!"

msgid "游识神通只能对自己使用！"
msgstr "The Drifting Sense can only be used on yourself!"

msgid "你感受到对方的灵力，但是不够强烈。"
msgstr "You feel their Mystic Power, but not strongly enough."

msgid "你因为不够熟练而失败了。"
msgstr "You aren't practiced enough, and fail."

msgid "$N口中喃喃地念著咒文，忽然大喝一声“疾！”"
msgstr "$N {N:mutter|mutters} an incantation, then suddenly {N:shout|shouts}, \"Swift!\""

msgid "只见一道黑气罩在$n身上！"
msgstr "A black vapor closes over $n!"

msgid "只见一道金光罩在$n身上！"
msgstr "A golden light closes over $n!"

msgid "只见一团火焰罩在$n身上！"
msgstr "A ball of flame closes over $n!"

msgid "只听在一声海啸，海水将$n团团围住！"
msgstr "With the roar of a tidal wave, the sea closes in all around $n!"

msgid "只见空中落下无数大木，正把$n困在中央！"
msgstr "Great logs fall out of the sky, pinning $n in the middle!"

msgid "只见$N化作一道黑气，然后消失得无影无踪！"
msgstr "$N {N:turn|turns} into a black vapor and {N:vanish|vanishes} without a trace!"

msgid "只见$N化作一道金光，然后消失得无影无踪！"
msgstr "$N {N:turn|turns} into a streak of golden light and {N:vanish|vanishes} without a trace!"

msgid "只见$N化作一团火焰，然后消失得无影无踪！"
msgstr "$N {N:turn|turns} into a ball of flame and {N:vanish|vanishes} without a trace!"

msgid "只见$N化作一道长虹，然后消失得无影无踪！"
msgstr "$N {N:turn|turns} into a long rainbow and {N:vanish|vanishes} without a trace!"

msgid "只见$N化作一团大雾，然后消失得无影无踪！"
msgstr "$N {N:turn|turns} into a great fog and {N:vanish|vanishes} without a trace!"

msgid "但是$n纵身一跃，脱离了围困。"
msgstr "But $n {n:leap|leaps} clear and {n:break|breaks} free."

msgid "困"
msgstr "Trap"

msgid "遁"
msgstr "Vanish"

msgid "这个法术只能在战斗中使用！"
msgstr "This spell can only be used in a fight!"

msgid "$n正自顾不暇，放胆进攻吧。"
msgstr "$n {n:have|has} {n:his} hands full - attack boldly."

msgid "「缺」字诀"
msgstr "\"Gap\" Secret"

msgid "'缺'字诀只能在战斗中使用。"
msgstr "The \"Gap\" secret can only be used in a fight."

msgid "你要对谁使用'缺'字诀？"
msgstr "Use the \"Gap\" secret on whom?"

msgid "你已经在运用中了。"
msgstr "You're already using it."

msgid "$N剑招陡变，空门大开，诱使$n进招，"
msgstr "$N's sword suddenly changes, leaving {N:himself} wide open to lure $n in,"

msgid "可是$n看破了$N的企图，并没有上当。"
msgstr "but $n {n:see|sees} through $N's plan and {n:don't|doesn't} take the bait."

msgid "$N突然对$n发出奋力一击！"
msgstr "$N suddenly {N:throw|throws} everything into one blow at $n!"

msgid "「玄羽乱舞」"
msgstr "\"Wild Dance of the Dark Feather\""

msgid "「玄羽乱舞」只能在战斗中使用。"
msgstr "\"Wild Dance of the Dark Feather\" can only be used in a fight."

msgid "你的气不够！"
msgstr "You don't have enough Qi!"

msgid "你的真气不够！"
msgstr "You don't have enough true qi!"

msgid "$N使出步玄七诀第一式「玄羽乱舞」，身法陡然加快！"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Wild Dance of the Dark Feather\", the first of the Mystic Step Seven Secrets, and {N:speed|speeds} up all at once!"

