msgstr "$N {N:spin|spins} a few times, then suddenly {N:stop|stops} dead."

msgid "$N迅捷无伦地在$n身旁绕了一圈 ..."
msgstr "$N {N:circle|circles} $n in a blur..."

msgid "但是$N找不到机会出手！"
msgstr "But $N can't find an opening!"

msgid "$N眼睛忽然睁开，喃喃地说道：杀....死....$n...."
msgstr "$N's eyes snap open, and {N:he} {N:mutter|mutters}, \"Kill.... kill.... $n....\""

msgid "你要在这张符上写谁的名字？"
msgstr "Whose name do you write on this charm?"

msgid "心识神通"
msgstr "Heart Sense"

msgid "$N一手放在$n的天灵盖上，一手贴在$n的後心，闭上眼睛缓缓低吟 ..."
msgstr "$N {N:put|puts} one hand on the crown of $n's head and the other on $n's back, {N:close|closes} {N:his} eyes and slowly {N:chant|chants}..."

msgid "你要对谁使用心识神通？"
msgstr "Use the Heart Sense on whom?"

msgid "只有战斗中才能召唤天将！"
msgstr "You can only summon a heavenly general in a fight!"

msgid "你的精神无法集中！"
msgstr "You can't focus your mind!"

msgid "$N喃喃地念了几句咒语。"
msgstr "$N {N:mutter|mutters} a few words of a spell."

msgid "但是什麽也没有发生。"
msgstr "But nothing happens."

