msgstr "( You haven't finished what you were doing; you can't use an outer art yet. )"

msgid "你请先用 enable 指令选择你要使用的外功。"
msgstr "Choose the outer art you want to use first."

msgid "你所使用的外功中没有这种功能。"
msgstr "The outer art you're using can't do that."

msgid "「点」字诀"
msgstr "\"Point\" Secret"

msgid "「点」字诀只能对战斗中的对手使用。"
msgstr "The \"Point\" secret only works on someone you're fighting."

msgid "$N使出封山剑法「点」字诀，可是内力不继，剑尖一颤，手中的剑险些脱手飞出！"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} the \"Point\" secret of Empty Mountain Sword, but {N:his} Inner Force gives out - the sword tip shudders and the blade nearly flies from {N:his} hand!"

