msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} the \"Point\" secret of Empty Mountain Sword, gathering all {N:his} force into the sword tip, and {N:thrust|thrusts} straight at $n!"

msgid "用 {force} 点内力把劲力聚在剑尖，这一剑伤得更重；内力不够，剑会险些脱手，白白耽误几手"
msgstr "Puts {force} Inner Force into the sword tip for a harder hit. Without enough Inner Force the sword nearly slips from your hand and you lose a few beats"

msgid "召天将"
msgstr "Summon a Heavenly General"

