msgstr "You can't draw charms in a fight!"

msgid "你的精神太差了，无法画符。"
msgstr "Your Spirit is too low to draw a charm."

msgid "你所学的法术没有这种符。"
msgstr "The spells you've learned have no such charm."

msgid "紫光"
msgstr "Violet Light"

msgid "$N口中喃喃地念著咒文，左手一挥，手中聚起一团紫光射向$n！"
msgstr "$N {N:mutter|mutters} an incantation and {N:sweep|sweeps} {N:his} left hand; a ball of violet light gathers in it and shoots at $n!"

msgid "结果「嗤」地一声，紫光从$p身上透体而过，拖出一条长长的七彩光气，光气绕了回转过来又从$N顶门注入$P的体内！"
msgstr "With a hiss the violet light passes clean through $n, trailing a long seven-colored glow that curls back and pours in through the crown of $N's head!"

msgid "结果「嗤」地一声，紫光从$p身上透体而过，无声无息地钻入地下！"
msgstr "With a hiss the violet light passes clean through $n and sinks silently into the ground!"

msgid "白光"
msgstr "White Light"

msgid "$N口中喃喃地念著咒文，左手一挥，手中聚起一团白光射向$n！"
