msgstr "With a hiss the white light passes clean through $n, dragging a long trail of black vapor that strikes the ground a few yards off!"

msgid "结果「嗤」地一声，白光从$p身上透体而过，无声无息地钻入地下！"
msgstr "With a hiss the white light passes clean through $n and sinks silently into the ground!"

msgid "青光"
msgstr "Blue Light"

msgid "你失败了！"
msgstr "You failed!"

msgid "$N口中喃喃地念著咒文，左手一挥，手中聚起一团青光射向$n！"
