msgstr "With a hiss the blue light passes clean through $n, dragging a long arrow of blood that strikes the ground a few yards off!"

msgid "结果「嗤」地一声，青光从$p身上透体而过，无声无息地钻入地下！"
msgstr "With a hiss the blue light passes clean through $n and sinks silently into the ground!"

msgid "投降？现在没有人在打你啊....？"
msgstr "Surrender? Nobody's fighting you....?"

msgid "$n向$N求饶，但是$N大声说道：{rude}废话少说，纳命来！"
msgstr "$n {n:beg|begs} $N for mercy, but $N {N:roar|roars}, \"{rude}Enough talk - your life is mine!\""

msgid "$N说道：「不打了，不打了，我投降....。」"
msgstr "$N {N:say|says}, \"No more, no more - I give up....\""

msgid "「逐」字诀"
msgstr "\"Chase\" Secret"

msgid "「逐」字诀只能对战斗中的对手使用。"
msgstr "The \"Chase\" secret only works on someone you're fighting."

