msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} the \"Chase\" secret of Empty Mountain Sword; the sword closes in and its light falls over $n, already struggling."

msgid "$N使出封山剑法「逐」字诀，剑法一紧，剑光罩向$n，$p从容化解"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} the \"Chase\" secret of Empty Mountain Sword; the sword closes in and its light falls over $n, but $n calmly {n:turn|turns} it aside"

