msgid "伪墓"
msgstr "The False Tomb"

msgid "追到黑衣道士，弄清老松寨和那口墓。"
msgstr "Catch the Daoist in Black and get to the bottom of Old Pine Stockade and that tomb."

msgid "查明了瀑布山洞里的墓是假的"
msgstr "Found the tomb in the waterfall cave was a fake"

msgid "顺着布条上的记号去老松岭，沿松树上的刀痕找老松寨。"
msgstr "Follow the marks on the strip of cloth to Old Pine Ridge, and the blade cuts on the pines to Old Pine Stockade."

msgid "松树上的刀痕指向灌木后的一条小径：老松寨藏在林子深处。"
msgstr "The cuts on the pines point to a path behind the brush: Old Pine Stockade is hidden deep in the woods."

msgid "过老松寨的寨门：留下买路钱、叫阵，或者打进去。"
msgstr "Get through the gate of Old Pine Stockade: pay the toll, call them out, or fight your way in."

msgid "你给了寨门的喽罗十两银子买路钱，寨里的人不再拦你。"
msgstr "You give the lackey at the gate ten taels of toll money. The stockade stops getting in your way."

msgid "给老松寨的喽罗付了买路钱"
msgstr "Paid the toll to Old Pine Stockade's lackeys"

msgid "你在寨门外叫阵，喽罗放你进去：常老大在聚义厅等你。"
msgstr "You call them out from outside the gate, and the lackey lets you in: Boss Chang is waiting for you in Brotherhood Hall."

msgid "在老松寨的寨门外叫阵"
msgstr "Called out Old Pine Stockade at its gate"

msgid "你打倒了寨门的喽罗，硬闯进了老松寨。"
msgstr "You knock down the lackey at the gate and force your way into Old Pine Stockade."

msgid "硬闯了老松寨的寨门"
msgstr "Forced the gate of Old Pine Stockade"

msgid "到聚义厅找常老大，问黑衣道士的去向。"
msgstr "Find Boss Chang in Brotherhood Hall and ask where the Daoist in Black went."

msgid "常老大说那道士拿一块金牌买了路，往东边的瀑布去了。"
msgstr "Boss Chang says the Daoist bought his way through with a gold token and went east, to the waterfall."

msgid "你打倒了常老大。他跌坐在熊皮上骂道：那道士拿金牌买的路，往东边的瀑布去了，找他去！"
msgstr "You knock Boss Chang down. He slumps onto his bearskin, cursing: \"The Daoist paid with a gold token and went east to the waterfall. Go find him!\""

msgid "打倒了老松寨的常老大"
msgstr "Beat Boss Chang of Old Pine Stockade"

msgid "从瀑布后面进山洞，找黑衣道士。"
msgstr "Go into the cave behind the waterfall and find the Daoist in Black."

msgid "瀑布后的山洞尽头有一具骸骨和一面刻字的石壁。"
msgstr "At the end of the cave behind the waterfall lie a skeleton and a stone wall with words carved into it."

msgid "拦住黑衣道士。"
msgstr "Stop the Daoist in Black."

msgid "黑衣道士落败，石匣还锁着，留在洞里。"
msgstr "The Daoist in Black is beaten. The stone casket is still locked, and stays in the cave."

msgid "看看洞里的石壁和那具骸骨。"
msgstr "Look at the stone wall in the cave, and the skeleton."

msgid "石壁上的字自称「南危水」，说埋骨于此——可骸骨身量矮小、骨龄不过三十，身边没有剑；字迹深浅如一，是活人慢慢刻的。这不是南危水的墓。"
msgstr "The words on the wall call themselves \"Nan Weishui\" and say his bones are buried here. But the skeleton is short, no more than thirty years old, with no sword beside it; and every stroke is cut to the same depth, slowly, by a living hand. This is not Nan Weishui's tomb."

msgid "处置那具骸骨：安葬他，或者带走他身边的腰牌。"
msgstr "Deal with the skeleton: bury him, or take the waist token beside him."

msgid "你把无名人安葬了，腰牌随他入土。洞顶落下一本《过招要旨》。"
msgstr "You bury the nameless man, and the token goes into the ground with him. A copy of \"Sparring Primer\" drops from the cave roof."

msgid "安葬了瀑布山洞里的无名人"
msgstr "Buried the nameless man in the waterfall cave"

msgid "你拿走了骸骨身边的水烟阁腰牌：金乌徽，背面一个「岭」字。"
msgstr "You take the Waterfog Pavilion waist token from beside the bones: a golden-crow badge, with the word \"Ling\" on the back."

msgid "拿走了瀑布山洞骸骨身边的腰牌"
msgstr "Took the waist token from the bones in the waterfall cave"

msgid "旧案"
msgstr "The Old Case"

msgid "去水烟阁，问清五长老的死。"
msgstr "Go to Waterfog Pavilion and find out how the Fifth Elder died."

msgid "查清了二十年前水烟阁五长老的旧案"
msgstr "Got to the bottom of Waterfog Pavilion's old case of the Fifth Elder, twenty years back"

msgid "回雪亭镇淳风武馆，把山洞里的事告诉柳淳风。"
msgstr "Go back to Pure Wind Hall in Snow Pavilion and tell Liu Chunfeng what was in the cave."

msgid "柳淳风写了一封引荐信，让你去水烟阁找他的结拜义弟、执法使潘军禅；他说二十年前失在老松岭的那趟镖是振远镖局押的。"
msgstr "Liu Chunfeng writes a letter of introduction and sends you to Waterfog Pavilion, to his sworn brother the Enforcer, Pan Junchan. The escort lost on Old Pine Ridge twenty years ago, he says, was a Far-Road Escorts job."

msgid "去绮云镇振远镖局，问陈剑秋二十年前的失镖。"
msgstr "Go to the Far-Road Escorts in Cloudweave Town and ask Chen Jianqiu about the escort lost twenty years ago."

msgid "陈剑秋拿出二十年前的镖单：押的是水烟阁盟主印一方、密件一匣，失镖于老松岭，无一人生还。振远至今不提这桩丢人事。"
msgstr "Chen Jianqiu brings out the waybill from twenty years ago: one seal of the Waterfog Pavilion's Alliance Leader and one casket of secret papers, lost on Old Pine Ridge, no one left alive. The Far-Road Escorts still don't speak of that shame."

msgid "上水烟阁的山，看葬剑亭里的碑。"
msgstr "Climb Waterfog Pavilion's mountain and read the stone in the Sword Tomb Pavilion."

msgid "葬剑亭碑：第四代七长老以奸计害人，被众武者合力击杀，甲辰年立亭为后人殷鉴。"
msgstr "The stone of the Sword Tomb Pavilion: the Seventh Elder of the fourth generation did harm by treachery and was slain by the martial folk together; the pavilion was raised in a Jiachen year as a warning to those who come after."

msgid "看虹谷石台的碑。"
msgstr "Read the stone on the terrace in Rainbow Gorge."

msgid "虹谷石台碑：乙丑年，第六代阁主关雨楼立——正是失镖那年。字是用手指在岩石上写的，和山洞石壁上的刻字是一个手法。"
msgstr "The stone on the terrace in Rainbow Gorge: raised by Guan Yulou, sixth Head of the Pavilion, in a Yichou year - the very year the escort was lost. The words were written into the rock with a finger, the same way as the words on the cave wall."

msgid "上楼找五长老南危水，拿证据问他山洞里的骸骨。"
msgstr "Go upstairs to the Fifth Elder, Nan Weishui, and put the skeleton in the cave to him with your proof."

msgid "南危水承认了：山洞里死的是他的随从阿岭，伏击的是白衣武官，盟主卫沧澜被带走。他装死二十年，是怕哥哥槐阳王知道朝廷伏击了自己的弟弟会反。"
msgstr "Nan Weishui admits it: the one who died in the cave was his attendant, A Ling. The ambush was the Officer in White's, and the Alliance Leader, Wei Canglan, was taken away. He has played dead for twenty years for fear his brother, the Prince of Huaiyang, would rebel if he learned the court had ambushed his own brother."

msgid "拿着引荐信到前厅找执法使潘军禅，问「邪剑穿灵」。"
msgstr "Take the letter of introduction to the Enforcer, Pan Junchan, in the front hall and ask him about \"the evil sword Spiritpiercer.\""

msgid "潘军禅说那把邪剑穿灵是仿剑、是鱼饵：去年一个黑衣道士来试过它，往野羊山北麓去了。"
msgstr "Pan Junchan says the evil sword Spiritpiercer is a copy - bait. Last year a Daoist in black came to try it, then went off to the North Foot of Goathill."

msgid "替南危水保密（他欠你一个人情，到了关北替你引见他哥哥槐阳王），还是告诉七长老颜违（颜违借这件事坐稳代盟主，南危水不会再和你同路）？"
msgstr "Keep Nan Weishui's secret (he'll owe you, and Beyond the Pass he'll introduce you to his brother, the Prince of Huaiyang), or tell the Seventh Elder, Yan Wei (Yan Wei will use it to settle in as acting Alliance Leader, and Nan Weishui won't walk with you again)?"

msgid "你替南危水保了密。他说，到了关北，他替你引见槐阳王。"
msgstr "You keep Nan Weishui's secret. Beyond the Pass, he says, he'll introduce you to the Prince of Huaiyang."

msgid "替水烟阁五长老南危水保住了二十年的秘密"
msgstr "Kept the twenty-year secret of Nan Weishui, Waterfog Pavilion's Fifth Elder"

msgid "你把南危水的事告诉了七长老颜违。颜违当日便以代盟主自居；南危水闭门不出，水烟阁来信告诉了关北。"
msgstr "You tell the Seventh Elder, Yan Wei, about Nan Weishui. That same day Yan Wei calls himself acting Alliance Leader; Nan Weishui shuts his door, and a letter from Waterfog Pavilion goes Beyond the Pass."

msgid "把五长老南危水装死二十年的事告诉了七长老颜违"
msgstr "Told the Seventh Elder, Yan Wei, that the Fifth Elder, Nan Weishui, had played dead for twenty years"

msgid "进野羊山北麓的黑道观，找到失踪的大寨主。"
msgstr "Get into the black Daoist abbey on the North Foot of Goathill and find the missing chief of the stockade."

msgid "查清了逆灵宫纳供的真相"
msgstr "Found out the truth of the Black Palace's tribute"

msgid "黑衣道士往野羊山北麓去了。去打听北麓的道观：野羊寨的黄霸在山路边的土地庙里；淳风武馆的门房刘安禄也知道——若他肯说。"
msgstr "The Daoist in Black went to the North Foot of Goathill. Ask around about the abbey there: Huang Ba of Goathill Stockade is at the Earth God Shrine by the mountain road; Liu Anlu, Pure Wind Hall's gatekeeper, knows too - if he'll talk."

msgid "刘安禄说了：野羊寨的大寨主霍铮是他拜过把子的大哥，半年前被北麓黑砖道观的道士带走，再没回来；那伙人自称逆灵宫。三寨主黄霸接了寨子，每年给道观纳供；他不肯伺候那群道士，才下山做了门房。纳供的车这几天上山，到山路转角，道士从北边山壁的裂口把东西吊上去——道观就在裂口上头。"
msgstr "Liu Anlu talks. Huo Zheng, chief of Goathill Stockade, is his sworn elder brother. Half a year ago the Daoists of the black-brick abbey on the North Foot took him away, and he never came back; they call themselves the Black Palace. The third chief, Huang Ba, took over the stockade and pays the abbey tribute every year; Liu Anlu wouldn't wait on those Daoists, so he came down the mountain and became a gatekeeper. The tribute cart goes up these days. At the bend in the mountain road the Daoists haul the goods up through a crack in the north cliff - the abbey is right above the crack."

msgid "黄霸说了：两年前北麓起了一座黑砖道观，自称逆灵宫，寨里折了一半弟兄；半年前大寨主霍铮、二寨主一前一后没了下落，寨子落到他手里。他打不过那些道士，每年纳供换野羊寨还在山上。今年的车已经上去了，这会儿该到了山路转角。"
msgstr "Huang Ba talks. Two years ago a black-brick abbey went up on the North Foot, calling itself the Black Palace, and the stockade lost half its brothers. Half a year ago the chief, Huo Zheng, and the second chief went missing one after the other, and the stockade fell to him. He can't beat those Daoists, so he pays tribute every year to keep Goathill Stockade on the mountain. This year's cart has already gone up; by now it should be at the bend in the mountain road."

msgid "去野羊山的山路转角，看黄霸的纳供车。"
msgstr "Go to the bend in the Goathill road and look at Huang Ba's tribute cart."

msgid "两个黑衣道士守着一辆盖着油布的车。车上的箱子一只只吊进北边山壁的裂口里——他们不走山路。"
msgstr "Two Daoists in black guard a cart under an oilcloth. The chests on it are hauled one by one up into a crack in the north cliff - they don't use the road."

msgid "逆灵宫就在裂口上头。找到失踪的大寨主霍铮。跟着纳供车上去、打倒押车道士攀绳，或者戴上黑衣道士的黑冠——黄霸那里有一顶。"
msgstr "The Black Palace is right above the crack. Find the missing chief, Huo Zheng. Go up with the tribute cart, knock down the Daoists guarding it and climb the rope, or put on a black Daoist's black cap - Huang Ba has one."

msgid "你进了逆灵宫。"
msgstr "You're inside the Black Palace."

msgid "站稳脚跟，看看这是哪里。"
msgstr "Get your footing and see where you are."

msgid "你缩在供品箱子中间，和纳供一起被吊上了裂口。绞盘旁的道士只当你是箱子。"
msgstr "You curl up among the tribute chests and get hauled up the crack with the goods. The Daoist at the windlass takes you for one more chest."

msgid "混在野羊寨的供品里进了逆灵宫"
msgstr "Got into the Black Palace hidden in Goathill Stockade's tribute"

msgid "你打倒了押车道士，攀着他们的绳子上了裂口。"
msgstr "You knock down the Daoists guarding the cart and climb their rope up the crack."

msgid "打倒押车道士闯进了逆灵宫"
msgstr "Beat the cart's Daoists and broke into the Black Palace"

msgid "你戴上黑冠，押车道士只当你是宫里的人，让你自己攀了上去。"
msgstr "You put on the black cap. The Daoists guarding the cart take you for one of their own and let you climb up yourself."

msgid "戴着黑冠走进了逆灵宫"
msgstr "Walked into the Black Palace wearing a black cap"

msgid "顺着货道往北，进黑砖山门，看看这座道观。戴着黑冠的，道士当你是自己人。"
msgstr "Follow the goods track north, through the black-brick gate, and have a look at this abbey. If you're wearing a black cap, the Daoists take you for one of theirs."

msgid "黑砖的前院：黑幡垂地，香炉里烧的不是香。前殿的门关着，东边的矮房是货栈。"
msgstr "The black-brick front court: black banners trail on the ground, and what burns in the censer isn't incense. The door of the front hall is shut; the low building to the east is a storehouse."

msgid "前殿的门关着。推开殿门进前殿，找到霍铮。"
msgstr "The door of the front hall is shut. Push it open, go in, and find Huo Zheng."

msgid "前殿里没有神像。五个黑冠道士面壁诵逆灵天书，领诵的敲着木鱼，谁进来都不抬头。殿西有门，殿北的门关着。"
msgstr "There is no idol in the front hall. Five black-capped Daoists face the wall chanting the Black Scripture; the lead chanter beats a wooden fish, and none of them looks up at whoever comes in. There is a door on the west side of the hall, and the north door is shut."

msgid "殿西是丹房和账房。账房的案上摊着纳供的账册，翻一翻。"
msgstr "West of the hall are the Elixir Room and the Counting Room. The tribute ledger lies open on the desk in the Counting Room. Leaf through it."

msgid "纳供的不只是金帛，是人：野羊寨三名「入丹房」；关北民夫七名，三名入丹房、四名留用；傅家坡七岁的孩童一名，「留用，待子时」。"
msgstr "The tribute isn't only gold and silk - it's people: three from Goathill Stockade, \"to the Elixir Room\"; seven laborers from Beyond the Pass, three to the Elixir Room and four kept; one child of seven from Fu Family Slope, \"kept, until midnight.\""

msgid "案上还有一叠盖着朱印的文书。"
msgstr "On the desk there's also a stack of papers under a vermilion seal."

msgid "一叠盖着兵部大印的文书：「着逆灵宫代为收管」关北的河工、野羊山的「匪徒」。兵部的印，盖在一座黑道观的账上。"
msgstr "A stack of papers under the great seal of the Ministry of War: \"The Black Palace is charged to take in and hold\" the river workers of Beyond the Pass and the \"bandits\" of Goathill. The Ministry of War's seal, stamped on the books of a black abbey."

msgid "丹房西南角有石阶往下。下地牢，找霍铮。"
msgstr "Stone steps lead down from the southwest corner of the Elixir Room. Go down to the dungeon and find Huo Zheng."

msgid "霍铮锁在西边的牢房里，瘦得脱了形，骂声还在；北边那间是傅家坡的石头，七岁，头上两个小抓揪；东边两个关北来的民夫。三扇铁栅门的钥匙在大弟子玄冥子腰上。"
msgstr "Huo Zheng is locked in the west cell, wasted to nothing, still cursing. In the north cell is Shitou from Fu Family Slope, seven years old, hair in two little tufts; in the east, two laborers from Beyond the Pass. The keys to the three iron grates hang from the belt of the senior disciple, Xuanmingzi."

msgid "牢门开不了，钥匙在大弟子玄冥子腰上。前殿北门后的后殿有诵经声——钥匙该在那里。"
msgstr "The cells won't open: the keys are on the belt of the senior disciple, Xuanmingzi. There's chanting from the rear hall behind the front hall's north door - the keys should be there."

msgid "后殿没有神像，只有一座黑石坛。商玦行「唤首」：黑焰里现出一个无头的黑影，摸索着找什么。商玦把地牢钥匙丢给了玄冥子——「子时开坛，带祭品上来」——退进黑门，玄冥子跟着走了。坛底爬出两个鬼卒。"
msgstr "There's no idol in the rear hall, only an altar of black stone. Shang Jue performs the Calling of the Head: in the black flames a headless black shadow appears, groping for something. Shang Jue tosses the dungeon keys to Xuanmingzi - \"The altar opens at midnight. Bring the offering up\" - and steps back through the black door; Xuanmingzi follows him. Two ghost soldiers crawl out from under the altar."

msgid "坛底爬出来的鬼卒拦在你面前。打退它们。"
msgstr "The ghost soldiers that crawled out from under the altar block your way. Drive them off."

msgid "鬼卒散成黑烟。坛后的黑门开着；地牢的钥匙在狱卒手里了。"
msgstr "The ghost soldiers break up into black smoke. The black door behind the altar is open; the dungeon keys are in the jailer's hands now."

msgid "两件事只来得及做一件：回地牢，狱卒手里有钥匙了，救霍铮和石头；或者穿过黑门追商玦。"
msgstr "There's only time for one of two things: go back to the dungeon - the jailer has the keys now - and save Huo Zheng and Shitou; or go through the black door after Shang Jue."

msgid "你打开了牢门。霍铮和石头跟你走了，关北的民夫自己逃回关北。商玦带着逆灵天书从后山下了崖，玄冥子跟着走了。"
msgstr "You open the cells. Huo Zheng and Shitou come with you, and the laborers from Beyond the Pass make their own way home. Shang Jue goes down the cliff behind the mountain with the Black Scripture, and Xuanmingzi follows him."

msgid "从逆灵宫的地牢里救出了霍铮和石头"
msgstr "Saved Huo Zheng and Shitou from the Black Palace's dungeon"

msgid "你穿过黑门和宫主的居所，追到了后山的崖径。等你再下地牢，狱卒已经动了手。"
msgstr "You go through the black door and the Palace Master's quarters and catch up on the cliff path behind the mountain. By the time you're back in the dungeon, the jailer has already done his work."

msgid "穿过黑门追到了逆灵宫的后山"
msgstr "Went through the black door after them to the back of the Black Palace's mountain"

msgid "带霍铮回野羊山的土地庙。"
msgstr "Take Huo Zheng back to the Earth God Shrine on Goathill."

msgid "黄霸跪下让位，霍铮派弟兄送石头回傅家坡。野羊寨欠你一条命。"
msgstr "Huang Ba kneels and gives up his seat, and Huo Zheng sends brothers to take Shitou home to Fu Family Slope. Goathill Stockade owes you a life."

msgid "追上商玦。"
msgstr "Catch Shang Jue."

msgid "商玦割断绳索下了崖。玄冥子断后，和你一战，倒在崖径上；逆灵天书的残卷落在他身边。"
msgstr "Shang Jue cuts the rope and goes down the cliff. Xuanmingzi holds the rear, fights you, and falls on the cliff path; a fragment of the Black Scripture lies beside him."

msgid "寒於宝衣在晚月庄。守它的人不白给。"
msgstr "Hanyu's Robe is at Latemoon Manor. Whoever guards it won't just hand it over."

msgid "找到了寒於宝衣"
msgstr "Found Hanyu's Robe"

msgid "寒於的宝衣在哪？水烟阁的潘军禅、南危水知道旧事。"
msgstr "Where is Hanyu's Robe? Pan Junchan and Nan Weishui of Waterfog Pavilion know the old story."

msgid "潘军禅说了：当年三件东西各归一处，宝衣归月神族保管。月神族早没了，只剩晚月庄——她们自称人灵区冥的后人，庄里供着神像，池边立着凤凰护庄。守它的人不白给。"
msgstr "Pan Junchan tells you: back then the three things each went to a different keeper, and the robe went to the Moon God clan. The Moon God clan is long gone; only Latemoon Manor is left - they call themselves the descendants of the Human Soul Ouming, keep her statue in the manor, and have phoenixes standing guard by the pool. Whoever guards it won't just hand it over."

msgid "南危水说了：寒於的宝衣当年归月神族保管，月神族的后人在晚月庄，供着人灵区冥的神像。守衣的人几百年没换过。"
msgstr "Nan Weishui tells you: Hanyu's Robe went to the Moon God clan for safekeeping, and the Moon God clan's descendants are at Latemoon Manor, where they keep the statue of the Human Soul Ouming. The robe's keeper hasn't changed in centuries."

msgid "去晚月庄。绮云镇西出镇的石板路尽头。"
msgstr "Go to Latemoon Manor, at the end of the flagstone road out of Cloudweave Town to the west."

msgid "晚月庄的前厅。庄里来的都是找宝衣的人：逍遥派的芙云、天山派的梦玉楼、书房里的老妇和那个蒙面杀手，还有西厢的客人。"
msgstr "The front hall of Latemoon Manor. Everyone here has come for the robe: Fuyun of the Carefree School, Meng Yulou of the Tianshan School, the old woman in the study and that masked killer, and the guest in the west wing."

msgid "西厢的客人安妮儿也在等宝衣。去问她。"
msgstr "Anni'er, the guest in the west wing, is waiting for the robe too. Go ask her."

msgid "安妮儿——东方神教的一代教主——在西厢住了三年。她说她等一件东西，也等一个配得上它的人。"
msgstr "Anni'er - who led the Golden Crow Order in her day - has lived in the west wing for three years. She says she is waiting for a thing, and for someone worthy of it."

msgid "东厢的瑷伦是守衣人。问她宝衣。"
msgstr "Ailun in the east wing is the robe's keeper. Ask her about it."

msgid "瑷伦认了：衣在庄里，她守着，守了几百年——三十七岁的脸。宝衣不白给：接她三鞭，站着不倒，再谈。"
msgstr "Ailun admits it: the robe is in the manor, and she has kept it for centuries - with the face of a woman of thirty-seven. The robe isn't given away: take three lashes of her whip, still standing, and then you'll talk."

msgid "接瑷伦三鞭。倒了可以歇好再来。"
msgstr "Take three lashes from Ailun. If you go down, rest up and come back."

msgid "你接下了瑷伦的三鞭。她收起鞭子，问你一句：你拿它去做什么。"
msgstr "You take Ailun's three lashes. She coils her whip and asks you one thing: what will you do with it?"

msgid "瑷伦问：你拿它去做什么？——为了斩鬼、交给安妮儿，还是不知道。"
msgstr "Ailun asks what you'll do with it: slay the ghost, give it to Anni'er, or you don't know."

msgid "你说：为了斩鬼。瑷伦点头：寒於留它，本来就是为这个。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」。"
msgstr "You say: to slay the ghost. Ailun nods. That's what Hanyu left it for. The robe is in the ice chest in the second secret room, and the chest opens only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court.\""

msgid "对守衣人说，要拿寒於宝衣去斩鬼"
msgstr "Told the robe's keeper you'd take Hanyu's Robe to slay the ghost"

msgid "你说：交给安妮儿。瑷伦的脸冷了下来，却不拦：拿得走就拿。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」。"
msgstr "You say: to give to Anni'er. Ailun's face goes cold, but she doesn't stop you: take it if you can. The robe is in the ice chest in the second secret room, and the chest opens only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court.\""

msgid "对守衣人说，要把寒於宝衣交给安妮儿"
msgstr "Told the robe's keeper you'd give Hanyu's Robe to Anni'er"

msgid "你说：不知道。瑷伦说，不知道比胡说一个好。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」。"
msgstr "You say: you don't know. Ailun says not knowing beats making something up. The robe is in the ice chest in the second secret room, and the chest opens only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court.\""

msgid "对守衣人说，还不知道拿寒於宝衣做什么"
msgstr "Told the robe's keeper you didn't know yet what to do with Hanyu's Robe"

msgid "宝衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」：女子自己跳，男子请内厅的筱薇或禁闭房的芳绫替跳。第二密室从内厅穿堂南边的花门进，或在第一密室跳「有凤来仪」。"
msgstr "The robe is in the ice chest in the second secret room, and the chest opens only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court\": a woman dances it herself; a man asks Xiaowei in the inner hall or Fangling in the confinement room to dance it for him. Reach the second secret room through the flower gate south of the inner hall's passage, or by dancing \"The Phoenix Comes to Court\" in the first secret room."

msgid "冰匣开了。一件月白的衣落在地上，寒气扑面。"
msgstr "The ice chest opens. A moon-white robe falls to the floor, and cold hits your face."

msgid "宝衣到手。交回瑷伦守到决战；交给安妮儿，或者带着它走出晚月庄的大门——宝衣一离开瑷伦，庄就没了护佑，当夜会出事：东方神教派来的杀手会摸进前厅，见人就动手——要打一场；打不过，退出前厅，她不追。"
msgstr "The robe is yours. Give it back to Ailun to keep until the final battle; give it to Anni'er; or walk out of Latemoon Manor's gate with it. Once the robe leaves Ailun, the manor loses its protection and something will happen that night: a killer sent by the Golden Crow Order will slip into the front hall and go for anyone there - you'll have to fight; if you can't win, back out of the front hall and she won't follow."

msgid "你把宝衣交给了安妮儿。她说：月神族守了几百年，守给我的。你配得上——东方神教记得你。"
msgstr "You give the robe to Anni'er. She says: \"The Moon God clan kept it for centuries - kept it for me. You're worthy. The Golden Crow Order will remember you.\""

msgid "把寒於宝衣交给了东方神教的安妮儿"
msgstr "Gave Hanyu's Robe to Anni'er of the Golden Crow Order"

msgid "你把宝衣交回瑷伦。她披上它：我守到决战那日。到时候你来叫我，我跟你下湖底。"
msgstr "You give the robe back to Ailun. She puts it on: \"I'll keep it until the day of the battle. When it comes, call me, and I'll go down to the lake bed with you.\""

msgid "把寒於宝衣留给了守衣人瑷伦"
msgstr "Left Hanyu's Robe with its keeper, Ailun"

msgid "你带着宝衣走出了晚月庄的大门。庄失去了护佑。"
msgstr "You walk out of Latemoon Manor's gate with the robe. The manor has lost its protection."

msgid "带走了寒於宝衣"
msgstr "Took Hanyu's Robe away"

msgid "人证"
msgstr "The Witness"

msgid "兵部的印是真的，令不是先帝的。要动兵部的人，须有人在堂上说。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War's seal is real; the decree isn't the late Emperor's. To move against the Ministry's men, someone has to speak up in court."

msgid "把寻剑令的真相递到了乔阴县的公堂上"
msgstr "Brought the truth of the Sword Decree before the court of Tallshade County"

msgid "带着逆灵宫那叠盖兵部印的文书去乔阴县衙，击门口的大皮鼓。没带文书，侍卫不开门——文书还躺在逆灵宫的账房。"
msgstr "Take the Black Palace's stack of papers with the Ministry of War's seal to Tallshade's Magistrate's Court and beat the big hide drum at the gate. Without the papers, the guard won't open up - the papers are still lying in the Black Palace's Counting Room."

msgid "带刀侍卫从内院出来：是你击鼓申冤吗？——衙门的大门开了。"
msgstr "An armed guard comes out of the inner yard: \"Was it you who beat the drum for justice?\" The gates of the yamen open."

msgid "进大堂，把兵部文书给县官程不平看。"
msgstr "Go into the court hall and show the Ministry of War's papers to the magistrate, Cheng Buping."

msgid "程不平看得出文书是真的，可要动兵部的人，须有人证——印是谁盖的，人去了哪，得有人在堂上说。他指了一个人：福林酒楼里日日发呆、丢了箱子的武官，姓陈。"
msgstr "Cheng Buping can see the papers are genuine, but to move against the Ministry's men he needs a witness - whose hand stamped the seal and where the people went, someone has to say it in court. He points you to a man: the officer named Chen who sits staring into space in Fulin Tavern every day, the one who lost his chest."

msgid "福林酒楼里丢了箱子的武官姓陈。给他看兵部的印。"
msgstr "The officer in Fulin Tavern who lost his chest is named Chen. Show him the Ministry of War's seal."

msgid "陈显祖见了兵部的印脸色就变：他是二十年前老松岭那队白衣武官里的逃兵。当年念给全队听的寻剑令抄本一直藏在他的桃木箱里——箱子丢在树王坟的树洞里。"
msgstr "Chen Xianzu goes pale at the sight of the Ministry's seal: he deserted from that troop of Officers in White on Old Pine Ridge twenty years ago. The copy of the Sword Decree read out to the whole troop has been hidden in his peachwood chest ever since - and the chest is lost in the hollow tree at the Tree King's Tomb."

msgid "寻剑令的抄本在陈显祖的桃木箱里。箱子在树王坟的树洞里——洞里不干净。箱子已经还了他的，问他要抄本。"
msgstr "The copy of the Sword Decree is in Chen Xianzu's peachwood chest. The chest is in the hollow tree at the Tree King's Tomb - and the hollow isn't clean. You've given him back his chest; ask him for the copy."

msgid "寻剑令的抄本到手：「寻剑，不得扰民一户」，一句。底下是当年全队的名字。"
msgstr "The copy of the Sword Decree is yours: \"Seek the sword, and trouble not one household\" - one line. Below it, the names of the whole troop."

msgid "县衙的带刀侍卫是槐阳王的人。问他兵部的令。"
msgstr "The yamen's armed guard is the Prince of Huaiyang's man. Ask him about the Ministry's order."

msgid "槐阳王也收到过兵部「征三千民夫修官道寻剑」的令。老王爷拒了。"
msgstr "The Prince of Huaiyang got the Ministry of War's order too: \"Raise three thousand laborers to build an official road and seek the sword.\" The old prince refused."

msgid "护送陈显祖进衙门作证（问他「作证」），或放他带箱子走（「走吧」）。"
msgstr "Escort Chen Xianzu into the yamen to testify (ask him to \"Testify\"), or let him go with his chest (\"Go\")."

msgid "你把陈显祖护送进了乔阴县衙。福林大街上庾家的人动了手——他活着站上了公堂。"
msgstr "You escort Chen Xianzu into Tallshade's yamen. The Yu family's men strike on Fulin Street - and he makes it to the court alive."

msgid "护送陈显祖上了乔阴县的公堂"
msgstr "Escorted Chen Xianzu into the court of Tallshade County"

msgid "你放陈显祖带着箱子走了。抄本和文书留在你手里。"
msgstr "You let Chen Xianzu go with his chest. The copy and the papers stay with you."

msgid "放陈显祖带着箱子走了"
msgstr "Let Chen Xianzu go with his chest"

msgid "堂审。带着抄本和兵部文书回大堂见程不平。"
msgstr "The hearing. Take the copy and the Ministry of War's papers back to the court hall and see Cheng Buping."

msgid "程不平录了供，写信给叔父槐阳王：假印和失踪的人都往关北去了。兵部的海捕文书也到了县衙——说你是逆灵宫的同党。程不平压着，压不了几天；文书往雪亭去了，你住的那家客栈。"
msgstr "Cheng Buping takes down the testimony and writes to his uncle, the Prince of Huaiyang: the false seal and the missing people have all gone Beyond the Pass. A Ministry of War warrant for your arrest has reached the yamen too - it says you're in league with the Black Palace. Cheng Buping is sitting on it, but can't for long; the warrant has gone on to Snow Pavilion, to the inn where you stay."

msgid "假印和失踪的人都往关北去了。先在天驼关把印的事问清楚，再出关去槐阳城，把程不平的信递给槐阳王；然后借兵踏平工地，或者带郭承夜里潜进去。卢卡说他们那边也传说一个找头的鬼。"
msgstr "The false seal and the missing people have all gone Beyond the Pass. First get the truth about the seal at Camelback Pass, then go out through the pass to Huaiyang and give Cheng Buping's letter to the Prince of Huaiyang. Then borrow his soldiers and flatten the work site, or take Guo Cheng and slip in by night. Luca says his people have a tale too, of a ghost looking for its head."

msgid "在关北救出了兵部工地上的民夫"
msgstr "Saved the laborers at the Ministry of War's work site Beyond the Pass"

msgid "带着程不平的信去天驼关军营，给镇国大将军严廷殷看（军营要大队长的名册）。"
msgstr "Take Cheng Buping's letter to the camp at Camelback Pass and show it to the Guardian General, Yan Tingyin (the camp wants you on a captain's roll)."

msgid "严廷殷看了信：兵部的印是真的，令不是先帝的——这话他不敢说。他的印丢过一回，找回来了；那三天的事，军师比他清楚。"
msgstr "Yan Tingyin reads the letter. The Ministry's seal is real, the decree isn't the late Emperor's - that he won't dare say. His own seal went missing once and turned up again; his adviser knows more than he does about those three days."

msgid "程不平的信在你身上"
msgstr "You have Cheng Buping's letter"

msgid "信丢了的话，回乔阴县衙问程不平「兵部文书」，他会再写一封"
msgstr "If you lose the letter, go back to Tallshade's yamen and ask Cheng Buping about \"Ministry of War papers\"; he'll write another"

msgid "军师赫造基知道印的事。他卖秘密——八两银子。"
msgstr "The adviser, He Zaoji, knows about the seal. He sells secrets - eight taels of silver."

msgid "赫造基收了八两银子：真印丢的那几天他拓了模子，卖了一份给兵部来的人。留着的那一份印模，他给了你。"
msgstr "He Zaoji takes the eight taels. In the days the real seal was missing, he took a mold of it and sold one copy to a man from the Ministry of War. The mold he kept, he gives to you."

msgid "拿印模比一比兵部文书上的印（印模的「比印」）。真印泛黄光，假的没上朱。"
msgstr "Compare the seal mold with the seal on the Ministry of War's papers (the mold's \"Compare Seals\"). The real seal shines yellow; the fake took no vermilion."

msgid "印模上的朱砂正红、泛黄光；兵部文书上那方「镇国大将军」印暗红发黑。字口一笔不差，只差一个颜色：兵部的文书是真的，镇国大将军的印是照模子浇的，令是兵部添的。"
msgstr "The cinnabar on the mold is true red with a yellow sheen; the \"Guardian General\" seal on the Ministry's papers is a dark red going black. Every stroke matches; only the color is wrong. The Ministry's papers are genuine, the Guardian General's seal was cast from the mold, and the order was the Ministry's own addition."

msgid "出关：天驼关谷地东壁的关门。有信、名册上有你、留五两过路钱，或者打过去。"
msgstr "Out through the pass: the pass gate in the east wall of the Camelback Pass valley. Have the letter, be on the roll, leave five taels' toll, or fight your way through."

msgid "关门兵放了行。门后的军道绕过骆驼东峰往北折。"
msgstr "The gate soldiers let you through. Beyond the gate the military road winds round the East Camel Peak and turns north."

msgid "顺着军道往北，出了山就是关北。"
msgstr "Follow the military road north; out of the mountains is Beyond the Pass."

msgid "黄土变成了草。路边一方青石界碑：「关北封国界」。往北，一座土黄的城墙横在草地尽头——槐阳城。"
msgstr "The yellow earth turns to grass. By the road stands a bluestone boundary marker: \"Frontier of the Beyond-the-Pass Fief.\" To the north, a yellow earth wall stretches across the end of the grassland - Huaiyang."

msgid "进槐阳城。城门旁有一张王府的告示，看看。"
msgstr "Go into Huaiyang. There's a notice from the prince's house beside the gate; read it."

msgid "王府的告示：「兵部征夫令，本府不奉。有持兵部文书到关北拿人者，以盗论。」告示上的印色正红——和逆灵宫那叠文书上的不一样。"
msgstr "The prince's notice: \"This House refuses the Ministry of War's levy of laborers. Anyone who comes Beyond the Pass with Ministry papers to seize people will be treated as a robber.\" The seal on the notice is true red - not like the one on the Black Palace's stack of papers."

msgid "王府在大街北头。门军认程不平的信；把信递给槐阳王程朔。"
msgstr "The prince's house is at the north end of the main street. The gate soldiers know Cheng Buping's letter; give it to the Prince of Huaiyang, Cheng Shuo."

msgid "程朔读了信：兵部的印是真的，令不是先帝的——他早说了。失踪的人在草原东边兵部的工地上挖一座古冢，挖不动的让道士的车接走。两条路：借他的兵踏平，或者让郭承带你夜里进去。"
msgstr "Cheng Shuo reads the letter. The Ministry's seal is real, the decree isn't the late Emperor's - he said so long ago. The missing people are digging out an ancient barrow at the Ministry of War's work site east of the grassland, and those who can't dig anymore are taken off in the Daoists' cart. Two ways: borrow his soldiers and flatten it, or let Guo Cheng take you in by night."

msgid "借槐阳王的兵踏平工地（问程朔「借兵」：救下所有人，但兵部会说关北反了），或带骁将郭承夜里潜入（在校场问郭承「潜入」：救一半，王府干净）。"
msgstr "Borrow the Prince of Huaiyang's soldiers and flatten the work site (ask Cheng Shuo to \"Lend Soldiers\": everyone saved, but the Ministry will say Beyond the Pass has rebelled), or slip in by night with the captain Guo Cheng (ask Guo Cheng on the drill ground to \"Slip In\": half saved, the prince's house stays clean)."

msgid "你借了槐阳王的兵。程朔：「踏平了，兵部的文书第二天就到京师：槐阳王反了。」郭承领六骑听你的。"
msgstr "You borrow the Prince of Huaiyang's soldiers. Cheng Shuo: \"Flatten it, and the Ministry's report reaches the Capital the next day: the Prince of Huaiyang has rebelled.\" Guo Cheng and six riders take your orders."

msgid "借了槐阳王的兵，要踏平兵部的工地"
msgstr "Borrowed the Prince of Huaiyang's soldiers to flatten the Ministry of War's work site"

msgid "你和郭承约好了夜里潜入工地。「救得几个算几个，救不完的别回头。王府不知道这件事。」"
msgstr "You and Guo Cheng agree to slip into the work site by night. \"Save as many as we can. The ones we can't, don't look back. The prince's house knows nothing about this.\""

msgid "和王府骁将郭承约好夜里潜入工地"
msgstr "Agreed with the prince's captain, Guo Cheng, to slip into the work site by night"

msgid "去草原东边兵部的工地（出马市东门，过帐篷营地和草原）。借了兵的，郭承跟着你，白天就去；约好潜入的，先在营地的篝火边等到天黑。"
msgstr "Go to the Ministry of War's work site east of the grassland (out the east gate of the Horse Market, past the tent camp and across the grassland). If you borrowed the soldiers, Guo Cheng comes with you and you go by day; if you agreed to slip in, first wait by the campfire in the camp until dark."

msgid "草原东边的工地：一道木栅栏，三顶帐篷，两溜民夫棚，土堆得像小山。白衣的武官守着门，监工吕隼拿着名册。"
msgstr "The work site east of the grassland: a wooden stockade, three tents, two rows of laborers' sheds, and earth heaped up like little hills. Officers in white guard the gate; the overseer, Lu Sun, holds the roll."

msgid "踏平工地：打倒白衣武官、队长裴照和监工吕隼，打开民夫棚前的枷锁。"
msgstr "Flatten the work site: knock down the Officers in White, their captain Pei Zhao and the overseer Lu Sun, and open the shackles in front of the laborers' sheds."

msgid "王府的六骑冲进了工地。白衣武官倒了，裴照倒了，吕隼趴在他的名册上。你打开了八副枷锁，八个民夫回营地去了；古冢口的道士丢下车跑了。兵部的文书明天就到京师：槐阳王反了。"
msgstr "The prince's six riders charge into the work site. The Officers in White go down, Pei Zhao goes down, Lu Sun sprawls across his roll. You open eight sets of shackles, and eight laborers head back to the camp; the Daoists at the mouth of the barrow leave their cart and run. The Ministry's report reaches the Capital tomorrow: the Prince of Huaiyang has rebelled."

msgid "夜里跟着郭承潜进工地，到民夫棚解枷。救得几个算几个，救不完的别回头。"
msgstr "Slip into the work site by night with Guo Cheng and free the laborers in the sheds. Save as many as you can; the ones you can't, don't look back."

msgid "夜里的工地只有两个守夜的。你和郭承解开了四副枷锁——王石头、刘拐子、巴图、胡阿大跑了；第四副铁销响了，守夜的武官扑上来。打完，郭承说：走。另外四个人的名字，你在名册上见过：老魏、周二牛、陈满仓、马三。"
msgstr "At night the work site has only two watchmen. You and Guo Cheng get four sets of shackles open - Wang Shitou, Liu the Lame, Batu and Hu Ada get away; the fourth pin clanks, and the officer on watch comes at you. When it's over, Guo Cheng says: go. The other four names you saw on the roll: Old Wei, Zhou Erniu, Chen Mancang, Ma San."

msgid "回马市问大秦剑手卢卡「会首」——他们那边也传说一个找自己脑袋的鬼。"
msgstr "Go back to the Horse Market and ask the Daqin swordsman Luca about his \"Guild Head\" - his people have a tale too, of a ghost looking for its own head."

msgid "卢卡说他的会首安敦在番坊，番坊的人知道那个鬼的事。番坊在海边：从玉螺湖村出忘情谷，走海崖道。"
msgstr "Luca says his Guild Head, Andun, is in the Foreign Quarter, and the people there know about that ghost. The Foreign Quarter is by the sea: from Jade Conch Village go out through Forgetting Valley and take the Sea Cliff Road."

msgid "卢卡说他的会首安敦在番坊，会首的祖上三百年前见过那个鬼的头是怎么封的。番坊在海边：从玉螺湖村出忘情谷，顺着小路往南，走海崖道下去。"
msgstr "Luca says his Guild Head, Andun, is in the Foreign Quarter; three hundred years ago the Guild Head's forefather saw how that ghost's head was sealed. The Foreign Quarter is by the sea: from Jade Conch Village go out through Forgetting Valley, follow the path south, and take the Sea Cliff Road down."

msgid "从拜火祠取回了三百年前老兵刻下封法的铜牒"
msgstr "Brought back from the Fire Shrine the copper tablet where an old soldier carved the sealing three hundred years ago"

msgid "去番坊找大秦人的会首安敦——卢卡说他们知道鬼的头在哪。出忘情谷，顺着小路往南，走海崖道。"
msgstr "Go to the Foreign Quarter and find Andun, Guild Head of the Daqin people - Luca says they know where the ghost's head is. Out through Forgetting Valley, south along the path, then the Sea Cliff Road."

msgid "林子到头，崖下第一次看见了海。海崖道顺着崖往南下去，崖脚是番坊的码头。"
msgstr "The woods end, and for the first time you see the sea below the cliffs. The Sea Cliff Road runs south down the cliff; at its foot are the docks of the Foreign Quarter."

msgid "找大秦人的会首安敦——市集北头，门口立着两面大盾的铁盾会，院子北头会首的屋。"
msgstr "Find Andun, Guild Head of the Daqin people - at the north end of the market, the Iron Shield Guild with two great shields at its gate; the Guild Head's house is at the north end of the yard."

msgid "铁盾会的会首安敦见了你：他的祖上三百年前替皇叔於兰淳焉打过北方的蛮族，其中一个老兵见过那个鬼的头是怎么封的。"
msgstr "Andun, head of the Iron Shield Guild, sees you. Three hundred years ago his forefathers fought the northern barbarians for the Imperial Uncle Yulan Chunyan, and one old soldier among them saw how that ghost's head was sealed."

msgid "安敦的祖上把看见的刻在一片铜牒上，传到了他手里——问他「铜牒」。"
msgstr "Andun's forefather carved what he saw on a copper tablet, and it came down to Andun - ask him about the \"Copper Tablet.\""

msgid "铜牒存在拜火祠的火前，三十年了。祠规「火前不说谎」：取牒要过一场问话，三句。大秦人自己过不了——三十年前他们为了这块地在火前说过一句谎。"
msgstr "The copper tablet has stood before the fire in the Fire Shrine for thirty years. The shrine's rule is \"No lies before the fire\": to take the tablet you must get through a questioning, three questions. The Daqin people can't pass it themselves - thirty years ago they told one lie before the fire for this land."

msgid "市舶司要清走大秦人，鬼笠馆的浪人想要他们的地。站大秦人（问安敦「站大秦人」：拜火祠过问话取牒，再替他们挡住冯禄），还是站浪人（去日陀罗寺南墙小门外的鬼笠馆，问早川「站浪人」，过他一刀，让浪人替你偷牒——浪人会作证，市舶司就把大秦人清出番坊）？"
msgstr "The Customs House wants the Daqin people cleared out, and the ronin of Ghost Hat Hall want their land. Side with the Daqin people (ask Andun to \"Side with the Daqin\": pass the questioning at the Fire Shrine for the tablet, then stand off Feng Lu for them), or side with the ronin (go to Ghost Hat Hall outside the little gate in Ritola Temple's south wall, ask Hayakawa to \"Side with the Ronin,\" survive one stroke of his blade, and the ronin steal the tablet for you - they'll testify, and the Customs House will clear the Daqin people out of the Foreign Quarter)?"

msgid "你站了大秦人。安敦：「三句真话，牒是你的。读了，再还我们一个人情：冯禄来的时候，站在门口。」"
msgstr "You side with the Daqin people. Andun: \"Three true answers, and the tablet is yours. Once you've read it, do us one favor back: when Feng Lu comes, stand at the gate.\""

msgid "在番坊站到了大秦人一边"
msgstr "Sided with the Daqin people in the Foreign Quarter"

msgid "你站了浪人。早川只说了一句：「要铜牒？过我一刀。」"
msgstr "You side with the ronin. Hayakawa says only: \"You want the copper tablet? Get past one stroke of my blade.\""

msgid "在番坊站到了浪人一边"
msgstr "Sided with the ronin in the Foreign Quarter"

msgid "拜火祠（市集东头的黑石房子）：站到火前，答穆护三句真话，取铜牒。问的是你自己做过的事——撒一句谎，火蹿起来，当天不再问。"
msgstr "The Fire Shrine (the black stone house at the east end of the market): stand before the fire, give the Magus three true answers, and take the copper tablet. The questions are about things you've done - tell one lie and the fire leaps up, and there are no more questions that day."

msgid "火静了。穆护从火坛底下取出铜牒，放在你手里——还是温的。「火前拿的，谁也不能说你偷。」"
msgstr "The fire goes still. The Magus takes the copper tablet from under the fire altar and puts it in your hands - it's still warm. \"Taken before the fire. No one can say you stole it.\""

msgid "回铁盾会：冯禄带着他雇的四个浪人到了院门口。站到门口去，对质那纸文书——有印模的，按在印旁边对一对印色；没有的，只能动手。"
msgstr "Back to the Iron Shield Guild: Feng Lu has come to the gate with four ronin he hired. Stand at the gate and challenge that paper - if you have the seal mold, hold it beside the seal and compare the color; if not, it can only come to blows."

msgid "冯禄退走了。大秦人留下了，安敦说：「你欠我们的人情，我们记着；我们欠你的，也记着。」"
msgstr "Feng Lu backs off. The Daqin people stay, and Andun says: \"The favor you owe us, we'll remember. The one we owe you, we'll remember too.\""

msgid "鬼笠馆（日陀罗寺南墙的小门外，坡道底下）：找馆主早川直义，过他一刀——一击之内定生死。"
msgstr "Ghost Hat Hall (outside the little gate in Ritola Temple's south wall, at the foot of the slope): find its master, Hayakawa Naoyoshi, and survive one stroke of his blade - life or death in a single blow."

msgid "早川收刀入鞘：「过了。今夜，拜火祠——火坛前站着，别出声。」"
msgstr "Hayakawa sheathes his blade. \"You passed. Tonight, the Fire Shrine - stand before the fire altar, and keep quiet.\""

msgid "等到天黑（鬼笠馆的板地能歇到天黑），去拜火祠的火坛前站着，别出声。浪人替你偷牒。"
msgstr "Wait until dark (you can rest on Ghost Hat Hall's plank floor until nightfall), then go stand before the Fire Shrine's altar and keep quiet. The ronin will steal the tablet for you."

msgid "黑影把铜牒塞进你手里，走了。祠里传出祭司的骂声。第二天，冯禄的文书有了浪人作证——铁盾会空了，安敦被押上了船，卢卡剩在码头上。"
msgstr "A shadow presses the copper tablet into your hands and is gone. Curses ring out from the priest inside the shrine. The next day Feng Lu's paper has the ronin's testimony - the Iron Shield Guild stands empty, Andun is marched onto a ship, and Luca is left on the docks."

msgid "读铜牒——三百年前的老兵刻下的，那个鬼的头是怎么封的。"
msgstr "Read the copper tablet - carved three hundred years ago by an old soldier: how that ghost's head was sealed."

msgid "「头在湖底冰下，以穿灵为钉；钉在，鬼不得全；钉拔，鬼成形；要灭它，三器齐；要再封，须有人留下。」——三百年前的老兵刻的。那把剑是钉子。"
msgstr "\"The head lies under the ice at the bottom of the lake, with Spiritpiercer for its nail. While the nail holds, the ghost cannot be whole; pull the nail, and the ghost takes shape. To destroy it, bring the three together; to seal it again, someone must stay behind.\" - carved three hundred years ago by an old soldier. That sword is the nail."

msgid "湖底封物"
msgstr "What's Sealed Under the Lake"

msgid "铜牒说：头在湖底冰下，以穿灵为钉。那把剑钉着鬼的头——在玉螺湖底。渔夫说湖里不太平，别碰那把剑。"
msgstr "The copper tablet says: the head lies under the ice at the bottom of the lake, with Spiritpiercer for its nail. That sword pins the ghost's head - at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake. The fisherman says the lake isn't safe, and to leave that sword alone."

msgid "下到玉螺湖底，看清了三百年的封物"
msgstr "Went down to the bottom of Jade Conch Lake and saw what has been sealed there for three hundred years"

msgid "回玉螺湖村，下湖底，看清封物。别拔那把剑。"
msgstr "Go back to Jade Conch Village, go down to the bottom of the lake and see what's sealed there. Don't pull that sword."

msgid "你到了湖底。从湖心潜下来的，身后的入口结上了冰；从忘情谷下冰阶来的，一下阶就是冰龙的厅。"
msgstr "You're at the bottom of the lake. If you dived from the middle of the lake, the way in behind you has iced over; if you came down the ice steps from Forgetting Valley, the dragons' hall is right at the foot of the steps."

msgid "玄冰上站不住人。顶住寒气，穿过冰龙的厅——它们是守者，不先动手就不打。"
msgstr "No one can stand on the black ice. Bear the cold and cross the hall of the ice dragons - they are guardians, and won't fight unless you start it."

msgid "六条白鳞冰龙抬头看了你一眼，又盘了回去。"
msgstr "Six white-scaled ice dragons raise their heads, look at you, and coil back down."

msgid "冰龙厅的水潭底下透着白光。潜下去。"
msgstr "White light glows up from the pool in the ice dragons' hall. Dive in."

msgid "潭底的黑石台阶下是一间冰室：黑石封坛，冰里的头，钉着它的剑，柱里的人。"
msgstr "Below the black stone steps at the bottom of the pool is a chamber of ice: a sealing altar of black stone, a head in the ice, the sword that pins it, and someone inside a pillar."

msgid "看清封物：冰里的头、钉着它的剑、冰柱里的人。听她说——把铜牒念给冰柱里的人听。"
msgstr "See what's sealed: the head in the ice, the sword that pins it, the woman in the ice pillar. Hear her out - read the copper tablet to the woman in the pillar."

msgid "璃虹：钉拔，它成形，先回这附近的村子；要灭它，三器齐——穿灵、旋芒、宝衣；要再封，须有人留下。"
msgstr "Lihong: pull the nail and it takes shape, and goes first to the village near here. To destroy it, bring the three together - Spiritpiercer, Whirling Edge and the robe. To seal it again, someone must stay behind."

msgid "商玦劝你拔剑。拔，剑到手、鬼醒；不拔，带着封法去京师和岚城，终章再回来。"
msgstr "Shang Jue urges you to pull the sword. Pull it, and the sword is yours and the ghost wakes; leave it, and take the sealing to the Capital and the Wind City, and come back for the last chapter."

msgid "你拔出了穿灵。冰里的头睁开了眼，璃虹从冰里跌了出来，商玦笑着散成了黑烟。上岸——天黑之前。"
msgstr "You pull out Spiritpiercer. The head in the ice opens its eyes, Lihong tumbles out of the ice, and Shang Jue laughs and breaks up into black smoke. Get ashore - before dark."

msgid "在玉螺湖底拔出了穿灵"
msgstr "Pulled Spiritpiercer out at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake"

msgid "你没有动那把剑。璃虹给了你一片她的羽：再封的时候，放回坛上。"
msgstr "You leave the sword where it is. Lihong gives you one of her feathers: when it's sealed again, put it back on the altar."

msgid "在玉螺湖底看清了封物，没有动它"
msgstr "Saw what's sealed at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake, and left it alone"

msgid "天黑了。鬼卒从湖里上来——守住村子：湖畔、村口、稻田边。（湖畔的木船边能等到天黑。）"
msgstr "Night has fallen. Ghost soldiers come up out of the lake - hold the village: the lakeside, the village gate, the edge of the paddies. (You can wait for dark by the wooden boat on the lakeside.)"

msgid "天亮了。村子烧了一半，渔夫死在岸边，璃虹在田老财家的东房里躺着。钉没了，它每一夜都在长。"
msgstr "Day breaks. Half the village is burned, the fisherman lies dead on the shore, and Lihong is lying in the east room of Landlord Tian's house. The nail is gone, and every night it grows."

msgid "原令"
msgstr "The Original Decree"

msgid "璃虹说三器齐才灭得了它：穿灵、旋芒、宝衣。旋芒在岚城，岚城寻风而至——先帝找了它一辈子，寻剑的档案和那道寻剑令的原本都在皇城。去京师。"
msgstr "Lihong says only the three together can destroy it: Spiritpiercer, Whirling Edge and the robe. Whirling Edge is in the Wind City, and the Wind City comes on the wind - the late Emperor searched for it all his life, and the sword-search records and the original of the Sword Decree are all in the Palace City. Go to the Capital."

msgid "拿到了寻剑令的原本"
msgstr "Got the original of the Sword Decree"

msgid "进皇城。三条路：校武场的武举、相国府的公文，或者尚书府里有人知道的一条暗路。"
msgstr "Get into the Palace City. Three ways: the military examination on the Drill Ground, papers from the Chancellor's House, or a hidden way someone in the Minister's Mansion knows."

msgid "校武场三场全胜，殿试授了御前侍卫腰牌。退朝时福安凑过来：皇上说，今夜养心殿。"
msgstr "You win all three bouts on the Drill Ground, and at the palace examination you're given an Imperial Guard's waist token. As court lets out, Fu'an sidles up: His Majesty says, tonight, the Nurtured Heart Hall."

msgid "在京师校武场中了武状元"
msgstr "Took first place in the military examination on the Capital's Drill Ground"

msgid "你随韦相国上了早朝。庾子建当殿驳了奏本，皇上「容朕想想」。退朝时福安追出来：皇上请相国的随员到养心殿说话。"
msgstr "You go to the morning court with Chancellor Wei. Yu Zijian rebuts the memorial right there in the hall, and His Majesty says, \"Let Us think on it.\" As court lets out, Fu'an hurries after you: His Majesty asks the Chancellor's attendant to come to the Nurtured Heart Hall for a word."

msgid "随韦相国上了早朝"
msgstr "Went to the morning court with Chancellor Wei"

msgid "你从冷宫的井里爬了上来。"
msgstr "You climb up out of the well in the Cold Palace."

msgid "从冷宫的枯井潜进了皇城"
msgstr "Slipped into the Palace City through the dry well in the Cold Palace"

msgid "见皇帝：福安说，养心殿。"
msgstr "See the Emperor: Fu'an says, the Nurtured Heart Hall."

msgid "养心殿里，十六岁的皇帝说：御书房里有父皇的匣子。"
msgstr "In the Nurtured Heart Hall, the sixteen-year-old Emperor says: in the Imperial Study is my father's box."

msgid "御书房：把先帝的原令和兵部的抄本放在一起。"
msgstr "The Imperial Study: put the late Emperor's original decree beside the Ministry of War's copy."

msgid "原令只一句：寻剑，不得扰民一户。抄本上多出来的三句，是拿着假印的人加的。皇帝给了你一页樵夫的旧记载：风停处即是城。"
msgstr "The original has one line: Seek the sword, and trouble not one household. The three lines more on the copy were added by whoever had the false seal. The Emperor gives you a page of an old woodcutter's account: Where the wind stops, there is the city."

msgid "怎么办：在养心殿朝上揭发（要原令加两样人证物证，关北踏平了工地的要三样）、去尚书府私了，或请皇上先解皇叔的通缉。"
msgstr "What now: denounce it at court from the Nurtured Heart Hall (it takes the original and two more witnesses or proofs; three if you flattened the work site Beyond the Pass), settle it privately at the Minister's Mansion, or ask His Majesty first to lift the warrant on the Imperial Uncle."

msgid "太和殿上，原令和抄本并排摊开。庾子建拔了刀，冯策站在你身边。他下了狱。"
msgstr "In the Hall of Supreme Harmony, the original and the copy are laid out side by side. Yu Zijian draws a blade, and Feng Ce stands at your side. Yu goes to prison."

msgid "在太和殿上揭发了兵部尚书庾子建"
msgstr "Exposed the Minister of War, Yu Zijian, in the Hall of Supreme Harmony"

msgid "原令进了庾子建的火盆。你换来了先帝推敲遗书的手稿。他留在朝上。"
msgstr "The original goes into Yu Zijian's brazier. In return you get the late Emperor's drafts of his last testament. He stays at court."

msgid "把先帝的原令交给了庾子建"
msgstr "Gave the late Emperor's original decree to Yu Zijian"

msgid "皇帝亲笔写了手诏，东二门的布告撤了。手诏要送到水烟阁。"
msgstr "The Emperor writes an edict in his own hand, and the notice at the Second East Gate comes down. The edict must be taken to Waterfog Pavilion."

msgid "请皇帝撤了皇叔於兰天武的通缉"
msgstr "Asked the Emperor to lift the warrant on the Imperial Uncle, Yulan Tianwu"

msgid "把手诏送到水烟阁，交给皇叔於兰天武。"
msgstr "Take the edict to Waterfog Pavilion and give it to the Imperial Uncle, Yulan Tianwu."

msgid "於兰天武读了手诏，把传功使交给萧辟尘，回京了。"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu reads the edict, hands the post of Teaching Envoy to Xiao Bichen, and goes back to the Capital."

msgid "樵夫说：风停处即是城。岚城寻风而至，寻风而逝——天驼关石林里那面镜子后头，有一条原作没修完的路。"
msgstr "The woodcutter says: Where the wind stops, there is the city. The Wind City comes on the wind and goes with the wind - behind that mirror in the stone forest at Camelback Pass there is a road its maker never finished."

msgid "找到了岚城"
msgstr "Found the Wind City"

msgid "读懂风，找到岚城。天驼关石林那面镜子里，上道通到哪里？"
msgstr "Learn to read the wind and find the Wind City. In the mirror in the stone forest at Camelback Pass, where does the upper road lead?"

msgid "风停了。"
msgstr "The wind stops."

msgid "白石街尽头的风铃阁。"
msgstr "The Wind Chime Pavilion at the end of White Stone Street."

msgid "风铃阁里，十口大铃，有的响，有的不响。"
msgstr "In the Wind Chime Pavilion hang ten great bells; some ring, some don't."

msgid "见岚翁，问他旋芒。"
msgstr "See the Wind Elder and ask him about Whirling Edge."

msgid "岚翁：剑在云台。他不卖，不赏，只问谁拔。"
msgstr "The Wind Elder: the sword is on the Cloud Terrace. He won't sell it and won't give it as a reward; he only asks who will draw it."

msgid "云台：谁拔旋芒——你自己（十铃里要响六口，先接岚翁的接风三刃）、皇叔（要他已经入朝）、萧辟尘（要带着他的风铃）。"
msgstr "The Cloud Terrace: who draws Whirling Edge - you yourself (six of the ten bells must ring, and first take the Wind Elder's three welcoming blades), the Imperial Uncle (he must already have gone back to court), or Xiao Bichen (he must have his wind chime with him)."

msgid "风散了，剑落进你手里。岚翁说：十口铃里有人信你，剑就认你。"
msgstr "The wind breaks up, and the sword drops into your hand. The Wind Elder says: if anyone among the ten bells trusts you, the sword will take you."

msgid "在岚城的云台上拔了旋芒"
msgstr "Drew Whirling Edge on the Wind City's Cloud Terrace"

msgid "风把於兰天武送上云台。三百年前於兰家拔错了一把剑，这一把，他拔了。"
msgstr "The wind carries Yulan Tianwu up to the Cloud Terrace. Three hundred years ago the Yulan family drew the wrong sword. This one, he draws."

msgid "在岚城的云台上，看着旋芒落进皇叔於兰天武手里"
msgstr "On the Wind City's Cloud Terrace, watched Whirling Edge fall into the hand of the Imperial Uncle, Yulan Tianwu"

msgid "铃挂回了萧家的钩上，风把萧辟尘送回了家。剑落进他手里。"
msgstr "The bell is hung back on the Xiao family's hook, and the wind carries Xiao Bichen home. The sword drops into his hand."

msgid "在岚城的云台上，看着旋芒落进萧辟尘手里"
msgstr "On the Wind City's Cloud Terrace, watched Whirling Edge fall into Xiao Bichen's hand"

msgid "回到湖底"
msgstr "Back to the Lake Bed"

msgid "穿灵、旋芒、宝衣。三器凑没凑齐，湖底那颗头都在等。拔钉，斩鬼，或者再封它。"
msgstr "Spiritpiercer, Whirling Edge, the robe. Whether or not the three are together, the head at the bottom of the lake is waiting. Pull the nail and slay the ghost - or seal it again."

msgid "从玉螺湖底回到了雪亭镇，听了宣诏"
msgstr "Came back to Snow Pavilion from the bottom of Jade Conch Lake and heard the edict read"

msgid "回到湖底。拔钉，斩鬼，或者再封它。"
msgstr "Go back to the bottom of the lake. Pull the nail and slay the ghost - or seal it again."

msgid "湖面平得像一块铁，结着一层黑冰。冰底下的光一下一下地暗下去。"
msgstr "The lake lies flat as a sheet of iron under a skin of black ice. The light beneath the ice dims, pulse by pulse."

msgid "点将：三器在谁手里，来了几拨人。备好了，在湖畔「等到天黑」。"
msgstr "Call your people: who holds the three, and how many have come. When you're ready, \"Wait Until Dark\" on the lakeside."

msgid "你在岸边等到了天黑。"
msgstr "You wait on the shore until dark."

msgid "穿灵在你手里"
msgstr "Spiritpiercer is in your hands"

msgid "穿灵钉在封坛上"
msgstr "Spiritpiercer is nailed into the sealing altar"

msgid "旋芒在你手里"
msgstr "Whirling Edge is in your hands"

msgid "交给了庾子建"
msgstr "Given to Yu Zijian"

msgid "旋芒在皇叔手里，他在岸边"
msgstr "Whirling Edge is in the Imperial Uncle's hands; he's on the shore"

msgid "旋芒在萧辟尘手里，他在岸边"
msgstr "Whirling Edge is in Xiao Bichen's hands; he's on the shore"

msgid "宝衣在你身上"
msgstr "You're wearing the robe"

msgid "带上它，下湖前穿上"
msgstr "Bring it, and put it on before you go into the lake"

msgid "宝衣在瑷伦身上"
msgstr "Ailun is wearing the robe"

msgid "她在晚月庄东厢等你去叫（问她「湖底」）"
msgstr "She's waiting in the east wing of Latemoon Manor for you to call her (ask her about the \"Lake Bed\")"

msgid "宝衣在安妮儿身上，她在岸边"
msgstr "Anni'er is wearing the robe; she's on the shore"

msgid "帮手"
msgstr "Helpers"

msgid "野羊寨（霍铮）守村口"
msgstr "Goathill Stockade (Huo Zheng) holds the village gate"

msgid "关北的骑兵（郭承）守湖畔"
msgstr "The riders from Beyond the Pass (Guo Cheng) hold the lakeside"

msgid "铁盾会的盾守稻田边"
msgstr "The Iron Shield Guild's shields hold the edge of the paddies"

msgid "冰龙没有动过，在冰龙厅"
msgstr "The ice dragons have never been fought; they're in the ice dragons' hall"

msgid "大内侍卫营（冯策）随你下湖"
msgstr "The Palace Guard (Feng Ce) go down into the lake with you"

msgid "东方神教（安妮儿）守潭口"
msgstr "The Golden Crow Order (Anni'er) holds the mouth of the pool"

msgid "水烟阁（南危水）守潭口"
msgstr "Waterfog Pavilion (Nan Weishui) holds the mouth of the pool"

msgid "水烟阁（卫沧澜）守潭口"
msgstr "Waterfog Pavilion (Wei Canglan) holds the mouth of the pool"

msgid "水烟阁（潘军禅）守潭口"
msgstr "Waterfog Pavilion (Pan Junchan) holds the mouth of the pool"

msgid "封山（柳淳风）守渡口"
msgstr "Empty Mountain (Liu Chunfeng) holds the ferry"

msgid "北宗（柳绘心）守渡口"
msgstr "The North Branch (Liu Huixin) holds the ferry"

msgid "晚月庄（蓝止萍）守岸"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor (Lan Zhiping) holds the shore"

msgid "晚月庄（老妇母女）守岸"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor (the old woman and her daughter) hold the shore"

msgid "铁卫营（严廷殷）守官道"
msgstr "The Iron Guard (Yan Tingyin) hold the official road"

msgid "茅山（林忌）截住了北麓下湖的路"
msgstr "Mount Mao (Lin Ji) has cut off the way down to the lake from the North Foot"

msgid "岸上：庾子建来要剑"
msgstr "On the shore: Yu Zijian has come for the sword"

msgid "三器都在，帮手也够：能灭它"
msgstr "All three are here and there are helpers enough: it can be destroyed"

msgid "这一回只能再封"
msgstr "This time it can only be sealed again"

msgid "天黑了，鬼卒爬上了岸。没人守的地方你自己守；划到湖心，潜下去。"
msgstr "Night has fallen, and ghost soldiers crawl up onto the shore. Wherever no one stands guard, you guard it yourself; row out to the middle of the lake and dive."

msgid "你潜下了湖。岸上的人替你守着。"
msgstr "You dive into the lake. The people on the shore hold it for you."

msgid "冰龙厅：商玦在水潭边等你。"
msgstr "The ice dragons' hall: Shang Jue is waiting for you by the pool."

msgid "商玦倒在冰龙厅的水潭边。"
msgstr "Shang Jue falls by the pool in the ice dragons' hall."

msgid "水潭底下就是封坛。潜下去。"
msgstr "The sealing altar is at the bottom of the pool. Dive."

msgid "你回到了湖底。坛心的冰里，那颗头睁着眼。"
msgstr "You're back at the bottom of the lake. In the ice at the heart of the altar, the head has its eyes open."

msgid "封坛：侮天鬼。（钉还钉着的，先拔出穿灵；拔过了的，到坛心「迎上去」。）"
msgstr "The sealing altar: the Heaven-Defier. (If the nail still holds, pull Spiritpiercer out first; if it's already been pulled, go to the heart of the altar and \"Meet It.\")"

msgid "侮天鬼散成一团黑焰，退回了那颗头底下。"
msgstr "The Heaven-Defier breaks up into a mass of black flame and draws back under the head."

msgid "最后一下：三器齐、人够，可以钉下去灭了它——宝衣会烧掉；也可以把穿灵交给一个肯留下的人，再封。"
msgstr "The last stroke: with all three and people enough, you can drive the nail home and destroy it - the robe will burn; or you can hand Spiritpiercer to someone willing to stay behind, and seal it again."

msgid "旋芒斩它，宝衣挡它的黑焰，穿灵钉它的头。侮天鬼灭了，宝衣烧成了灰。"
msgstr "Whirling Edge cuts it down, the robe holds off its black flame, and Spiritpiercer nails its head. The Heaven-Defier is destroyed, and the robe burns to ash."

msgid "在玉螺湖底灭了侮天鬼"
msgstr "Destroyed the Heaven-Defier at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake"

msgid "瑷伦把穿灵钉回那颗头上，留在了冰里。侮天鬼再封了。"
msgstr "Ailun drives Spiritpiercer back into the head and stays in the ice. The Heaven-Defier is sealed again."

msgid "在玉螺湖底再封了侮天鬼，瑷伦留在了冰里"
msgstr "Sealed the Heaven-Defier again at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake; Ailun stayed in the ice"

msgid "璃虹把穿灵钉回那颗头上，留在了冰里。侮天鬼再封了。"
msgstr "Lihong drives Spiritpiercer back into the head and stays in the ice. The Heaven-Defier is sealed again."

msgid "在玉螺湖底再封了侮天鬼，璃虹留在了冰里"
msgstr "Sealed the Heaven-Defier again at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake; Lihong stayed in the ice"

msgid "南危水把穿灵钉回那颗头上，留在了冰里。侮天鬼再封了。"
msgstr "Nan Weishui drives Spiritpiercer back into the head and stays in the ice. The Heaven-Defier is sealed again."

msgid "在玉螺湖底再封了侮天鬼，南危水留在了冰里"
msgstr "Sealed the Heaven-Defier again at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake; Nan Weishui stayed in the ice"

msgid "萧辟尘把穿灵钉回那颗头上，留在了冰里。侮天鬼再封了。"
msgstr "Xiao Bichen drives Spiritpiercer back into the head and stays in the ice. The Heaven-Defier is sealed again."

msgid "在玉螺湖底再封了侮天鬼，萧辟尘留在了冰里"
msgstr "Sealed the Heaven-Defier again at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake; Xiao Bichen stayed in the ice"

msgid "你把穿灵钉回那颗头上，自己留在了冰里。"
msgstr "You drive Spiritpiercer back into the head, and stay in the ice yourself."

msgid "在玉螺湖底再封了侮天鬼，自己留在了冰里"
msgstr "Sealed the Heaven-Defier again at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake, and stayed in the ice yourself"

msgid "回雪亭镇。广场上，那队白衣武官又来了。"
msgstr "Go back to Snow Pavilion. In the square, that troop of Officers in White has come again."

msgid "雪亭镇的广场上，宣了诏。"
msgstr "In the square of Snow Pavilion, the edict is read."

msgid "淳风武馆的门房换了个年轻人。刘安禄在野羊山上当他的二寨主，逢年过节下山喝一回酒。"
msgstr "Pure Wind Hall has a young man on the gate now. Liu Anlu is second chief up on Goathill, and comes down for a drink at the New Year and the festivals."

msgid "淳风武馆的门房还是那张桌子。刘安禄的事，镇上没人再提。"
msgstr "Pure Wind Hall's gatehouse still has the same table. No one in town talks about Liu Anlu anymore."

msgid "淳风武馆的门房空了一冬。刘安禄走的那天没有人送，柳淳风在门里站了很久。"
msgstr "Pure Wind Hall's gatehouse stood empty all winter. No one saw Liu Anlu off the day he left; Liu Chunfeng stood inside the gate a long time."

msgid "淳风武馆的门房还是那张桌子。刘安禄的来历，武馆里只有三个人知道。"
msgstr "Pure Wind Hall's gatehouse still has the same table. Only three people in the hall know where Liu Anlu came from."

msgid "淳风武馆照旧每天卯时开门，「剑不外传」四个字还挂在正厅。绮云镇口多了一块「北宗」的木牌，柳淳风从没去看过，也从没叫人摘。"
msgstr "Pure Wind Hall still opens its doors at dawn every day, and \"The sword is not taught to outsiders\" still hangs in the main hall. At the edge of Cloudweave Town there is a new wooden sign, \"North Branch.\" Liu Chunfeng has never gone to look at it, and never had it taken down."

msgid "淳风武馆的内院开了一道侧门，镇上的孩子从那里进出。柳淳风书房朝着内院的那扇窗，一冬天都没有关。"
msgstr "Pure Wind Hall has opened a side gate into its inner yard, and the town's children come and go through it. The window of Liu Chunfeng's study that faces the inner yard stayed open all winter."

msgid "开春，你回了一趟山里，在老岑的坟前把信末那一行念给他听：风停处，替我再看一眼。——看过了。"
msgstr "In spring you go back up into the mountains and, at Old Cen's grave, read him the last line of his letter: Where the wind stops, take one more look for me. - I have."

msgid "广场上的人散了。卖馄饨的说，那天的官爷，跟三年前来的是同一拨。"
msgstr "The crowd in the square breaks up. The wonton seller says the officials that day were the same lot that came three years ago."

msgid "振远的绮云分局照旧走镖。陈天星那本总账烧了，二十年前那笔抚恤银，振远没有人再提。"
msgstr "The Far-Road Escorts' Cloudweave branch still runs escorts. Chen Tianxing's ledger was burned, and no one at the Far-Road Escorts mentions the compensation silver from twenty years ago anymore."

msgid "振远的绮云分局关了门。陈剑秋天天坐在柜台后面，不接镖，也不走。"
msgstr "The Far-Road Escorts' Cloudweave branch has shut its doors. Chen Jianqiu sits behind the counter every day, taking no escorts and not leaving."

msgid "瀑布后的山洞里，那座无名的坟前多了一块碑，碑上没有字。"
msgstr "In the cave behind the waterfall, there's a stone now before the nameless grave. It bears no words."

msgid "瀑布后的山洞空了。那块腰牌后来回到了水烟阁，挂在葬剑亭里。"
msgstr "The cave behind the waterfall is empty. The waist token went back to Waterfog Pavilion in the end, and hangs in the Sword Tomb Pavilion."

msgid "老松寨的寨门还在，买路钱一年比一年收得少。"
msgstr "Old Pine Stockade's gate still stands, and the toll it takes gets smaller every year."

msgid "五长老的椅子空着，说是等一个回不来的人。正月十七还没到，阁里没人提虹台。"
msgstr "The Fifth Elder's chair stands empty, waiting, they say, for a man who can't come back. The seventeenth of the first month hasn't come yet, and no one in the Pavilion speaks of the Rainbow Terrace."

msgid "卫沧澜回来了，坐在正厅侧的矮凳上，不肯坐那把太师椅。没有人再提「代盟主」三个字；正月十七的虹台，九派要上去推选。"
msgstr "Wei Canglan has come back. He sits on a low stool at the side of the main hall and won't take the great armchair. No one speaks of an \"acting Alliance Leader\" anymore; on the seventeenth of the first month, the nine schools will go up to the Rainbow Terrace to choose."

msgid "南危水说，正月十七他要上虹台，只说一句：老松岭的那个人，替我死了。"
msgstr "Nan Weishui says that on the seventeenth of the first month he will go up to the Rainbow Terrace and say just one thing: the man on Old Pine Ridge died in my place."

msgid "七长老颜违以代盟主自居。他说正月十七一过，「代」字就该去掉了，二十年的旧案，到此为止。"
msgstr "The Seventh Elder, Yan Wei, calls himself acting Alliance Leader. Once the seventeenth of the first month is past, he says, the \"acting\" should go, and the twenty-year-old case ends here."

msgid "传功使的位置空着。弟子们说，萧师父回城里去了。"
msgstr "The Teaching Envoy's seat stands empty. The disciples say Shifu Xiao has gone back to the city."

msgid "东厢的门关着。庄里的人说，守衣人去守另一件东西了。"
msgstr "The door of the east wing is shut. The people of the manor say the robe's keeper has gone to keep something else."

msgid "瑷伦回了东厢，宝衣挂在墙上。她说，几百年了，该歇一歇。"
msgstr "Ailun has gone back to the east wing, and the robe hangs on the wall. After centuries, she says, it's time for a rest."

msgid "瑷伦回了东厢，墙上挂衣的钉子空着。她说，衣裳烧了，守衣人也该歇了。"
msgstr "Ailun has gone back to the east wing, and the peg where the robe hung is empty. The robe has burned, she says; its keeper can rest too."

msgid "安妮儿把宝衣带回了东方神教。神教的香案上，多了一盏长明灯。"
msgstr "Anni'er took the robe back to the Golden Crow Order. On the Order's incense table there is a new everlasting lamp."

msgid "安妮儿把宝衣带回了晚月庄的西厢。西厢的门一直关着——神教的事，她不再过问。"
msgstr "Anni'er took the robe back to the west wing of Latemoon Manor. The west wing's door stays shut - she no longer has a say in the Order's affairs."

msgid "安妮儿回了东方神教，带回去的是一捧灰。神教的香案上，多了一只小瓷坛、一盏长明灯。"
msgstr "Anni'er went back to the Golden Crow Order carrying a handful of ash. On the Order's incense table there is a new little porcelain jar, and an everlasting lamp."

msgid "安妮儿带回西厢的是一捧灰。西厢的门一直关着，窗下多了一只小瓷坛。"
msgstr "What Anni'er carried back to the west wing was a handful of ash. The west wing's door stays shut, and under its window there is a new little porcelain jar."

msgid "安妮儿收回了教主令。西厢的灯从此夜夜亮着，神教的人进进出出；朱鸿雪派出去的差事，只剩该死的人。"
msgstr "Anni'er took back the Order's Head token. From then on the lamp in the west wing burns every night, and the Order's people come and go; of the jobs Zhu Hongxue sends out, only the ones on people who deserve to die are left."

msgid "庄里少了一件东西，多了一个故事。池边的人说，护庄的光，那年暗了一暗。"
msgstr "The manor is short one thing and has one more story. The people by the pool say the light that guards the manor dimmed a little that year."

msgid "宝衣出过一回庄，又被人送了回来。池边的人说，护庄的光，那年暗了一暗，又亮了。"
msgstr "The robe left the manor once, and someone brought it back. The people by the pool say the light that guards the manor dimmed a little that year, then shone again."

msgid "后院书房那幅湘绣图前，又有人在学沧海龙吟了。"
msgstr "In the back-garden study, someone is learning the Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea again in front of the Xiang embroidery."

msgid "内书房的老妇再没有开过口。蓝止萍说，庄规是庄规；那一年起，晚月庄的门关得比从前早。"
msgstr "The old woman in the inner study never spoke again. Lan Zhiping says the manor's rules are the manor's rules; from that year on, Latemoon Manor shut its gates earlier than before."

msgid "内书房里多了一个人，不再蒙面。庄里的人说，每天傍晚，老妇擦她的鞭子，她女儿擦她的剑。"
msgstr "There is one more person in the inner study now, no longer masked. The people of the manor say that every evening the old woman cleans her whip, and her daughter cleans her sword."

msgid "野羊寨的旗子又插回了山顶。霍铮说，逆灵宫的黑砖，拆下来正好砌寨墙。"
msgstr "Goathill Stockade's flag flies on the summit again. The Black Palace's black bricks, Huo Zheng says, are just right for the stockade wall."

msgid "黄霸还在土地庙里收他的供。北麓的黑砖道观，没人敢上去看一眼。"
msgstr "Huang Ba still collects his tribute in the Earth God Shrine. No one dares go up and take a look at the black-brick abbey on the North Foot."

msgid "有人说在北边的雪里见过商玦：一身黑衣结着霜，说话还像念经。"
msgstr "Someone says they saw Shang Jue in the snow up north: frost on his black robe, still talking like he's chanting scripture."

msgid "灵心观藏经楼的二楼，镇教秘籍还是六函，第七函的位置空着。林忌说，茅山宁可没有那一函。"
msgstr "On the second floor of Clear Heart Abbey's Scripture Library, the abbey's treasured manuals still fill only six cases; the place of the seventh stands empty. Lin Ji says Mount Mao would rather do without that one."

msgid "京师尚书府的花园里，那个老花匠又在浇他的花。庾清尘去哪里，他就跟到哪里。"
msgstr "In the garden of the Minister's Mansion in the Capital, the old gardener is watering his flowers again. Wherever Yu Qingchen goes, he follows."

msgid "藏经楼二楼的第七函回来了。花匠在书架边搭了一张竹床，夜里点着灯，教山上的小道士认北麓的字。"
msgstr "The seventh case has come back to the second floor of the Scripture Library. The gardener has set up a bamboo bed by the shelves, and at night, by lamplight, he teaches the young Daoists of the mountain to read the North Foot's script."

msgid "北麓下来的孩子在灵心观后山开了一片地。花匠一页一页念给他们听：烧了一辈子的香，坛上写的原来是这些。"
msgstr "The children who came down from the North Foot have cleared a patch of ground on the hill behind Clear Heart Abbey. The gardener reads to them page by page: a whole life of burning incense, and this is what was written on the altar."

msgid "日照山的流云轩里，多了一个独眼的头陀。被鬼卒抓伤的人抬上山来，他一掌按下去，寒气冒成一缕白烟。"
msgstr "At Drifting Cloud Lodge on Sunlit Mountain there's a one-eyed wandering monk now. When people clawed by ghost soldiers are carried up the mountain, he presses down with one palm, and the cold rises off them in a wisp of white smoke."

msgid "头陀在流云轩教人婆萝蜜多心经。玄智说，西来的经和本寺的经放在一个经柜里，没有打架。"
msgstr "The wandering monk teaches the Paramita Heart Sutra at Drifting Cloud Lodge. Xuanzhi says the sutra from the west and the temple's own sit in the same cabinet, and they haven't come to blows."

msgid "日照山金门外，那块地方空了。山烟寺还是三百年前的山烟寺：外人不进流云轩，外来的经，也不进。"
msgstr "Outside the Golden Gate on Sunlit Mountain, that spot stands empty. Mountain Mist Temple is still the Mountain Mist Temple of three hundred years ago: no outsider enters Drifting Cloud Lodge, and no outside sutra either."

msgid "被鬼卒抓伤的人抬上山来，玄智守着，三天三夜。有的救回来了，有的没有。"
msgstr "When people clawed by ghost soldiers are carried up the mountain, Xuanzhi sits with them three days and three nights. Some he brings back; some he doesn't."

msgid "乔阴的老葛每年秋天挑一担柴上日照山，放在金门边上，说是还那一掌的情。"
msgstr "Every autumn Old Ge of Tallshade carries a load of firewood up Sunlit Mountain and leaves it by the Golden Gate - to repay that palm, he says."

msgid "乔阴的老葛用左手砍柴，砍得慢。逢人就说：命是山烟寺的方丈守回来的。"
msgstr "Old Ge of Tallshade chops wood left-handed now, and slowly. He tells everyone he meets: the abbot of Mountain Mist Temple sat up and kept my life for me."

msgid "那一夜，茅山的人截在北麓下湖的路上。黑砖道观里再没人提起那个新来的道士——只有门房记得，他戴冠的样子不太像。"
msgstr "That night, Mount Mao's people blocked the way down to the lake from the North Foot. In the black-brick abbey no one ever mentioned the new Daoist again - only the gatekeeper remembers that he didn't quite wear his cap right."

msgid "冰龙厅里那第一剑，是从商玦背后来的。活着回到北麓的道士说，刺他的人戴着宫里的冠。"
msgstr "That first blade in the ice dragons' hall came from behind Shang Jue. The Daoists who made it back to the North Foot say the one who stabbed him wore a Palace cap."

msgid "北麓的道士还在找一个戴过黑冠的人。他们说他是茅山的眼线；茅山说，没这回事。"
msgstr "The Daoists of the North Foot are still looking for someone who once wore a black cap. They say he was Mount Mao's spy; Mount Mao says no such thing."

msgid "程不平对着一本黑皮的名册，把上面的押印一个一个对了出来。槐阳城外有几户人家，收到了县衙的一封信。"
msgstr "Cheng Buping went down a black-bound roll and matched its marks one by one. A few households outside Huaiyang got a letter from the yamen."

msgid "程不平的卷宗送上了京城。陈显祖回了乡，桃木箱里只剩一件旧官服。"
msgstr "Cheng Buping's case file went up to the Capital. Chen Xianzu went home to his village; nothing is left in the peachwood chest but an old official's robe."

msgid "陈显祖带着他的箱子走了，没人知道去了哪里。福林酒楼的说书人，把这件事编成了一段新书。"
msgstr "Chen Xianzu went off with his chest, and no one knows where. The storyteller at Fulin Tavern has made a new tale of it."

msgid "县衙门口的大皮鼓，又有人敢去敲了。"
msgstr "Someone dares to beat the big hide drum at the yamen gate again."

msgid "福林大街的巷子口站着一个官差，叫花子从他跟前过，点个头。真龙头坐在街当中，数着酒囊上的结。"
msgstr "A constable stands at the mouth of the alley off Fulin Street, and the beggars nod to him as they pass. The true Dragon Head sits in the middle of the street, counting the knots on his wineskin."

msgid "乔阴的巷子里还是没有官差。陆得财腰里那只皮酒囊，二十三个结。"
msgstr "There are still no constables in Tallshade's alleys. The leather wineskin at Lu Decai's waist has twenty-three knots."

msgid "乔阴县衙的公案上，又摊开了庾子建的卷宗：小屋那封信，天驼关那本账。京城没有回话，程不平也没有收卷。"
msgstr "Yu Zijian's case file lies open again on the bench of Tallshade's yamen: the letter from the little house, the ledger from Camelback Pass. The Capital has not replied, and Cheng Buping has not closed the file."

msgid "乔阴县衙的卷宗里，压着骆建章的一张供状：兵部抄本上多出来的三句，是谁口述的。"
msgstr "In the files of Tallshade's yamen lies a statement from Luo Jianzhang: who dictated the three lines more on the Ministry of War's copy."

msgid "曼雩台上多了一张书案。骆建章给弟弟抄谱，骆云舟在台边练剑；兄弟俩还是不怎么说话。"
msgstr "There's a writing desk on the Rain Dance Terrace now. Luo Jianzhang copies sword manuals for his brother while Luo Yunzhou practices at the terrace's edge; the brothers still don't talk much."

msgid "曼雩台上还是骆云舟一个人。他说，大哥的字比他的剑直。"
msgstr "On the Rain Dance Terrace it's still just Luo Yunzhou. His elder brother's writing, he says, is straighter than his sword."

msgid "天驼关的关门照旧，出关留五两。官道上再没有人卖路引；严廷殷换了一个不会茅山术的军师。"
msgstr "The gate at Camelback Pass is as it was: five taels to go through. No one sells travel passes on the official road anymore; Yan Tingyin has taken an adviser who knows no Mount Mao tricks."

msgid "天驼关的关门抬着，过关不要钱。严廷殷回了京城，再没回来；将军营帐里坐着李信，案上压着一本账的抄本。"
msgstr "The gate at Camelback Pass stands raised, and going through costs nothing. Yan Tingyin went back to the Capital and never came back; Li Xin sits in the general's tent, a copy of a ledger under his hand on the desk."

msgid "京城的诏书到了槐阳：槐阳王不反。城门上那张「槐阳反」的告示，郭承亲手撕了。"
msgstr "An edict from the Capital reached Huaiyang: the Prince of Huaiyang has not rebelled. Guo Cheng tore down the \"Huaiyang Rebels\" notice on the city gate with his own hands."

msgid "槐阳城门上那张告示还贴着：槐阳反。程朔说，随他们说。"
msgstr "The notice on Huaiyang's gate is still up: Huaiyang Rebels. Let them say it, says Cheng Shuo."

msgid "槐阳王府照旧不问兵部的事。草原上没救出来的四个人，后来有两个自己走了回来。"
msgstr "The Prince of Huaiyang's house still keeps out of the Ministry of War's business. Of the four left behind on the grassland, two later walked home on their own."

msgid "铁盾会的院子里又练起了盾。卢卡说，等他攒够了钱，要回海那边去看一看。"
msgstr "The Iron Shield Guild's yard rings with shield drill again. Once he's saved up enough, Luca says, he'll go back across the sea to have a look."

msgid "铁盾会的院子空了。鬼笠馆的浪人占了那块地，早川直义从此不再出刀。"
msgstr "The Iron Shield Guild's yard is empty. The ronin of Ghost Hat Hall have taken the land, and Hayakawa Naoyoshi never draws his blade again."

msgid "拜火祠的火，一年到头没有灭过。"
msgstr "The fire in the Fire Shrine never goes out, all year round."

msgid "傅家坡的草顶重新铺过了。渔夫的网挂在他家门口，没有人去收。"
msgstr "The thatch on Fu Family Slope has been laid again. The fisherman's net hangs at his door, and no one takes it in."

msgid "玉螺湖的渔夫照旧撒网。湖底那盏灯，再没有人见过。"
msgstr "The fishermen of Jade Conch Lake still cast their nets. No one has seen that lamp on the lake bed again."

msgid "石头长高了一截，天天往湖边跑。"
msgstr "Shitou has grown a head taller and runs down to the lake every day."

msgid "庾子建在天牢里过了冬。少年皇帝第一次在早朝上，说了一整句话。"
msgstr "Yu Zijian spent the winter in the Heavenly Prison. For the first time, the boy Emperor spoke a whole sentence at morning court."

msgid "京城里都说，是兵部尚书带回了那把剑。皇帝在早朝上，一句话也没有说。"
msgstr "All the Capital says it was the Minister of War who brought back the sword. The Emperor said not one word at morning court."

msgid "庾子建还在兵部。他派人去过一回玉螺湖，回来的人说，湖面上什么也没有。"
msgstr "Yu Zijian is still at the Ministry of War. He sent someone to Jade Conch Lake once; the man came back and said there was nothing on the lake."

msgid "於兰天武回了朝，把旋芒挂在养心殿的墙上，对少年皇帝说：剑是用来记事的。"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu went back to court, hung Whirling Edge on the wall of the Nurtured Heart Hall, and told the boy Emperor: a sword is for remembering."

msgid "於兰天武回了朝，站在少年皇帝身后。"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu went back to court and stands behind the boy Emperor."

msgid "骆建章流放关北。出城那天，他替押解的差人写了一封家书，最后一笔没有甩出格子。"
msgstr "Luo Jianzhang was exiled Beyond the Pass. The day he left the city, he wrote a letter home for the men escorting him, and his last stroke stayed inside the box."

msgid "朝上那天，骆建章的供状和原令摆在一处。西街骆家五代的门匾，后来是骆云舟自己摘的。"
msgstr "The day of the court, Luo Jianzhang's statement lay beside the original decree. The plaque over the gate of the Luo family on West Street, five generations old, Luo Yunzhou later took down himself."

msgid "骆建章的供状进了刑部的案底，乔阴县衙也有一份；庾子建还在兵部。西街骆家的大门，从此没有官家的人来敲。"
msgstr "Luo Jianzhang's statement went into the Ministry of Justice's files, and Tallshade's yamen has a copy; Yu Zijian is still at the Ministry of War. No official ever knocks at the Luo family's gate on West Street again."

msgid "骆建章那张供状，韦相国一直收在袖子里；庾子建还在兵部。西街骆家的大门，从此没有官家的人来敲。"
msgstr "Chancellor Wei has kept Luo Jianzhang's statement up his sleeve all along; Yu Zijian is still at the Ministry of War. No official ever knocks at the Luo family's gate on West Street again."

msgid "玉螺湖底"
msgstr "The Bottom of Jade Conch Lake"

msgid "冰下封坛一片空。三百年的冰化了一半，水是清的。冰龙还在，只是不再抬头。"
msgstr "The sealing altar under the ice is empty. Half of three hundred years' ice has melted, and the water is clear. The ice dragons are still there; they just don't raise their heads anymore."

msgid "冰下封坛的冰柱里，瑷伦披着宝衣站着，眼睛睁着。三百年后，会有人来叫醒她。"
msgstr "In the ice pillar at the sealing altar, Ailun stands wrapped in the robe, eyes open. In three hundred years, someone will come to wake her."

msgid "冰下封坛的冰柱里，璃虹的光又亮了。她说过：第一个带着铜来的，是你。"
msgstr "In the ice pillar at the sealing altar, Lihong's light shines again. She said it once: the first to come with the copper was you."

msgid "冰下封坛的冰柱里，南危水手按剑柄，像还在等什么人。"
msgstr "In the ice pillar at the sealing altar, Nan Weishui stands with his hand on his sword hilt, as if still waiting for someone."

msgid "冰下封坛的冰柱里，萧辟尘握着旋芒。岚城的风，每年会吹到湖面上一回。"
msgstr "In the ice pillar at the sealing altar, Xiao Bichen holds Whirling Edge. Once a year, the wind of the Wind City blows across the lake."

msgid "冰下封坛的冰柱里，站着一个年轻人。没有人知道他的名字。"
msgstr "In the ice pillar at the sealing altar stands a young man. No one knows his name."

msgid "店小二擦着桌子：「小哥您有所不知——前几天有个人从湖那边回来，说湖水清得能看见底。我说，那是人家的功劳，那碗茶不收钱。」"
msgstr "The waiter wipes down a table. \"You wouldn't know, young sir - a few days back a man came back from the lake way and said the water's so clear you can see the bottom. I said, that's somebody's doing. That cup of tea's on the house.\""

msgid "店小二擦着桌子：「小哥您有所不知——前几天有个人从湖那边回来，说湖底冰里站着一个人。我说，那是替咱们守着的，逢年过节，要给他留一碗酒。」"
msgstr "The waiter wipes down a table. \"You wouldn't know, young sir - a few days back a man came back from the lake way and said there's someone standing in the ice down at the bottom. I said, he's keeping watch for the rest of us. New Year and holidays, we pour him a bowl.\""

msgid "店小二擦着桌子：「前些日子有个客官从这儿走出去，就再没回来。楼上那间房，我一直给他留着。」"
msgstr "The waiter wipes down a table. \"A while back a guest walked out of here and never came back. That room upstairs - I'm keeping it for him.\""

msgid "终"
msgstr "The End"

msgid "那少年，留在了冰里。"
msgstr "That young man stayed in the ice."

msgid "以《东方故事 2》（Eastern Stories 2）为底。"
msgstr "Built on Eastern Stories 2 (东方故事 2)."

msgid "谢谢 ES2 的作者们，和 MUD 年代守着它的巫师们。"
msgstr "Thanks to the makers of ES2, and to the wizards who kept it going in the MUD years."

msgid "也谢谢你，走到了这里。"
msgstr "And thank you, for making it this far."

msgid "正月十七，九派过半，推你做了武林盟主。那天虹台上，你答了三件事。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, more than half of the nine schools named you Alliance Leader of the wulin. That day on the Rainbow Terrace, you answered three things."

msgid "正月十七，九派过半，颜违做了武林盟主。他说二十年的旧案，到此为止。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, more than half of the nine schools made Yan Wei Alliance Leader of the wulin. The twenty-year-old case, he said, ends here."

msgid "正月十七，颜违没能过半。卫沧澜走到石椅前，坐了回去。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, Yan Wei didn't get half. Wei Canglan walked up to the stone chair and sat back down in it."

msgid "正月十七，颜违没能过半，那把石椅还空着。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, Yan Wei didn't get half, and the stone chair is still empty."

msgid "那天一早，你在山道上截住了神教的杀手，山烟寺的轿子上了山。"
msgstr "Early that day, you cut off the Order's killer on the mountain road, and Mountain Mist Temple's sedan chair made it up the mountain."

msgid "那天一早，你回葬剑亭扑灭了逆灵宫余孽放的火。"
msgstr "Early that day, you went back to the Sword Tomb Pavilion and put out the fire set by the last of the Black Palace."

msgid "那天一早，你下山解了封山的围。"
msgstr "Early that day, you went down the mountain and broke the siege on Empty Mountain's people."

msgid "那天一早，你从山下的茶棚里请回了骆云舟。"
msgstr "Early that day, you brought Luo Yunzhou back from the tea shed at the foot of the mountain."

msgid "山烟寺的轿子在山道上让神教截了，玄智和尚没能上山。"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple's sedan chair was stopped by the Order on the mountain road, and the monk Xuanzhi never made it up."

msgid "葬剑亭的火烧了半个时辰，林忌提着剑一路追下了北麓。"
msgstr "The fire at the Sword Tomb Pavilion burned for half a double-hour, and Lin Ji chased all the way down to the North Foot, sword in hand."

msgid "封山的人在官道上让人堵到了天黑。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain's people were held up on the official road until dark."

msgid "骆云舟在山下的茶棚里，陪兵部的人喝了一整天的茶。"
msgstr "Luo Yunzhou spent the whole day drinking tea with the Ministry of War's men in the tea shed at the foot of the mountain."

msgid "旋芒供在了葬剑亭，用黄绫裹着，九派来往的人都看得见。"
msgstr "Whirling Edge rests in the Sword Tomb Pavilion, wrapped in yellow silk, where everyone of the nine schools who passes can see it."

msgid "你把旋芒还给了风。岚城云台的旋风里，它又转了起来。"
msgstr "You gave Whirling Edge back to the wind. In the whirlwind over the Wind City's Cloud Terrace, it spins again."

msgid "旋芒还在你身上。九派的人说起它，都说那是斩过湖底那颗头的剑。"
msgstr "You still carry Whirling Edge. When the nine schools speak of it, they all say it's the sword that cut down the head at the bottom of the lake."

msgid "那天一早，山下出了事，你没有下石阶。"
msgstr "Early that day there was trouble at the foot of the mountain, and you didn't go down the stone steps."

msgid "虹台上，陈剑秋当着九派说了一句「那本账烧了」，就再没有开口。"
msgstr "On the Rainbow Terrace, Chen Jianqiu said \"That ledger is burned\" before the nine schools, and said nothing more."

msgid "虹台上，陈剑秋坐在振远的旗下，没有提那本烧掉的账。"
msgstr "On the Rainbow Terrace, Chen Jianqiu sat under the Far-Road banner and didn't mention the burned ledger."

msgid "虹台上，陈剑秋替振远要了一个说法。他身后的绮云分局，门还关着。"
msgstr "On the Rainbow Terrace, Chen Jianqiu demanded an answer for the Far-Road Escorts. Behind him, the Cloudweave branch's door is still shut."

msgid "虹台上，陈剑秋坐在振远的旗下，没有提那本账。他身后的绮云分局，门还关着。"
msgstr "On the Rainbow Terrace, Chen Jianqiu sat under the Far-Road banner and didn't mention the ledger. Behind him, the Cloudweave branch's door is still shut."

msgid "虹台上，蓝止萍坐在晚月庄的旗下。神教的人在台下转了一圈，没有一个走近晚月庄那一席。"
msgstr "On the Rainbow Terrace, Lan Zhiping sat under Latemoon Manor's banner. The Order's people circled below the terrace once, and not one came near Latemoon Manor's seat."

msgid "虹台上，晚月庄的旗后面站着一个老妇人和她的女儿。九派里有人认得那把细剑，没有人说破。"
msgstr "On the Rainbow Terrace, behind Latemoon Manor's banner stood an old woman and her daughter. Some among the nine schools knew that slender sword; no one said so."

msgid "虹台上，花紫会的旗下坐着一个打二十三个结的老叫花子，一直看着台下官道上的官差。"
msgstr "On the Rainbow Terrace, under the Beggars' Guild's banner sat an old beggar with twenty-three knots, his eyes on the constables on the official road below."

msgid "虹台上，陆得财坐在花紫会的旗下抠着脚。腰里那只皮酒囊，多了一个结。"
msgstr "On the Rainbow Terrace, Lu Decai sat under the Beggars' Guild's banner picking at his feet. The leather wineskin at his waist has one more knot."

msgid "饮风客栈的店小二逢人便说：新盟主在小店住过，就住楼上那间。"
msgstr "The waiter at Drinkwind Inn tells everyone: the new Alliance Leader stayed at our little inn - in the room upstairs."

msgid "柳淳风说，盟主回来了，封山总算等到了这一天。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader is back, Liu Chunfeng says. Empty Mountain has finally lived to see the day."

msgid "北宗在虹台上有了一个座。柳淳风关了武馆的门，一天没有出来。"
msgstr "The North Branch has a seat on the Rainbow Terrace. Liu Chunfeng shut the hall's doors and didn't come out all day."

msgid "封山的人那天没能上山。柳淳风回来，只说了一句：明年再去。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain's people never made it up the mountain that day. When Liu Chunfeng came back, all he said was: we'll go next year."

msgid "北宗的人那天没能上山。柳淳风在武馆里听说了，一句话也没有说。"
msgstr "The North Branch never made it up the mountain that day. Liu Chunfeng heard about it in the hall and said not a word."

msgid "饮风客栈照旧开门。店小二说，正月十七那天，镇上的人都在等山上的消息。"
msgstr "Drinkwind Inn still opens its doors. On the seventeenth of the first month, the waiter says, the whole town was waiting for news from the mountain."

msgid "正厅的太师椅上，坐着颜违。山门的告示上写着：老松岭旧案，到此为止。"
msgstr "In the great armchair of the main hall sits Yan Wei. The notice at the mountain gate reads: The old case of Old Pine Ridge ends here."

msgid "正厅的太师椅上，坐着卫沧澜。二十年的空椅子，有了人。"
msgstr "In the great armchair of the main hall sits Wei Canglan. A chair empty for twenty years has someone in it."

msgid "正厅的太师椅空着。阁里的人说，那是盟主的椅子——盟主就是你，可你很少回来坐。"
msgstr "The great armchair of the main hall is empty. The people of the Pavilion say it's the Alliance Leader's chair - and the Alliance Leader is you, but you seldom come back to sit in it."

msgid "正厅的太师椅空着。颜违照旧代理，「代」字没能去掉。"
msgstr "The great armchair of the main hall is empty. Yan Wei is still acting, and the \"acting\" never came off."

msgid "正厅的太师椅空着，等一个回不来的人。"
msgstr "The great armchair of the main hall is empty, waiting for a man who can't come back."

msgid "老松岭的旧案重新翻了出来，水烟阁的人往京城去了几回。"
msgstr "The old case of Old Pine Ridge has been dug up again, and Waterfog Pavilion's people have gone to the Capital several times."

msgid "水烟阁同朝廷走近了。兵部来了人，在山门外喝了一回茶。"
msgstr "Waterfog Pavilion has drawn closer to the court. Men from the Ministry of War came and drank a cup of tea outside the mountain gate."

msgid "绮云镇 · 场院"
msgstr "Cloudweave Town · The Pleasure Yard"

msgid "九派逐了东方神教。棺材铺后面的场院关了门，朱鸿雪不知去向。"
msgstr "The nine schools drove out the Golden Crow Order. The Pleasure Yard behind the coffin shop has shut its gates, and no one knows where Zhu Hongxue has gone."

msgid "神教照旧在棺材铺后面的场院里派差事。九派说，只要不犯到他们头上。"
msgstr "The Order still hands out its jobs in the Pleasure Yard behind the coffin shop. As long as it doesn't come down on their heads, say the nine schools."

msgid "虹台上没有人提神教的事。朱鸿雪照旧派她的差事。"
msgstr "No one on the Rainbow Terrace mentioned the Order. Zhu Hongxue still hands out her jobs."

msgid "安妮儿闭了西厢的门。神教的事，她不再同人说起。"
msgstr "Anni'er has shut the west wing's door. She no longer speaks to anyone about the Order."

msgid "朱鸿雪记住了，那天山道上截住她的人的，是你。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue remembers: the one who cut her off on the mountain road that day was you."

msgid "北麓的道观空了，官兵封了山门。"
msgstr "The abbey on the North Foot is empty, and soldiers have sealed its gate."

msgid "下了山的道士在茅山的田里种地，坛上的火灭了。"
msgstr "The Daoists who came down the mountain farm Mount Mao's fields, and the fire on the altar is out."

msgid "九派的人上了北麓。道观里剩下的人，一个也没走脱。"
msgstr "The nine schools went up the North Foot. Of those left in the abbey, not one got away."

msgid "茅山的人上了北麓，把肯下山的领了回去。"
msgstr "Mount Mao's people went up the North Foot and led back those willing to come down."

msgid "官兵上了北麓，把道观里剩下的人领下了山。卫沧澜说，这一回欠朝廷的。"
msgstr "Soldiers went up the North Foot and led those left in the abbey down the mountain. This time, Wei Canglan says, we owe the court."

msgid "北麓的道观里，续灯的火一直没灭。"
msgstr "In the abbey on the North Foot, the lamp that's kept burning has never gone out."

msgid "林忌那天一路追到北麓，追回了两个放火的孩子。"
msgstr "That day Lin Ji chased all the way to the North Foot and brought back two children who had set the fire."

msgid "这是一把宝剑，隐含神秘力量。\n"
msgstr "This is a fine sword with some hidden, mysterious power in it.\n"

msgid "只有女生才可穿哦!你变态呀! \n"
msgstr "Only girls can wear this! What are you, some kind of pervert?\n"

msgid "这是一柄纤细的柳玉刀，轻薄短小。\n"
msgstr "This is a slender willow-jade saber, thin, light and short.\n"

msgid "这是一把用竹子作成的玉竹剑，手工细腻别致。\n"
msgstr "This is a jade-bamboo sword made of bamboo, finely and cleverly worked.\n"

msgid "这是一封用蜡密封起来的信件，上面有一奇怪的图案。\n"
msgstr "This is a letter sealed with wax, with a strange design on it.\n"

msgid "用火烧"
msgstr "Burn it"

msgid "你看见密函上出现几行字 : \n"
msgstr "You see several lines of writing appear on the letter:\n"

msgid "师父: \n      展信愉悦 \n    徒儿在晚月庄作客已有一阵子了!\n在这徒儿无意中发现晚月庄的秘密。\n一、原来晚月庄主是同性恋，她似乎在对男人失望之馀，\n    对比自己年轻的姑娘由恨转而成一种变相畸型的爱。\n二、在密室之中藏有一秘笈。以及庄内有一处有神奇宝物\n    玛瑙手镯。在另一神秘的地方有通往庄主秘密情人的\n    密室入口。\n三、在庄内小花池中有火神族的神像。小花池似乎有神奇\n    的力量在里头。\n"
msgstr "Shifu:\n      I hope this letter finds you well.\n    Your disciple has been a guest at Latemoon Manor for some time now!\nHere I have happened upon the manor's secrets.\n1. The Mistress of Latemoon Manor, it turns out, loves women. She seems to have lost\n    hope in men, and her hatred of them has turned into a twisted\n    sort of love for girls younger than herself.\n2. A secret manual is hidden in a secret room. Also, the manor holds a wondrous\n    treasure, an agate bracelet. And in another hidden place is the entrance to\n    a secret chamber where the Mistress keeps her secret lover.\n3. In the small flower pool inside the manor stands a statue of the Fire God clan.\n    The pool seems to hold some wondrous power.\n"

msgid "你身上没有火没法烧。\n"
msgstr "You have no fire to burn it with.\n"

msgid "一个黑木作的杀手令牌，上面刻著火焰的图腾标志。\n"
msgstr "An assassin's token of black wood, carved with the flame totem.\n"

msgid "这是一道香辣可口的佳肴。\n"
msgstr "This is a spicy, mouth-watering dish.\n"

msgid "这是一个手工细腻的水饺，看起来很好吃。\n"
msgstr "This is a finely made dumpling, and it looks delicious.\n"

msgid "这是一坛香味浓郁的陈年老酒，是存给待嫁女儿喝的酒。\n你闻了闻，好香好香哦!你有点想喝它 (drink)\n"
msgstr "This is a jar of rich, aged wine, put away for a daughter to drink when she marries.\nYou sniff it. So fragrant, so fragrant! You feel a bit like drinking it (drink)\n"

msgid "这是一只看了都会流口水的、香喷喷的烤鸭。\n"
msgstr "This is a fragrant roast duck that would make anyone drool.\n"

msgid "这是一个可以生火的火摺"
msgstr "This is a tinder tube for lighting fires."

msgid "这是一串用宝石镶串成的闪亮耳环。\n"
msgstr "This is a string of shining earrings set with gems.\n"

msgid "这是一个用钻石镶成的美丽胸饰。\n"
msgstr "This is a lovely brooch set with diamonds.\n"

msgid "这是一条丝绸制的彩带，质感佳，上绣有彩霞江水纹。\n"
msgstr "This is a silk sash of fine feel, embroidered with a pattern of rosy clouds and river water.\n"

msgid "这卷罗巾由上等丝绸编成，绣了一幅幅美女图。个个体态轻盈，翩然\n起舞。每一曲舞步姿态美妙迷人，旁题著舞曲名称与步法。\n"
msgstr "This silk handkerchief is woven of the finest silk and embroidered with pictures of beauties, each one light of build and dancing gracefully. Every dance is shown in a wondrous, charming pose, and beside each is written the name of the dance and its steps.\n"

msgid "这是一块精致可口的小点心，似雪花般柔软。\n"
msgstr "This is a fine, tasty little cake, soft as snowflakes.\n"

msgid "这是一根玉竹，还有一些竹叶在上面。\n"
msgstr "This is a stalk of jade bamboo, with a few bamboo leaves still on it.\n"

msgid "一种上等铁做成的绣花针\n"
msgstr "An embroidery needle made of fine iron.\n"

msgid "一种铁做成的绣花针\n"
msgstr "An embroidery needle made of iron.\n"

msgid "才摘的桂花，发出阵阵淡淡的幽香。\n"
msgstr "Freshly picked osmanthus, giving off a faint, hidden fragrance.\n"

msgid "这是一朵金黄色的奇特花蕊，有一种淡淡香气。\n"
msgstr "This is a strange golden flower heart with a faint fragrance.\n"

msgid "这是一杯香味浓郁上等好茶。是招待贵宾品茗的。\n你闻了闻，好香好香哦!\n"
msgstr "This is a cup of rich, fine tea, served to honored guests to sip.\nYou sniff it. So fragrant, so fragrant!\n"

msgid "金轩茶"
msgstr "Golden Pavilion tea"

msgid "这是一个竹蜻蜓，手工相当细腻。\n"
msgstr "This is a bamboo dragonfly, quite finely made.\n"

msgid "一个由玛瑙作成的美丽手镯。\n再仔细玩看，似乎有其它作用 (info bracelet)。\n"
msgstr "A lovely bracelet made of agate.\nLook it over more carefully, and it seems to have some other use (info bracelet).\n"

msgid "祈祷"
msgstr "Pray"

msgid "你双手合掌，虔诚的祈祷。\n手上的镯子嗡嗡作响。 突然一阵烟雾.... \n"
msgstr "You press your palms together and pray with devotion.\nThe bracelet on your hand hums. Suddenly a cloud of smoke.... \n"

msgid "这是一卷由上等丝绸编成，以湘绣作成的舞曲图。上有记载一些舞曲 \n每一曲都有它独特的风格与内涵。一幅幅玄天玉女翩然起舞，十分壮观。\n\n  曲目： \n \n  广陵散 \n  春宫怨 \n \n对你而言基本舞步你可以参悟，至于较高深步法似乎需人指导了。 \n"
msgstr "This is a scroll of fine silk, embroidered in Xiang style with dance pieces. It records several dances, \neach with its own style and meaning. Scene after scene shows the Jade Maiden of Dark Heaven dancing, a magnificent sight.\n\n  Pieces: \n \n  Song of Guangling \n  Spring Palace Lament \n \nYou can work out the basic steps for yourself; the higher steps seem to need someone to teach you. \n"

msgid "跳「春宫怨」"
msgstr "Dance \"Spring Palace Lament\""

msgid "你双手合掌，脚步轻盈。一曲『 春宫怨 』......\n"
msgstr "You press your palms together, your steps light. A dance, 'Spring Palace Lament'......\n"

msgid "这似乎是一本寒雪鞭法的前几页，虽然并没有关於招式的详细解说，可是\n前面有关鞭法的总纲与精义倒是不少。\n"
msgstr "This seems to be the first few pages of a Cold Snow Whip manual. It has no detailed explanation of the moves, \nbut there is a good deal in front on the whip's general principles and essence.\n"

msgid "一个闪闪发亮的黄金令牌，上有一些图腾标志。\n"
msgstr "A gleaming gold token, stamped with some totem marks.\n"

msgid "蓝雨梅是晚月庄主蓝止萍的养女，由于庄主不信任男子，因此\n晚月庄接待外宾的工作向来由她负责。\n"
msgstr "Lan Yumei is the adopted daughter of Lan Zhiping, Mistress of Latemoon Manor. Since the Mistress does not trust men, \nreceiving outside guests has always been her duty.\n"

msgid "蓝雨梅微笑著说道：我们晚月庄是『 以舞会友，以神换技 』\n"
msgstr "Lan Yumei says with a smile, \"Here at Latemoon Manor, we 'make friends through dance, and trade Spirit for skill.'\"\n"

msgid "蓝雨梅看你一脸疑惑！笑著说：我教你跳一曲『西出阳关』好吗?\n"
msgstr "Lan Yumei sees the puzzled look on your face! Smiling, she says, \"Shall I teach you to dance 'Westward Out of Yangguan'?\"\n"

msgid "蓝雨梅微笑著说道：我跳支舞给您看好不好？\n"
msgstr "Lan Yumei says with a smile, \"Shall I dance for you?\"\n"

msgid "蓝雨梅微笑著说道：我的舞跳得不好，待会儿我请芳绫跳舞给您看，别走远喔。\n"
msgstr "Lan Yumei says with a smile, \"I don't dance well. In a while I'll ask Fangling to dance for you. Don't go far, now.\"\n"

msgid "西出阳关"
msgstr "Westward Out of Yangguan"

msgid "『西出阳关』是一种幻影式舞步。可以移形换影。\n"
msgstr "'Westward Out of Yangguan' is a phantom-style dance. It lets you shift your form and shadow.\n"

msgid "学舞"
msgstr "Learn to dance"

msgid "来!我教你...『西出阳关』(dancing out)是 ..... \n经过雨梅指导后你渐渐懂了! \n"
msgstr "Come! I'll teach you... 'Westward Out of Yangguan' (dancing out) is ..... \nWith Yumei's guidance, you gradually understand! \n"

msgid "舞"
msgstr "Dance"

msgid "我会的舞是属于「幻影式舞步」。\n"
msgstr "The dances I know are the \"phantom-style steps.\"\n"

msgid "她是个可爱的女孩。不过有点任性，听说她贪玩被关在 \n禁闭室。听说她爱玩竹蜻蜓哦。\n"
msgstr "She's a sweet girl, though a bit willful. I hear she was too fond of play and got shut up in \nthe Confinement Room. And I hear she loves playing with bamboo dragonflies.\n"

msgid "庄内有人会用竹子作成不同物品。\n"
msgstr "Someone in the manor can make different things out of bamboo.\n"

msgid "沧海龙吟"
msgstr "Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea"

msgid "是一种失传以久的「寒谷龙舞」\n"
msgstr "It's a long-lost \"Cold Valley Dragon Dance.\"\n"

msgid "雨梅对你微笑，和善的对你说：\n  这位$RESPECT，你好！欢迎来到晚月庄。请坐！"
msgstr "Yumei smiles at you and says kindly:\n  \"Hello, $RESPECT! Welcome to Latemoon Manor. Please, have a seat!\""

msgid "雨梅对你微笑，纤细的双手捧著茶，\n 说道：这位$RESPECT，你好！欢迎来到晚月庄。请用茶！"
msgstr "Yumei smiles at you, holding a cup of tea in her slender hands,\n and says, \"Hello, $RESPECT! Welcome to Latemoon Manor. Please, have some tea!\""

msgid "这是上等金轩茶!您品尝一下。\n"
msgstr "This is the finest Golden Pavilion tea! Have a taste.\n"

msgid "她看起来像个小灵精，头上梳两个小包包头。\n她坐在地上，看到你看她便向你作了个鬼脸!\n你想她一定是调皮才会在这受罚!\n"
msgstr "She looks like a little imp, with two small buns in her hair.\nShe is sitting on the floor, and when she sees you looking, she pulls a face at you!\nShe must have been naughty to be punished here, you think!\n"

msgid "顽皮的芳绫向你扮个鬼脸。  *^G^* \n"
msgstr "Naughty Fangling pulls a face at you.  *^G^* \n"

msgid "芳绫走到中央，一个姿势(Pose)。哇!你没想到她跳舞时竟有此深造诣。\n"
msgstr "Fangling steps to the middle and strikes a pose. Wow! You never thought she'd be so deeply skilled at dancing.\n"

msgid "芳绫说：好不好看！这可是我花好久练成的哦! \n"
msgstr "Fangling says, \"Pretty, huh? It took me ages to learn this!\" \n"

msgid "芳绫缓缓的移动著，手上的动作变化万千，有一种说不出的美妙。\n"
msgstr "Fangling moves slowly, her hands changing form in endless ways, with a beauty you can't put into words.\n"

msgid "芳绫说：你好烦哦! 快走开! \n"
msgstr "Fangling says, \"You're so annoying! Go away!\" \n"

msgid "芳绫说：你想学可以去问昭仪姐，她会的比我多。嘻! \n"
msgstr "Fangling says, \"If you wanna learn, go ask Sister Zhaoyi. She knows more than I do. Hee!\" \n"

msgid "芳绫说：丑八怪! 不要烦我。走开啦! \n"
msgstr "Fangling says, \"Ugly! Stop bothering me. Go away!\" \n"

msgid "她嘟著嘴。有点生气的翻过头去，不理你！\n"
msgstr "She pouts. A little angry, she turns her head away and ignores you!\n"

msgid "谢谢!我已经告诉你秘密了呀!去找呀! "
msgstr "Thanks! I already told you the secret! Go find it!"

msgid "芳绫很开心的拿起竹蜻蜓把玩!\n"
msgstr "Fangling happily picks up the bamboo dragonfly and plays with it!\n"

msgid "满怀感激的谢谢你! 她小声的在你耳边说：\n"
msgstr "Full of gratitude, she thanks you! She whispers in your ear:\n"

msgid "『 庄内前厅某处藏有一宝物手镯哦!』\n"
msgstr "\"A treasure, a bracelet, is hidden somewhere in the front hall of the manor!\"\n"

msgid "你可以找找看! (search bracelet) \n"
msgstr "You can try to find it! (search bracelet) \n"

msgid "这要送给我啊?! 怎么好意思!谢谢你。"
msgstr "This is for me?! I'm so embarrassed! Thank you."

msgid "替跳"
msgstr "Dance in my place"

msgid "从地上一跃而起。"
msgstr " springs up from the floor."

msgid "沧海龙吟？！图跟谱都凑齐了？"
msgstr "Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea?! You found both the chart and the score?"

msgid "带我去佛堂——这支舞我做梦都想跳。蓝姐姐问起来，你替我扛着。"
msgstr "Take me to the Shrine Room. I've dreamed of dancing this one. If Sister Lan asks, you'll cover for me."

msgid "走呀走呀！密室在哪边？"
msgstr "Let's go, let's go! Which way is the secret room?"

msgid "我都替你跳过了！还要？"
msgstr "I already danced for you! You want more?"

msgid "从地上跳起来。"
msgstr " jumps up from the floor."

msgid "关着也闷死了！第二密室？带我去——蓝姐姐问起来，你替我扛着。"
msgstr "I'm bored to death shut in here! The Second Secret Room? Take me. If Sister Lan asks, you'll cover for me."

msgid "替什么跳？我在受罚呢。你先去问守衣人吧。"
msgstr "Dance for what? I'm being punished. Go ask the Robe-Keeper first."

msgid "芳绫踮着脚跟在你后面，一步一个花样。\n"
msgstr "Fangling tiptoes along behind you, a new trick with every step.\n"

msgid "晚月庄第三代弟子"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor Disciple, Third Generation"

msgid "她看起来非常可爱。身材玲珑有致，曲线苗条。\n第一眼印象，你觉的她舞蹈一定跳的不错，看她的一举一动\n有一种说不出的流畅优雅！\n"
msgstr "She looks very sweet. Her figure is slight and shapely, her lines slender.\nAt first glance you think she must dance very well. Every move she makes\nhas a flowing grace you can't quite name!\n"

msgid "昭仪以轻妙的舞步，在房内跳了起来!你看的入神。\n"
msgstr "Zhaoyi begins to dance in the room with light, nimble steps! You watch, entranced.\n"

msgid "昭仪抬头望著那幅图画，略有所思... \n"
msgstr "Zhaoyi looks up at the picture on the wall, lost in thought... \n"

msgid "这是一张非常真贵的湘绣舞曲图，我也在研究中。\n"
msgstr "This is a very precious embroidered dance chart. I'm studying it too.\n"

msgid "嗯 ...为这舞曲名。似乎雨梅姊知道。"
msgstr "Hmm... that's the name of a dance. I think Sister Yumei knows."

msgid "回头看了一眼墙上的图。"
msgstr " glances back at the chart on the wall."

msgid "庄主让你找它？步子就绣在这幅图上——你仔细看那几位姐姐的姿势。曲子图上没有，在舞曲谱里；欣芳姐知道谱放在哪。"
msgstr "The Mistress told you to look for it? The steps are embroidered on this chart. Look closely at the poses of those sisters. The tune isn't on the chart, it's in the dance score, and Sister Xinfang knows where the score is kept."

msgid "有凤来仪"
msgstr "The Phoenix Comes to Court"

msgid "嗯 ...为这舞曲名。(dancing yu-fong)很有名！ \n"
msgstr "Hmm... that's the name of a dance. (dancing yu-fong) It's very famous! \n"

msgid "「幻影式舞步」步法与地点都很重要。\n"
msgstr "For the \"phantom-style steps,\" both the steps and the place matter.\n"

msgid "她聪明伶俐，会跳一些自创的舞步。\n"
msgstr "She's clever and quick, and dances some steps of her own making.\n"

msgid "画"
msgstr "Chart"

msgid "沧海龙吟是一幅湘绣舞曲图，记载一些珍贵舞步。\n"
msgstr "Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea is an embroidered dance chart that records some precious dance steps.\n"

msgid "寒谷龙舞"
msgstr "Cold Valley Dragon Dance"

msgid "昭仪很奇怪的望著你，说道:嘻!你对舞有兴趣呀! "
msgstr "Zhaoyi looks at you oddly and says, \"Hee! So you're interested in dance, are you?\""

msgid "只见两眼溜来溜去，一种很神秘的表情，嘟著嘴。"
msgstr "Her eyes dart this way and that, a very mysterious look on her face, and she pouts."

msgid "过了一会说：好吧!偷偷跟你说，你可以查看墙上的图。(dragon-dance) "
msgstr "After a while she says, \"Fine! I'll tell you a secret. You can look at the chart on the wall. (dragon-dance)\""

msgid "...."
msgstr "...."

msgid "昭仪很高兴的看著你，说道:嘻!你对舞有兴趣呀!"
msgstr "Zhaoyi looks at you happily and says, \"Hee! So you're interested in dance!\""

msgid "这有一幅图画，我从那悟到好多新舞步哦! "
msgstr "There's a picture here. I learned lots of new dance steps from it!"

msgid "『 沧海龙吟』是一首失传以久的舞曲。传说...."
msgstr "'Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea' is a dance lost for a long time. They say...."

msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

msgid "她长得十分漂亮！让你忍不住多瞧她几眼，从她身上\n你闻到淡淡的香气。她很有礼貌的向你点头，优雅的\n动作，轻盈的步伐，好美哦!\n"
msgstr "She is very beautiful! You can't help looking at her a few more times, and from her\nyou catch a faint fragrance. She nods to you with great courtesy. Her graceful\nmovements and light steps are so lovely!\n"

msgid "我舞跳的不好!我比较喜欢静态的活动。\n"
msgstr "I don't dance well! I prefer quiet pastimes.\n"

msgid "听说她贪玩被关在禁闭室。她最爱玩竹蜻蜓了! \n"
msgstr "I hear she was too fond of play and got shut up in the Confinement Room. She loves bamboo dragonflies most of all! \n"

msgid "昭蓉对你微笑，和善的对你点点头。"
msgstr "Zhaorong smiles at you and nods kindly."

msgid "昭蓉对你微笑，以纤细轻柔的声音 \n 说道：这位$RESPECT，你好！欢迎来到晚月庄。"
msgstr "Zhaorong smiles at you and says in a slender, gentle voice:\n \"Hello, $RESPECT! Welcome to Latemoon Manor.\""

msgid "密函里写的就是它。师父要我在庄里住着，等——等有人把它拿出来。"
msgstr "That's what the letter is about. Shifu told me to stay at the manor and wait. Wait until someone brings it out."

msgid "天山派也想要它。守衣的那个女人我打不过，等着看谁打得过。"
msgstr "The Tianshan School wants it too. I can't beat the woman who keeps the robe, so I'll wait and see who can."

msgid "她国色天香，娇丽无伦；温柔娴静，秀绝人寰。\n她姿容绝美，世所罕见。从她身旁你闻道一寒谷\n幽香。\n"
msgstr "She is a beauty beyond compare, delicate and lovely, gentle and serene, a loveliness rare in this world.\nBeside her you catch the hidden fragrance of Cold Valley.\n"

msgid "她是惜春的妹妹，跟姐姐从小就在晚月庄\n长大。因为与双亲失散，被庄主收留。平\n常帮忙庄内琐碎事务。\n"
msgstr "She is Xichun's younger sister. She grew up at Latemoon Manor with her sister,\ntaken in by the Mistress after losing touch with her parents. She\nusually helps with the manor's small chores.\n"

msgid "她看起来很有活力，两眼明亮有神。给你\n一种巾帼不让须眉的气势，但刚毅之中似\n又隐含著女孩子有的娇柔。\n"
msgstr "She looks full of life, her eyes bright and keen. She gives you the feeling\nof a woman who is the equal of any man, yet within that firmness\nthere seems to be a girl's gentle charm.\n"

msgid "阁下! 这里是庄内后厅厢房。不方便男客进入哦! \n请随手关门，并保持安静! 谢谢! \n"
msgstr "Sir! These are the rear hall's wing rooms. Men are not welcome inside! \nPlease close the door behind you and keep quiet! Thank you! \n"

msgid "看管人"
msgstr "Keeper"

msgid "这个老妇人不知姓甚名谁, 她在晚月很久了, 一直看管\n书房, 连庄主都对她很尊敬。\n"
msgstr "Nobody knows this old woman's name. She has been at Latemoon for a very long time and has always looked after \nthe study. Even the Mistress treats her with respect.\n"

msgid "前辈"
msgstr "Senior"

msgid "这里是书房，有些鞭法教材存放在这儿。"
msgstr "This is the study. Some whip teaching texts are kept here."

msgid "心事"
msgstr "What weighs on your mind"

msgid "坐在窗下，没有抬头，也没有开口。"
msgstr " sits under the window, not looking up and not speaking."

msgid "她在这屋里。我压了这些年的心事，你替我了了。"
msgstr "She's in this room. I've carried this weight for years. You settle it for me."

msgid "低下头。"
msgstr " lowers her head."

msgid "她都跟你说了？……道观、神教——当年是我把她送出庄门的。"
msgstr "She told you everything?... The Daoist temple, the Order. I was the one who sent her out of the manor gate, back then."

msgid "去问问她。她不对我说的话，也许会对你说。她就在这屋里。"
msgstr "Go and ask her. What she won't say to me, she may say to you. She's in this room."

msgid "去问问她。她不对我说的话，也许会对你说。夜里，后山的竹林。"
msgstr "Go and ask her. What she won't say to me, she may say to you. At night, in the bamboo grove on the back hill."

msgid "实不相瞒，这杀手是我的私生女，但已误入歧途 ...\n我一直舍不得亲手杀了她，你若能帮忙我会非常感谢。 \n只是要以令牌为证，唉 ..."
msgstr "To be frank, this assassin is my illegitimate daughter, but she has gone astray...\nI could never bring myself to kill her with my own hands. If you can help, I'll be very grateful.\nOnly, it must be proven with the token. Sigh..."

msgid "沉默了很久。"
msgstr " says nothing for a long time."

msgid "……这些年我想的，其实不是这个。我想知道她为什么走到这一步，可她从来不对我说。"
msgstr "...That's not really what I've been thinking about all these years. I wanted to know why she came to this, but she never tells me."

msgid "她就在这屋里，蒙着面，在书架那边走来走去——你看她的眉眼。替我问她一声「娘」。"
msgstr "She's in this room, veiled, pacing by the bookshelves. Look at her eyes and brows. Ask her about \"Mother\" for me."

msgid "那一夜之后，她再没进过庄门。可我知道她没走远：夜里，庄后山路尽头的竹林里有人在哭。替我去问她一声「娘」。"
msgstr "After that night she never set foot in the manor again. But I know she didn't go far. At night, in the bamboo grove at the end of the road up the back hill, someone weeps. Go and ask her about \"Mother\" for me."

msgid "令牌在我这里。她还活着——这就够了。"
msgstr "The token is with me. She's still alive. That's enough."

msgid "你还给了神教？……也好。那块东西，本来就不该在晚月庄。"
msgstr "You gave it back to the Order?... Just as well. That thing never belonged at Latemoon Manor."

msgid "令牌在你手上？给我。我不要它为证她死了——我要它为证她还活着。"
msgstr "The token is in your hands? Give it to me. I don't want it as proof she is dead. I want it as proof she is alive."

msgid "就在我儿身上 ...你拿到了就给我。"
msgstr "It's on my child... Bring it to me when you get it."

msgid "衣在庄里几百年了。它在，庄就在；它走了，庄里的人就得自己守了。"
msgstr "The robe has been in the manor for hundreds of years. While it stays, the manor stands. If it goes, the people here must guard themselves."

msgid "女儿"
msgstr "Daughter"

msgid "带她回来：她留在晚月庄，跟着她娘守内书房，不再蒙面。\n晚月庄这一票投旧盟主（不要官府、也不要颜违管到庄里来）（已经入了虹台的席的，这一票不再跟着变）；蓝止萍从此对你冷一分。本庄弟子的执事，由老妇向庄主讨。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Bring her back: she stays at Latemoon Manor and keeps the Inner Study with her mother, no longer veiled.\nThe manor's vote at the Assembly goes to the old leader (no officials, and no Yan Wei meddling in the manor) (if you already took a seat at Rainbow Terrace, this vote will not change again); Lan Zhiping will be colder to you from now on. The old woman will ask the Mistress to give the manor's disciples their duties.\nSay it that way?"

msgid "她在这里。"
msgstr "She's here."

msgid "你已经不是晚月庄的人了。这是晚月庄的事。"
msgstr "You're no longer one of Latemoon Manor. This is Latemoon Manor's business."

msgid "走过去，伸手把女儿脸上的面巾摘了下来。"
msgstr " walks over and pulls the veil from her daughter's face."

msgid "她是我女儿。我把她送出去过一回，不送第二回。"
msgstr "She is my daughter. I sent her away once. I won't send her away twice."

msgid "庄主那里，我去说。"
msgstr "I'll speak to the Mistress myself."

msgid "她的令牌已经在我这里了。"
msgstr "Her token is with me already."

msgid "你把她那块令还给了神教。别的令牌，我不要。"
msgstr "You gave her token back to the Order. I don't want any other token."

msgid "接过令牌，攥在手心里，手在抖。"
msgstr " takes the token and grips it in her palm, her hand shaking."

msgid "她还活着……我拿着它，就知道她还活着。"
msgstr "She's alive... holding this, I know she's alive."

msgid "作为感谢，我传你一些内力。"
msgstr "In thanks, I'll pass some Inner Force to you."

msgid "无名老妇手抵在你的后心，头上冒出丝丝白气。\n"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman presses a hand against your back, thin wisps of white steam rising from her head.\n"

msgid "你感觉到一股热气传了过来。\n"
msgstr "You feel a rush of heat pass into you.\n"

msgid "把令牌交给无名老妇：她知道女儿还活着，给你一份谢礼（谢礼只给一回）。\n令牌给了她，就不能再还给朱鸿雪了。\n要给吗？"
msgstr "Give the token to the Nameless Old Woman: she will know her daughter is alive, and give you a gift of thanks (once only).\nOnce she has it, you can no longer return it to Zhu Hongxue.\nGive it?"

msgid "作为感谢，我给你一本寒雪鞭法密笈。"
msgstr "In thanks, I'll give you a Cold Snow Whip secret manual."

msgid "谢礼，我早先给过你一回了。这一回，是我欠你的。"
msgstr "I gave you my thanks once before. This time, it's me who owes you."

msgid "我要的不是令牌。你见过她了么？"
msgstr "It's not the token I want. Have you seen her?"

msgid "令牌我收过一回了。谢礼，也只给一回。"
msgstr "I've taken a token from you once. And the gift of thanks is given only once."

msgid "无名老妇坐在书房里，手里的鞭子一直没举起来。\n"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman sits in the study, the whip in her hand never raised.\n"

msgid "无名老妇坐在书房里，把那根鞭子横在膝上，一下一下地擦。\n"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman sits in the study with the whip across her knees, wiping it, again and again.\n"

msgid "无名老妇坐在书房的窗下，一句话也不说。\n"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman sits under the study window, not saying a word.\n"

msgid "无名老妇和她女儿对坐在窗下，一个擦鞭子，一个擦剑。\n"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman and her daughter sit facing each other under the window, one wiping a whip, the other a sword.\n"

msgid "是她。我听见前厅的声音就知道是她。我没拦住——我一直没拦住。"
msgstr "It's her. I knew it was her the moment I heard the sound in the front hall. I couldn't stop her. I never could stop her."

msgid "抬起头，看着东厢的方向。"
msgstr " raises her head and looks toward the East Wing."

msgid "衣回来了？……好。庄里还守得住。"
msgstr "The robe is back?... Good. The manor can still be held."

msgid "坐在窗下，手里攥着那块黑木令牌，没有抬头。"
msgstr " sits under the window, clutching the black-wood token, not looking up."

msgid "坐在窗下，两只手空空地搁在膝上，没有抬头。"
msgstr " sits under the window, both hands empty on her knees, not looking up."

msgid "回来了就好。……庄主那里，执事的事我替你讨了。"
msgstr "Good that she's back. ...As for the Mistress and the matter of her duties, I've asked on your behalf."

msgid "这是个蒙面杀手，眉眼看起来有些面熟。\n"
msgstr "This is a masked assassin, and the eyes and brows look a little familiar.\n"

msgid "蒙面杀手喝道：为什么杀我？\n"
msgstr "The Masked Assassin shouts, \"Why kill me?\"\n"

msgid "蒙面杀手叹道：你知道我心里有多痛苦吗？！\n"
msgstr "The Masked Assassin sighs, \"Do you know how much pain I'm in?!\"\n"

msgid "娘"
msgstr "Mother"

msgid "令牌丢了？……"
msgstr "The token is lost?..."

msgid "又从怀里摸出一块黑木令牌，丢给你。"
msgstr " pulls another black-wood token from her robe and tosses it to you."

msgid "拿好。神教给我的令，不止一块。"
msgstr "Take it. The Order gave me more than one."

msgid "我说完了。"
msgstr "I'm done."

msgid "的手停在剑柄上，很久没有动。"
msgstr "'s hand stops on her sword hilt and stays there a long time."

msgid "她让你来问的？……她从来不问。"
msgstr "She sent you to ask?... She never asks."

msgid "我七岁那年，她把我送出了庄门——晚月庄容不下一个来历不明的孩子。北麓有个道观收孩子，说是收道童。"
msgstr "When I was seven, she sent me out of the manor gate. Latemoon Manor had no room for a child of unknown origin. There was a Daoist temple on the north foothills that took in children, said it took in young acolytes."

msgid "那里的人不念经，只教剑。六阴追魂剑，从追魂那一部学起；学不会的孩子，后来就不见了。"
msgstr "The people there recited no scriptures. They only taught the sword. The Six-Chaos Sword, starting from the Soul-Chasing part. The children who couldn't learn it were gone after a while."

msgid "我是自己逃出来的。东方神教收留了我，给了我这块令。"
msgstr "I got out by myself. The Golden Crow Order took me in and gave me this token."

msgid "朱鸿雪派我回晚月庄：我是她的女儿，内书房的门对我开着，宝衣藏在哪里，我看得见。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue sent me back to Latemoon Manor: I'm her daughter, the door of the Inner Study is open to me, and wherever the robe is hidden, I can see it."

msgid "我在这屋里住了三年。宝衣一直在瑷伦身上，我一回也没有动手。"
msgstr "I lived in this house for three years. The robe was on Ailun the whole time, and I never once made a move."

msgid "从腰间解下一块黑木令牌，丢给你。"
msgstr " unties a black-wood token from her waist and tosses it to you."

msgid "拿去。给她，还是还给神教，你定。我累了。"
msgstr "Take it. Give it to her or give it back to the Order, you decide. I'm tired."

msgid "杀手站在书架边，剑在鞘里，手离剑柄远远的。\n"
msgstr "The assassin stands by the bookshelves, her sword in its sheath, her hand far from the hilt.\n"

msgid "她看起来成熟中带有一些稚气。飘逸的长发\n十分迷人。她是个孤儿，从小与妹妹圆春被\n庄主收留，她很聪明，在第四代弟子中算是\n武功很出色的一个。\n"
msgstr "She looks mature, with a touch of the girl still in her. Her flowing long hair\nis very charming. She is an orphan, taken in by the Mistress with her younger sister Yuanchun\nwhen they were small. She's very clever, and among the Fourth Generation disciples\nher martial arts are quite outstanding.\n"

msgid "晚月庄开山祖师"
msgstr "Founder of Latemoon Manor"

msgid "她看上去三十七岁。庄里最老的仆妇说，她小时候见到的瑷伦也是这张脸。鞭子挂在腰上，手搭在鞭柄上，像搭在一个老朋友的肩上。\n"
msgstr "She looks 37. The oldest servant woman in the manor says that the Ailun she saw as a child had this same face. The whip hangs at her waist and her hand rests on its handle, like a hand on an old friend's shoulder.\n"

msgid "叫瑷伦随你下湖？她穿着宝衣跟你去玉螺湖，等事情了结。"
msgstr "Ask Ailun to go down the lake with you? She will wear the robe and go with you to Jade Conch Lake, until this is settled."

msgid "我去湖边等你。"
msgstr "I'll wait for you at the lake."

msgid "站起来，把宝衣的带子系紧。"
msgstr " stands and ties the robe's sash tight."

msgid "三百年……不，比三百年长。走吧，我在湖边等你。"
msgstr "Three hundred years... no, longer than that. Let's go. I'll wait for you at the lake."

msgid "还不到时候。等湖底那颗头醒了，你再来叫我。"
msgstr "It isn't time yet. When the head in the lakebed wakes, come and call me."

msgid "湖底？你问错人了。"
msgstr "The lakebed? You're asking the wrong person."

msgid "衣在我身上。决战那日，你来叫我。"
msgstr "The robe is on me. On the day of the final battle, come and call me."

msgid "衣出过庄，又回来了。决战那日，你来叫我。"
msgstr "The robe left the manor and came back. On the day of the final battle, come and call me."

msgid "衣在你身上。你说留着，就留着——别丢了它。"
msgstr "The robe is on you. If you say keep it, keep it. Don't lose it."

msgid "衣出了庄。你带着它，就别再回头问我。"
msgstr "The robe left the manor. Since you carry it, don't come back asking me."

msgid "你把它给了西厢那个人。几百年的东西，一句话就换了主。"
msgstr "You gave it to the one in the West Wing. Something hundreds of years old, and one word changed its owner."

msgid "衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」。我说过了。"
msgstr "The robe is in the ice chest in the Second Secret Room, and the chest answers only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court.\" I told you already."

msgid "你接住了。再问你一句：你拿它去做什么？——斩鬼，交给别人，还是你自己也不知道。想好了告诉我。"
msgstr "You caught it. One more question: what will you do with it? Slay the ghost, give it to someone else, or you don't know yourself? Think it over and tell me."

msgid "潘军禅的嘴向来快。是，衣在庄里，我守着。守了几百年——你看我多大？"
msgstr "Pan Junchan's mouth was always quick. Yes, the robe is in the manor, and I guard it. I've guarded it for hundreds of years. How old do you think I am?"

msgid "宝衣不白给。接我三鞭，站着不倒，我们再谈。"
msgstr "The robe isn't given away for nothing. Take three lashes from me, stay on your feet, and then we'll talk."

msgid "南危水肯开口，是你的本事。是，衣在庄里，我守着。守了几百年——你看我多大？"
msgstr "If Nan Weishui was willing to speak, that's your doing. Yes, the robe is in the manor, and I guard it. I've guarded it for hundreds of years. How old do you think I am?"

msgid "什么宝衣？老身只会教鞭。"
msgstr "What robe? This old woman only teaches the whip."

msgid "为了斩鬼"
msgstr "To slay the ghost"

msgid "这是你给守衣人的答复，说出去就改不了。"
msgstr "This is your answer to the Robe-Keeper. Once said, it can't be taken back."

msgid "寒於留它，本来就是为这个。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」——那支舞你跳得成，我教你记住它的名字。"
msgstr "Hanyu left it for exactly this. The robe is in the ice chest in the Second Secret Room, and the chest answers only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court.\" If you can dance that dance, I'll teach you to remember its name."

msgid "开了匣，衣是你的。带走，还是留给我守到决战那日，你自己定。"
msgstr "Once the chest is open, the robe is yours. Take it away, or leave it with me to keep until the day of the final battle. That's for you to decide."

msgid "寒於留它，本来就是为这个。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」——那是玄天玉女的步法，男子跳不成。"
msgstr "Hanyu left it for exactly this. The robe is in the ice chest in the Second Secret Room, and the chest answers only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court.\" That is a step of the Jade Maiden of Dark Heaven, and a man can't dance it."

msgid "请庄里的姑娘替你跳：筱薇在内厅，或者禁闭房里那个贪玩的芳绫。开了匣，衣是你的。带走，还是留给我守到决战那日，你自己定。"
msgstr "Ask one of the manor's girls to dance it for you: Xiaowei in the Inner Hall, or that mischievous Fangling in the Confinement Room. Once the chest is open, the robe is yours. Take it away, or leave it with me to keep until the day of the final battle. That's for you to decide."

msgid "你答过了。"
msgstr "You already answered."

msgid "先接我三鞭。"
msgstr "Take my three lashes first."

msgid "交给安妮儿"
msgstr "Give it to Anni'er"

msgid "脸冷了下来。"
msgstr "'s face goes cold."

msgid "西厢那个人等了三年，等的就是你这句话。我不拦——拿得走就拿。"
msgstr "The one in the West Wing has waited three years for those very words from you. I won't stop you. If you can take it, take it."

msgid "衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」。你跳得成，记住它的名字。"
msgstr "The robe is in the ice chest in the Second Secret Room, and the chest answers only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court.\" If you can dance it, remember its name."

msgid "衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」，男子跳不成。请筱薇或者芳绫替你跳。"
msgstr "The robe is in the ice chest in the Second Secret Room, and the chest answers only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court\"; a man can't dance it. Ask Xiaowei or Fangling to dance it for you."

msgid "安妮儿？你连她在等什么都没问过，就要替她拿衣？"
msgstr "Anni'er? You haven't even asked what she's waiting for, and you want to take the robe for her?"

msgid "不知道"
msgstr "I don't know"

msgid "不知道，比胡说一个好。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」——你跳得成，记住它的名字。"
msgstr "Better to say you don't know than to talk nonsense. The robe is in the ice chest in the Second Secret Room, and the chest answers only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court.\" If you can dance it, remember its name."

msgid "开了匣再想。带走，还是留给我守到决战那日。"
msgstr "Think again once the chest is open. Take it away, or leave it with me to keep until the day of the final battle."

msgid "不知道，比胡说一个好。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」，男子跳不成——请筱薇或者芳绫替你跳。"
msgstr "Better to say you don't know than to talk nonsense. The robe is in the ice chest in the Second Secret Room, and the chest answers only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court\"; a man can't dance it. Ask Xiaowei or Fangling to dance it for you."

msgid "还衣"
msgstr "Return the robe"

msgid "把寒於宝衣还给瑷伦：她又是守衣人，池边的凤凰回来；决战那日问她「湖底」，她穿着它跟你下湖。\n宝衣从此不在你身上，下湖时没有它挡寒气。\n要还吗？"
msgstr "Return Hanyu's Robe to Ailun: she becomes the Robe-Keeper again, and the phoenix by the pool returns. On the day of the final battle, ask her about \"lakebed\" and she will wear it and go down the lake with you.\nThe robe will no longer be on you, and you'll have nothing to turn the cold aside when you go down.\nReturn it?"

msgid "衣在湖底烧了。它挡在了该挡的地方，不必再说还不还。"
msgstr "The robe burned in the lakebed. It stood where it needed to stand. There's no more need to talk of returning it or not."

msgid "衣在我身上了。"
msgstr "The robe is on me already."

msgid "你说过留着。"
msgstr "You said keep it."

msgid "native:latemoon/cold_robe"
msgstr "native:latemoon/cold_robe"

msgid "看着你手里的衣，很久没有伸手。"
msgstr " looks at the robe in your hands and does not reach for it for a long time."

msgid "出了庄门的衣，我说过不收。"
msgstr "A robe that has left the manor gate, I said I would not take back."

msgid "接过宝衣，抖开，披在肩上。衣角落下去的时候，屋里凉了一截。"
msgstr " takes the robe, shakes it out and drapes it over her shoulders. As the hem falls, the room goes a degree colder."

msgid "……可它回来了。我守到决战那日——到时候你来叫我，我跟你下湖底。"
msgstr "...But it came back. I'll keep it until the day of the final battle. When it comes, call me, and I'll go down to the lakebed with you."

msgid "衣不在你身上，就别说还。"
msgstr "If the robe isn't on you, don't talk of returning it."

msgid "还什么？"
msgstr "Return what?"

msgid "宝衣留在你身上：瑷伦不再问，庄里照旧没有护佑。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Keep the robe: Ailun will not ask again, and the manor will go on without its protection.\nSay it that way?"

msgid "衣已经回来了。"
msgstr "The robe is back already."

msgid "说过了。"
msgstr "You said so already."

msgid "你说过，为了斩鬼。那就带着它去斩。"
msgstr "You said it was to slay the ghost. Then take it and go slay it."

msgid "你说过要交给西厢那个人，到头来自己带着。也好——总比给她好。"
msgstr "You said you'd give it to the one in the West Wing, and in the end you carry it yourself. Just as well. Better than giving it to her."

msgid "没有说话，过了一会儿才开口。"
msgstr " says nothing, and only after a while speaks."

msgid "你说过你不知道拿它做什么。带着吧——到了湖底那一天，你就知道了。"
msgstr "You said you didn't know what to do with it. Keep it, then. On the day you reach the lakebed, you'll know."

msgid "留着什么？"
msgstr "Keep what?"

msgid "拜师! 不敢当，我都老了!你去找「芷萍」好了，看她收不收你?"
msgstr "Become my disciple? I wouldn't dare, I'm too old now! Go and find \"Zhiping\" instead. See whether she'll take you?"

msgid "老身不收男徒!"
msgstr "This old woman takes no male disciples!"

msgid "瑷伦说道：小心了，这是第一鞭..."
msgstr "Ailun says, \"Careful now, this is the first lash...\""

msgid "瑷伦面露微笑：好！第二鞭来了..."
msgstr "Ailun smiles. \"Good! Here comes the second lash...\""

msgid "瑷伦叹了口气道：看来还是不行啊..."
msgstr "Ailun sighs and says, \"It seems it still won't do...\""

msgid "瑷伦鼓励道：很不错，看这最后一鞭..."
msgstr "Ailun says encouragingly, \"Very good. Now watch for the last lash...\""

msgid "瑷伦叹了口气道：太可惜了！"
msgstr "Ailun sighs and says, \"What a pity!\""

msgid "瑷伦露出慈祥的面容：看来我没看错人。"
msgstr "Ailun's face turns kind. \"It seems I didn't misjudge you.\""

msgid "晚月庄第一代弟子"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor Disciple, First Generation"

msgid "接她三鞭"
msgstr "Take her three lashes"

msgid "瑷伦的三鞭是真打：\n· 每一鞭都实打实地落在你身上。\n· 哪一鞭接不住，就算没接下：你会昏倒，但不伤性命、不留伤，歇一会儿就能再来。\n· 接不接得住看气长不长：气随内力上限涨，内力上限靠打坐——先向师父学一门内功、装上，再去打坐。\n确定接她三鞭吗？"
msgstr "Ailun's three lashes are real:\n- Each lash lands on you in earnest.\n- A lash you cannot take counts as not taken: you will pass out, but you will not be killed or hurt, and can try again after a rest.\n- Whether you can take them depends on how long your Qi lasts. Qi rises with your Inner Force cap, and your Inner Force cap rises by meditation: first learn an inner art from a shifu, equip it, and then meditate.\nAre you sure you want to take her three lashes?"

msgid "瑷伦看了你很久：倒了两回，还站到我面前来。这份硬气，我认——这三鞭，我不用内力。"
msgstr "Ailun looks at you for a long time. \"You fell twice, and still you stand before me. I respect that kind of toughness. For these three lashes, I will not use Inner Force.\""

msgid "瑷伦摆摆手：你的气还没喘匀。歇好了再来。"
msgstr "Ailun waves her hand. \"You haven't caught your breath yet. Come back when you've rested.\""

msgid "瑷伦收起鞭子：站得住。那就再问你一句——你拿它去做什么？"
msgstr "Ailun puts away her whip. \"You can stand. Then I'll ask you one more thing: what will you do with it?\""

msgid "接下了守衣人瑷伦的三鞭"
msgstr "Took the Robe-Keeper Ailun's three lashes"

msgid "衣要还，你开口说一声。"
msgstr "If the robe is to be returned, say so."

msgid "出了庄门的衣，不是晚月庄的了。拿走吧。"
msgstr "A robe that has left the manor gate is no longer Latemoon Manor's. Take it."

msgid "我守到决战那日。到时候你来叫我，我跟你下湖底。"
msgstr "I'll keep it until the day of the final battle. When it comes, call me, and I'll go down to the lakebed with you."

msgid "守衣人"
msgstr "Robe-Keeper"

msgid "瑷伦的手搭在腰间，那里多了一层月白的衣角。\n"
msgstr "Ailun's hand rests at her waist, where a layer of moon-white cloth now shows.\n"

msgid "瑷伦说：决战那日，你来叫我。\n"
msgstr "Ailun says, \"On the day of the final battle, come and call me.\"\n"

msgid "瑷伦望着东厢的窗，很久没动。\n"
msgstr "Ailun gazes at the East Wing window, not moving for a long while.\n"

msgid "瑷伦低声说：几百年……到我手里丢的。\n"
msgstr "Ailun says in a low voice, \"Hundreds of years... and it was lost in my hands.\"\n"

msgid "看了你一眼，又看向你空着的手。"
msgstr " glances at you, then at your empty hands."

msgid "衣出了庄，凤凰暗了。前厅的事你看见了——那是衣走了的价钱。"
msgstr "The robe has left the manor, and the phoenix has gone dark. You saw what happened in the front hall. That was the price of the robe leaving."

msgid "没有看你。"
msgstr " does not look at you."

msgid "你把它给了西厢那个人。凤凰暗了，前厅死了人——几百年的东西，一句话就换了主。"
msgstr "You gave it to the one in the West Wing. The phoenix has gone dark, and someone died in the front hall. Something hundreds of years old, and one word changed its owner."

msgid "手搭在膝上那件月白的衣上，没有抬头。"
msgstr " rests a hand on the moon-white robe on her knees, head down."

msgid "蓝止萍让你来要？"
msgstr "Lan Zhiping sent you to ask for it?"

msgid "衣在我这里。月神族守了几百年，守给我的——这话我对你说过。回去告诉她：湖上出事那天，衣会在该在的地方。"
msgstr "The robe is with me. The Moon God clan guarded it for hundreds of years, and guarded it for me. That is what I told you. Go back and tell her: the day trouble comes to the lake, the robe will be where it ought to be."

msgid "它在我这里。你记得这一点就够了——东方神教也记得。"
msgstr "It is with me. Remember that and it's enough. The Golden Crow Order remembers it too."

msgid "衣回了瑷伦身上？……出过庄的衣，回得去。你倒比我想的懂它。"
msgstr "The robe is back on Ailun?... A robe that has left the manor can go back. You understand it better than I thought."

msgid "宝衣出了庄。你的名字，我记下了。"
msgstr "The robe left the manor. I've noted your name."

msgid "守衣人让你过了？那她看中了你。我在西厢住了三年，等一件东西，也等一个配得上它的人——衣交给我，不比交给一个几百年不出庄的人差。"
msgstr "The Robe-Keeper let you pass? Then she thinks well of you. I've lived in the West Wing for three years, waiting for a thing, and for someone worthy of it. Giving the robe to me is no worse than giving it to someone who hasn't left the manor in hundreds of years."

msgid "我在西厢住了三年，等一件东西，也等一个配得上它的人。你是哪一个？"
msgstr "I've lived in the West Wing for three years, waiting for a thing, and for someone worthy of it. Which are you?"

msgid "等谁"
msgstr "Who you're waiting for"

msgid "门关着。神教的事，去问你的教主。"
msgstr "The door is closed. For the Order's business, ask your Leader."

msgid "不等了。教主令收回来了，你身上有黄金令——想学天山的剑，就在这里学（「请教」）。"
msgstr "I'm done waiting. The Leader's token is back, and you carry the gold token. If you want to learn the Tianshan sword, learn it here (\"Learn\")."

msgid "把膝上的衣叠好，站起身来。"
msgstr " folds the robe on her knees and stands up."

msgid "朱鸿雪的名单上，还差最后一个名字。我知道是谁。"
msgstr "On Zhu Hongxue's list, one name is still missing. I know whose."

msgid "到场院去。我会在那里。"
msgstr "Go to the Pleasure Yard. I'll be there."

msgid "膝上空着。她看了你一会儿。"
msgstr "Her lap is empty. She looks at you for a while."

msgid "朱鸿雪派你来的。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue sent you."

msgid "衣烧了，在湖底。我等的东西，用过了——它最后挡在了该挡的地方。"
msgstr "The robe burned, at the bottom of the lake. What I waited for has been used. In the end it stood where it needed to stand."

msgid "我不用再等了。神教还想要什么，让她自己来西厢问我。"
msgstr "I don't need to wait any longer. Whatever the Order still wants, let her come to the West Wing and ask me herself."

msgid "回去告诉朱鸿雪吧。你可以照实说。"
msgstr "Go back and tell Zhu Hongxue. You may tell her the truth."

msgid "衣在我这里。可它不是神教的——它守的是湖底的东西，不是谁家的香火。"
msgstr "The robe is with me. But it isn't the Order's. What it guards is what lies at the bottom of the lake, not anyone's incense."

msgid "我等的是那一天：湖底那东西醒的那一天，衣该在一个配得上它的人身上。也许是你，也许是别人。不会是朱鸿雪。"
msgstr "I wait for that day: the day the thing at the bottom of the lake wakes, when the robe should be on someone worthy of it. Perhaps you, perhaps another. Never Zhu Hongxue."

msgid "抬眼看了你一会儿。"
msgstr " looks up at you for a while."

msgid "衣回了瑷伦身上。守衣人守着它，我也就不急了。"
msgstr "The robe is back on Ailun. The Robe-Keeper guards it, so I'm not in a hurry."

msgid "我在等湖上出事的那一天。那一天，衣该在一个配得上它的人身上——瑷伦，你，都行。只是不该在神教手里。"
msgstr "I'm waiting for the day trouble comes to the lake. On that day, the robe should be on someone worthy of it: Ailun, you, any of you. Only it shouldn't be in the Order's hands."

msgid "看了你一眼，像在数你的名字有几个字。"
msgstr " looks at you as if counting the characters in your name."

msgid "衣出了庄，跟着你走了。我等的东西从我门前过去了，没进我的门。"
msgstr "The robe left the manor and went with you. What I was waiting for passed my door and never came in."

msgid "我还在等——等你哪一天明白那件衣是做什么用的。到那时，它不该在神教手里。"
msgstr "I'm still waiting, for the day you understand what that robe is for. When that day comes, it shouldn't be in the Order's hands."

msgid "看了一眼你的包袱，又看着你。"
msgstr " looks at your pack, then at you."

msgid "衣出了冰匣，在你身上。我等的就是它，也在等拿着它的人——你还没想好把它交给谁。"
msgstr "The robe is out of the ice chest, and on you. It's what I was waiting for, and I'm waiting for whoever holds it too. You haven't decided yet whom to give it to."

msgid "交给谁都行，只是不该交给神教。"
msgstr "Give it to anyone, only not to the Order."

msgid "我在等一件衣，也在等一个人。衣在这庄子的冰匣里；人……我还没见到。"
msgstr "I'm waiting for a robe, and for a person. The robe is in this manor's ice chest; the person... I haven't met yet."

msgid "等到了，我把衣交给那个人——交给那个人，不是交给神教。"
msgstr "When I find them, I will give the robe to that person. To that person, not to the Order."

msgid "教主令在我这里。神教往后只派该死的人的差事——鸿雪答应了。"
msgstr "The Leader's token is with me. From now on the Order will only take jobs against those who deserve to die. Hongxue agreed."

msgid "天山雪影剑、雪影心法，你来学（「请教」）。"
msgstr "Tianshan Snowshade Sword, Snowshade Heart Method: learn them from me (\"Learn\")."

msgid "门关着。"
msgstr "The door is closed."

msgid "教主？"
msgstr "The Leader?"

msgid "出了庄的衣，不必再拿来给我看。"
msgstr "A robe that has left the manor needn't be brought to show me."

msgid "接过宝衣，手指在衣料上停了一停。"
msgstr " takes the robe, her fingers pausing on the cloth."

msgid "月神族守了几百年，守给我的。"
msgstr "The Moon God clan guarded it for hundreds of years, and guarded it for me."

msgid "你配得上。东方神教记得你——这句话，以后有用。"
msgstr "You're worthy of it. The Golden Crow Order remembers you. Those words will be of use to you later."

msgid "安妮儿把一件月白的衣叠在膝上，谁也不看。\n"
msgstr "Anni'er folds a moon-white robe on her knees, looking at no one.\n"

msgid "安妮儿看了你一眼，像在数你的名字有几个字。\n"
msgstr "Anni'er looks at you as if counting the characters in your name.\n"

msgid "宝衣出了庄，没进我的门。你的名字，我记下了。"
msgstr "The robe left the manor and never came through my door. I've noted your name."

msgid "晚月庄弟子"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor Disciple"

msgid "琼衣很礼貌的向你微笑! \n"
msgstr "Qiongyi smiles at you very politely!\n"

msgid "说道：请保持安静哦! \n"
msgstr "She says, \"Please keep quiet!\"\n"

msgid "你觉得被打中的地方一阵麻痒！"
msgstr "The place where you were hit tingles and itches!"

msgid "韶吟惊慌生气的怒斥： 喂! 兄台不要乱闯! \n"
msgstr "Shaoyin shouts in alarm and anger, \"Hey! Sir, don't just barge in!\"\n"

msgid "她的眼神骤变，隐约中似乎让人神智渐模糊! \n"
msgstr "Her gaze changes suddenly, and somehow your mind seems to blur by degrees!\n"

msgid "欣郁大喊： 喂! 兄台! 这不准男人进来! \n"
msgstr "Xinyu cries out, \"Hey! Sir! No men allowed in here!\"\n"

msgid "欣郁从袖里取出一把粉红色细粉泼撒出去。\n"
msgstr "Xinyu takes a handful of pink powder from her sleeve and flings it out.\n"

msgid "欣郁一脚往闯入者踢了出去。\n"
msgstr "Xinyu kicks out at the intruder.\n"

msgid "护庄神像"
msgstr "Guardian Statue"

msgid "火神「凤凰」乃勇士寒于的魂魄所化成的十三个精灵之一。\n由于其奇异神迹，被晚月庄供奉为护庄神兽。\n"
msgstr "The Fire God \"Phoenix\" is one of the thirteen spirits formed from the soul of the warrior Hanyu.\nBecause of its marvelous miracles, Latemoon Manor reveres it as the manor's guardian beast.\n"

msgid "神像眼神骤变，幻化成七彩凤凰，出现金色光芒。\n"
msgstr "The statue's eyes change suddenly, and it turns into a seven-colored phoenix, giving off a golden light.\n"

msgid "她国色天香，娇丽无伦；温柔娴静，秀绝人寰。\n可惜眉心上有一道地煞纹干犯紫斗，恐要玉手\n染血，浩劫武林。\n"
msgstr "She is a beauty beyond compare, delicate and lovely, gentle and serene, a loveliness rare in this world.\nA pity that between her brows is an Earth Fiend mark that offends the Purple Star; she is fated to have blood on her fair hands and to bring calamity upon the wulin.\n"

msgid "她长得十分漂亮！让你忍不住多瞧她几眼，从她身上\n你闻到淡淡的香气。她很有礼貌的向你点头，优雅的\n动作，轻盈的步伐，好美哦!\n她是晚月庄主蓝止萍的养女。\n"
msgstr "She is very beautiful! You can't help looking at her a few more times, and from her\nyou catch a faint fragrance. She nods to you with great courtesy. Her graceful\nmovements and light steps are so lovely!\nShe is the adopted daughter of Lan Zhiping, Mistress of Latemoon Manor.\n"

msgid "咦..!你也喜欢玩啊! 我会做哦! \n不过我需要一根竹子! 你找来我帮你做! \n"
msgstr "Oh..! You like to play with them too! I can make one! \nBut I need a stalk of bamboo! You find it and I'll make it for you! \n"

msgid "筱薇对你微笑，和善的对你点点头。"
msgstr "Xiaowei smiles at you and nods kindly."

msgid "筱薇对你微笑，以纤细轻柔的声音 \n 说道：这位$RESPECT，你好！欢迎来到晚月庄。"
msgstr "Xiaowei smiles at you and says in a slender, gentle voice:\n \"Hello, $RESPECT! Welcome to Latemoon Manor.\""

msgid "我已经帮你做一个竹蜻蜓了呀! "
msgstr "I already made you a bamboo dragonfly!"

msgid "筱薇微笑的看著你说：你要作竹蜻蜓呀!\n"
msgstr "Xiaowei says with a smile, \"So you want to make a bamboo dragonfly!\"\n"

msgid "筱薇将你给她的竹子仔细的看了一下。说道：不错是根玉竹! \n"
msgstr "Xiaowei looks the bamboo you gave her over carefully and says, \"Yes, it's jade bamboo!\" \n"

msgid "筱薇将竹子周围的叶子弄掉，灵巧的削凿著。\n"
msgstr "Xiaowei strips the leaves from around the bamboo and begins to whittle and carve it deftly.\n"

msgid "经过不久，筱薇把竹蜻蜓做好了。\n"
msgstr "Before long, Xiaowei has finished the bamboo dragonfly.\n"

msgid "筱薇将做好的竹蜻蜓递给你，微笑说道：嗯! 做好了! \n"
msgstr "Xiaowei hands you the finished bamboo dragonfly and says with a smile, \"There! All done!\" \n"

msgid "采花少女是绮云镇居民的小孩，从小就到晚月庄来摘桂花，蓝止\n萍很喜欢她们，也教给她们了些基本的武功，时间久了，这些少\n女的功夫还都不错。\n"
msgstr "The flower-picking girls are children of Cloudweave Town. Since they were small they have come to Latemoon Manor to pick osmanthus. Lan\nZhiping is fond of them and has taught them some basic martial arts, and after a while these girls' skills have grown quite decent.\n"

msgid "顽皮的采花少女向你扮个鬼脸。  *^G^* \n"
msgstr "The naughty flower-picking girl pulls a face at you.  *^G^* \n"

msgid "采花少女说道：华中理工大学的桂花树比晚月庄多多了，你知道吗？\n"
msgstr "The flower-picking girl says, \"Huazhong University of Science and Technology has way more osmanthus trees than Latemoon Manor, you know?\"\n"

msgid "采花少女望着天边的晚霞，双手托着香腮，说道：我好想去华工大摘桂花。\n"
msgstr "The flower-picking girl gazes at the evening glow in the sky, chin in her hands, and says, \"I want to go pick osmanthus at HUST so badly.\"\n"

msgid "采花少女嘀咕着：听说华工的桂花有好几种呢。\n"
msgstr "The flower-picking girl mutters, \"I heard HUST has several kinds of osmanthus.\"\n"

msgid "采花少女秀眉微蹙，说道：你欺负我年纪小是吗？\n"
msgstr "The flower-picking girl knits her pretty brows. \"You're picking on me because I'm young, aren't you?\"\n"

msgid "采花少女说道：你要是再无理取闹，让火玫瑰毒死你！\n"
msgstr "The flower-picking girl says, \"If you keep making trouble for nothing, I'll let the Fire Rose poison you dead!\"\n"

msgid "采花少女骂道：你这无赖，别死缠着我！\n"
msgstr "The flower-picking girl scolds, \"You scoundrel, stop pestering me!\"\n"

msgid "桂花"
msgstr "Osmanthus"

msgid "华中理工大学的桂花树比晚月庄多多了，你知道吗？"
msgstr "Huazhong University of Science and Technology has way more osmanthus trees than Latemoon Manor, you know?"

msgid "一只可爱的长尾巴的小金鼠。 \n"
msgstr "A cute little golden mouse with a long tail. \n"

msgid "小金鼠摇摇尾巴!全身晃呀晃! \n"
msgstr "The little golden mouse wags its tail! Its whole body wobbles and sways! \n"

msgid "小金鼠眼睛眨呀眨!好像快睡著了! \n"
msgstr "The little golden mouse blinks and blinks! It looks about to fall asleep! \n"

msgid "嘟嘟玩太累了!睡著了! \n"
msgstr "Dodo played too hard and is tired! He's fallen asleep! \n"

msgid "小金鼠「嘟嘟」它跳啊跳的! \n"
msgstr "The little golden mouse \"Dodo\" hops and hops! \n"

msgid "小金鼠「嘟嘟」眼睛眨呀眨看著你 \n"
msgstr "The little golden mouse \"Dodo\" blinks and blinks, looking at you \n"

msgid "小金鼠发出「  叽! 叽!」」的叫声! \n"
msgstr "The little golden mouse goes \"Squeak! Squeak!\" \n"

msgid "一只羽毛鲜艳的小金丝雀。\n"
msgstr "A little canary with bright feathers.\n"

msgid "小金丝雀叽叽的叫! \n"
msgstr "The little canary chirps away! \n"

msgid "金丝雀用嘴整理羽毛。 \n"
msgstr "The canary preens its feathers with its beak. \n"

msgid "她看起来成熟中带有一些韵味。飘逸的长发\n十分迷人。\n"
msgstr "She looks mature and has a certain charm. Her flowing long hair\nis very charming.\n"

msgid "一只红眼睛的小白兔。\n"
msgstr "A little white rabbit with red eyes.\n"

msgid "小白兔蹦蹦跳跳的。\n"
msgstr "The little white rabbit hops and bounces.\n"

msgid "小白兔用嘴舔前肢。 \n"
msgstr "The little white rabbit licks its forepaw. \n"

msgid "舞曲谱啊，师姐她们练习舞步的时候才用的着，\n你也想学吗？ 嘻嘻...\n"
msgstr "The dance score? Only Senior Sisters use it when practicing steps,\nand do you want to learn it too? Hee hee...\n"

msgid "神像"
msgstr "Statue"

msgid "人灵「区冥」乃勇士寒于的魂魄所化成的十三个精灵之一。\n晚月庄的开山先辈，传说是其后裔子孙。故其为\n晚月庄的祖先神位。\n"
msgstr "The Human Soul \"Ouming\" is one of the thirteen spirits formed from the soul of the warrior Hanyu.\nThe founder of Latemoon Manor is said to be among his descendants. So it stands as the manor's\nancestral tablet.\n"

msgid "神像的目光落在你身上，柔和得像晚月。\n"
msgstr "The statue's gaze falls on you, soft as a late moon.\n"

msgid "你有一种奇特的感觉，彷佛有人在盯著你看。\n"
msgstr "You have a strange feeling, as if someone is staring at you.\n"

msgid "这是条用鹅卵石铺成的小路，往西可以看到一座用淡青色围墙围住\n的庭院，有两个身着彩衣的女子笑盈盈的站在那里说笑着，她们身后的\n一扇拱门(door)，檐顶下面写着「晚月庄」。院墙那边飘出的阵阵曲声勾\n人魂魄，隐约还可闻到一股香气。\n"
msgstr "This is a path paved with river pebbles. To the west you can see a courtyard enclosed by a pale blue wall, where two women in bright clothes stand laughing and chatting. Behind them is an arched gate (door), and under its eaves are written the words \"Latemoon Manor\". Strains of music drift over the wall, enough to steal a soul, and you catch a faint scent of incense.\n"

msgid "你来到了这个小径的尽头，一个有著朱红漆大门大宅\n院矗立在你的面前，门口挂著两串灯笼(lantern),上面写\n得有字，像这样一间豪华的大宅院出现在这样的乡间野外\n，使你觉得有些突兀，大宅的南边、东边都是茂密的林子\n，看来也没有其他的路。\n"
msgstr "You reach the end of the path, and a great house with a vermilion-lacquered gate rises before you. Two strings of lanterns (lantern) hang at the door, with writing on them. Such a grand house, standing in open country like this, strikes you as a little out of place. The woods to the south and east of the house are thick, and there seems to be no other way on.\n"

msgid "一走入这个庭园，扑鼻而来的便是一股若有似无，但是又沁人心\n脾的花香，庭园甚是宽敞，许多奇花异石错落其间，显是经过高手匠\n人的精心布置，西边花丛间可看到主屋的屋角，一条石板小径沿著假\n山通往主屋。\n"
msgstr "As soon as you step into this courtyard garden, a faint, fleeting fragrance of flowers floods your nose and soaks into the heart. The garden is spacious, with many rare flowers and strange rocks scattered through it, clearly laid out with great care by master craftsmen. To the west, among the flower beds, you can see a corner of the main house, and a flagstone path winds along the rockery toward it.\n"

msgid "走进大厅，抬头迎面看见的是一面紫红绣金挂幔，一面屏风将宽敞的\n大厅隔成两半，东西两面各设著七张紫檀雕案，案上一色白玉羊脂花瓶，\n瓶中插著粉红的处子牡丹，紫檀雕案中间又都挂著七尺来长的画轴，各式\n鸟兽虫鱼，翎毛丹青，栩栩如生，宛如要从画纸上飞出，嬉戏于大厅之中\n，这大厅中的富贵气派之中透著一股秀气，但是却也无一般富豪人家或酒\n店的庸脂俗粉之气。\n    屏风两旁的白石嵌云柱上工整地刻著一幅对联写道：\n\n    「座上珠玑照日月，却掩珠帘，难为芳心;\n      堂前飘香焕云霞，不知岁月，但晓清音。」\n\n"
msgstr "You walk into the great hall. Facing you is a purple-red curtain embroidered with gold, and a screen divides the wide hall in two. On the east and west sides stand seven rosewood carved tables each, and on each table a vase of white jade the color of mutton fat, holding pink virgin peonies. Between the tables hang scrolls seven feet long, painted with birds, beasts, insects and fish, feathers and flowers so lifelike they seem about to fly off the paper and frolic through the hall. There is wealth and grandeur here, yet a delicate grace within it, with none of the cheap powder and rouge of a rich man's house or a wine shop.\n    On the white stone pillars inlaid with cloud patterns on both sides of the screen, a couplet is carved in neat characters:\n\n    \"Pearls and jade on the seats outshine sun and moon, yet pearl curtains hide them, and a heart is hard to win;\n      Fragrance drifts before the hall and lights the rosy clouds, the years go unmarked, and only clear music is known.\"\n\n"

msgid "这里是晚月庄接待宾客的傍厅，厅中摆了一张桌几，上面摆著\n一块大红镶金桌巾，靠东壁面西设著半旧青缎靠背引枕，两张太师\n椅座。桌几上有一精致的茶壶，旁有盛好的上等茗茶。\n"
msgstr "This is the side hall where Latemoon Manor receives guests. A table stands in the hall, covered with a red cloth trimmed in gold, and against the east wall, facing west, are a half-worn blue satin cushion for leaning on and two grand armchairs. On the table is a delicate teapot, with fine tea poured beside it.\n"

msgid "这是晚月庄后的小小庭院，面积似乎不大，但花木扶疏，举目四望，\n竟种满了无数梅花，婉约娟秀，别有一番滋味。清风徐来，梅花特有的\n清香弥漫在风中.....\n"
msgstr "This is a small courtyard at the back of the manor. It doesn't look large, but the flowers and trees are lush and spread out, and wherever you look it is planted with countless plum blossoms, graceful and delicate, with a charm all its own. When a breeze comes, the special fragrance of plum blossoms drifts through the wind.....\n"

msgid "你走在一条长廊上，两旁都是庭台堂庑，廊上弥漫著一股\n香郁的气息，廊下是由青石砖铺成，一边接后厅内院，一边的\n尽头则是一幅大石壁画，西侧似有一铜门(door)。\n有一间书房。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a long corridor, with halls and rooms on both sides. A rich fragrance fills the corridor, and the floor below is paved with bluestone bricks. One end joins the inner court of the back hall, and the other ends at a great stone wall painting. On the west side there seems to be a bronze door (door).\nThere is a study.\n"

msgid "这里四面都是单调的墙壁(wall)。通常庄内弟子犯错就是\n关在这儿！反省思过。\n"
msgstr "All four sides here are plain walls (wall). This is usually where disciples of the manor are shut up when they've done wrong! To reflect on their faults.\n"

msgid "你走在一条长廊上，两旁都是庭台堂庑，廊上弥漫著一股\n香郁的气息，长廊向东西方延伸而去。东边是后厅院子，西边\n有一间书房。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a long corridor, with halls and rooms on both sides. A rich fragrance fills the corridor. The corridor runs east and west. To the east is the back hall's courtyard, and to the west is a study.\n"

msgid "这是一间小小的书房，窗明几净，朴素典雅，一张古意盎然的红木书桌，\n吸引了你的目光，上面摆著一座小小的香炉，几本善本书整齐的堆放在桌上\n，可见主人相当的爱惜书本。一幅「沧海龙吟」的舞曲图画挂在墙上，似乎\n有一些秘密在里头。\n"
msgstr "This is a small study, bright and clean, plain and elegant. An old-fashioned rosewood desk catches your eye, with a small incense burner on it and a few rare editions neatly stacked, which shows how much the owner cherishes books. A dance chart, \"Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea\", hangs on the wall, as if some secret lay within it.\n"

msgid "这是一间密室。地上铺著可以合地打坐的大理石床。四周挂了一\n些兵器，正面墙上写了偌大的 『 舞 』字！ 地板上隐约看到一幅先\n天八卦图。中央画著两仪，八个角落分别是：乾坤兑离震巽坎艮、等\n卦相。墙上画著几幅玄天玉女翩然起舞的美妙步法。\n"
msgstr "This is a secret room. The floor is laid with marble beds on which one can sit in meditation. Weapons hang all around, and on the front wall is written a huge character, \"Dance\"! On the floor you can faintly make out a Former Heaven bagua diagram. The two forces are drawn in the center, and in the eight corners are the trigrams: Qian, Kun, Dui, Li, Zhen, Xun, Kan and Gen. On the walls are painted several scenes of the Jade Maiden of Dark Heaven dancing her wondrous steps.\n"

msgid "你从后廊往西出了内厅进入穿堂。往北是内院，一条宽过道，西  \n面立著一个粉油大影壁，后有一大半门，小小的一所庭宇。\n"
msgstr "You leave the inner hall westward along the rear corridor and enter a passage hall. To the north is the inner court, a wide passage. To the west stands a large pink-painted screen wall, and behind it a big half-door leads to a small, secluded courtyard.\n"

msgid "走入内厅，你看到袭地铺满红毯。四面相对十二张雕漆椅上，都\n是一色灰鼠椅搭小褥，厅中摆了小屏风，四周挂满山水墨画。一个木\n隔架，旁边还有一碧纱橱(closet)。\n"
msgstr "You enter the inner hall and see a red carpet covering the floor. Twelve carved lacquer chairs face one another on all four sides, each with a gray squirrel-fur cushion on it, and a small screen stands in the middle of the hall, with ink landscapes hung all around. There is a wooden shelf, and next to it a green gauze cabinet (closet).\n"

msgid "你走在后厅内院的仪门，是晚月庄后厅内院长廊走道的相接路\n口。东北方是往膳房的夹道，西面是长廊夹道，南面是到后厅，往北\n则可走出大门前往前院。\n"
msgstr "You are at the ceremonial gate of the back hall's inner court, where the long corridors of the court meet. To the northeast is a narrow lane leading to the dining hall, to the west is a corridor lane, to the south is the back hall, and to the north you can leave by the main gate toward the front court.\n"

msgid "你走在后厅内院的夹道上，庄内像这样的走廊很多，你若没有地\n理概念很容易迷路。长长的走道中, 纯金铸成的长灯架上挂了一排饰\n丽的宫灯! 入夜之后灯火辉煌! 十分美丽!\n"
msgstr "You are in a lane of the back hall's inner court. The manor has many corridors like this, and without a sense of direction you easily get lost. Along the long passage, rows of ornate palace lanterns hang from long lamp stands cast of pure gold! After dark the lights are dazzling! Very beautiful!\n"

msgid "这是一间客房，两边摆了一对小茶几。上面的彩绘瓶中插了一束\n琼花，茶几旁两张雕漆椅。整个房间简朴幽静，为晚月庄供外客留宿\n的一间厢房。\n"
msgstr "This is a guest room, with a pair of small tea tables on either side. In the painted vase on each stands a bunch of jasmine, and beside the tables are two carved lacquer chairs. The whole room is plain and quiet, one of the wing rooms where Latemoon Manor lodges outside guests.\n"

msgid "这是一间上等厢房，光线适中。近窗边有一张桌子，旁有书橱!\n还有一个古琴放在平台上! 墙上除了美丽的饰物外，还挂了一些书画\n有一浓郁清新的书香气息! 通常是给远道而来的贵客休憩夜宿的一间\n上等厢房。\n"
msgstr "This is a fine wing room with moderate light. By the window is a table with a bookcase beside it! An old zither also rests on a platform! Besides beautiful ornaments, the walls hold some calligraphy and paintings, with a rich, fresh air of books! It is usually where honored guests from afar rest for the night.\n"

msgid "你走进一间装饰华丽的大饭厅，有一种说不出的气派，一张杉木  \n雕饰的大圆桌子在厅子中央，铺著丝绸彩桌巾，上等南湖紫玉盘，湘\n陵的瓷玉碗，银匙金筷。十分奢华。这是晚月庄宴请宾客的地方，平\n常也是庄主及庄内辈份高的前辈用膳的地方。\n"
msgstr "You walk into a splendidly decorated dining hall, with an air of grandeur you can't quite name. A big round table of carved cedar stands in the middle of the hall, spread with a silk cloth of many colors, with fine Nanhu purple jade plates, porcelain-jade bowls from Xiangling, and silver spoons and gold chopsticks. It is truly lavish. This is where Latemoon Manor entertains its guests, and ordinarily where the Mistress and the manor's senior elders take their meals.\n"

msgid "这是一间膳房，中央摆了二张大圆桌。周围三十二张雕饰木藤椅。\n平常庄内上下用膳的地方，东边是厨房，西边则是大饭厅，这虽然不\n及饭厅华丽，但所有锅盘匙碗，也都是上等珍品。有大户人家的气派\n与富贵。\n"
msgstr "This is the refectory, with two big round tables in the middle and thirty-two carved rattan chairs around them. It is where everyone in the manor eats on ordinary days. To the east is the kitchen, and to the west the great dining hall. It is not as grand as the dining hall, but every pot, plate, spoon and bowl is a fine treasure, with the air of a great and wealthy household.\n"

msgid "你走进厨房，看到有好多的烹饪用品与设备，小蒸笼、大锅、平  \n炊灶、烧饭炉等，五花八门，式样齐全。旁边的大仓储中，更放满各\n式各样山珍美味，各种材料，调味物品应有尽有。里头的掌厨师姐们\n忙里忙外，在为准备一道道佳肴辛苦著! 闻到那阵阵美味的菜香，你\n的肚子咕噜咕噜叫了起来!\n"
msgstr "You walk into the kitchen and see all kinds of cooking tools and equipment: small steamers, big woks, flat stoves, rice cookers, in every variety and style. In the big storeroom nearby are all sorts of mountain delicacies, ingredients and seasonings, nothing missing. The Senior Sisters in charge of the cooking bustle in and out, working hard on one fine dish after another! Smelling the wafts of tasty food, your stomach starts to rumble!\n"

msgid "你进了后厅，这是后院上房五间中，最大的一间厅房。四面墙            \n壁，玲珑剔透，琴剑书画，挂在墙上。锦笼纱罩，金彩珠光，连地上                  \n踏的砖，皆是碧绿凿花，是雕空的紫檀板壁。厅上摆了二十六张桧木\n交椅，庄内对外展示舞步表演，都是在这举行。\n"
msgstr "You enter the back hall, the largest of the five main rooms at the back of the court. The four walls are delicate and carved through, with zithers, swords, books and paintings hung on them. Brocade cages and gauze covers, golden gleam and the shine of pearls; even the bricks underfoot are green and chiseled with flowers, and the paneling is openwork rosewood. Twenty-six cypress chairs stand in the hall. When the manor shows its dance performances to outsiders, they are held here.\n"

msgid "这是一间安静的书房, 光线适中, 近窗边有一张桌子, 旁有书橱\n还有一个古琴放在平台上! 墙上除了美丽的饰物外, 还挂了一些书画                  \n有一股浓郁清新的书香气息!\n"
msgstr "This is a quiet study with moderate light. By the window is a table with a bookcase beside it. An old zither also rests on a platform! Besides beautiful ornaments, the walls hold some calligraphy and paintings, with a rich, fresh air of books!\n"

msgid "这是一间安静的书房, 光线适中。近窗边有一张桌子，旁有书橱! \n还有一个古琴放在平台上! 墙上除了美丽的饰物外，还挂了一些书画 \n有一股浓郁清新的书香气息! \n"
msgstr "This is a quiet study with moderate light. By the window is a table with a bookcase beside it! An old zither also rests on a platform! Besides beautiful ornaments, the walls hold some calligraphy and paintings, with a rich, fresh air of books! \n"

msgid "通过后厅走道，接著你走进东厢房走道。除了长长的走道中，\n一排饰丽的宫灯! 走道两旁摆设了许多奇花异草，各有各的特色与\n形态，空气中弥漫一种淡淡的香气。往南通往东厢房。\n"
msgstr "Passing through the back hall's walk, you enter the East Wing walk. Along the long passage hangs a row of ornate palace lanterns. Rare flowers and strange plants line both sides, each with its own character and form, and a faint scent hangs in the air. To the south is the way to the East Wing.\n"

msgid "通过后厅走道，接著你走进东厢房走道。除了长长的走道中，\n一排饰丽的宫灯! 走道两旁摆设了许多奇花异草，各有各的特色与\n形态，空气中弥漫一种淡淡的香气。东面你看到一扇厢门。\n"
msgstr "Passing through the back hall's walk, you enter the East Wing walk. Along the long passage hangs a row of ornate palace lanterns. Rare flowers and strange plants line both sides, each with its own character and form, and a faint scent hangs in the air. To the east you see a door to a wing room.\n"

msgid "你进入东厢房来，临窗的地上铺著猩红毛毯，正面设著大红金钱\n蟒靠背，石青金钱蟒引枕，秋香色金钱蟒大条褥。两边设一对梅花式\n红漆小几，几上茗琬瓶花俱备。这是一间上等厢房。\n"
msgstr "You enter the East Wing. By the window the floor is spread with a scarlet blanket, and on the front is a great red leaning-back seat woven with gold coin-and-python patterns, with a stone-blue cushion and a wide mattress in autumn-fragrance color, in the same pattern. On both sides is a pair of plum-blossom-shaped small red lacquer tables, with bowls of tea and vases of flowers on them. This is a fine wing room.\n"

msgid "通过后厅走道，接著你走进西厢房走道。长长的走道中，纯金\n成的长灯架上挂了一排饰丽的宫灯! 走道两旁摆设了许多奇花异草，\n空气中弥漫一种淡淡的香气。在一柱柱雕饰华丽的长柱，刻画许多\n彩绘的图形，美不胜收。\n"
msgstr "Passing through the back hall's walk, you enter the West Wing walk. Along the long passage, rows of ornate palace lanterns hang from long lamp stands cast of pure gold! Rare flowers and strange plants line both sides, and a faint scent hangs in the air. On the long pillars, richly carved, many painted figures are drawn, a beauty beyond words.\n"

msgid "你走在西厢房走道上。长长的走道中，纯金成的长灯架上挂了一排\n饰丽的宫灯! 走道两旁摆设了许多奇花异草，空气中弥漫一种淡淡的香\n气。在一柱柱雕饰华丽的长柱，刻画许多彩绘的图形，美不胜收。西面\n你看到一扇门。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along the West Wing walk. Along the long passage, rows of ornate palace lanterns hang from long lamp stands cast of pure gold! Rare flowers and strange plants line both sides, and a faint scent hangs in the air. On the richly carved long pillars are drawn many painted figures, a beauty beyond words. To the west you see a door.\n"

msgid "你进入西厢房来，地下面西放著四张椅子，都搭著银红撒花椅被\n椅子两边有一对高几，右边几上文王鼎，匙筋香盒；左边几上汝窑美\n人瓶内插著花卉茗琬棰壶等物。隔窗望去，隐约可看见花园景色。.\n"
msgstr "You enter the West Wing. Four chairs face the west on the floor, each draped with a silver-red chair cover scattered with flowers. Beside the chairs on each side stands a tall stand: on the right, a Wenwang tripod and a box of incense with spoon and chopsticks; on the left, a Ru-ware beauty vase holding flowers, with tea bowls and a pot. Looking through the window, you can dimly see the garden scenery.\n"

msgid "你进了内厅，迎面挂著葱绿洒花软帘，掀帘进去，抬头一看，\n只见四面墙壁，玲珑剔透，琴剑书画，挂在墙上。锦笼纱罩，金彩\n珠光，连地上踏的砖，皆是碧绿凿花，左一架书，右一架屏。四面\n是雕空的紫檀板壁。\n"
msgstr "You enter the inner hall. A light green curtain sprinkled with flowers hangs before you. Lift it and go in, look up, and you see four walls, delicate and carved through, with zithers, swords, books and paintings hung on them. Brocade cages and gauze covers, golden gleam and the shine of pearls; even the bricks underfoot are green and chiseled with flowers. On the left a shelf of books, on the right a screen, and on all four sides openwork rosewood paneling.\n"

msgid "通过『 垂花门 』便是往后院。垂花门为男女之门限，古来女\n人就有「大门不出，二门不迈」的谚语，于是二门堪称为男女门限\n。后院为庄内女弟子厢房，与湘园。东面一扇小门，为庄内更衣沐\n浴的小花池。更是严禁外人胡乱闯入。\n"
msgstr "Beyond the Hanging-Flower Gate lies the rear court. The Hanging-Flower Gate is the boundary between men and women; since ancient times women have had the saying, \"Don't leave by the great gate, don't cross the second gate,\" so the second gate is the line between the sexes. The rear court holds the women disciples' wing rooms, and the Xiang Garden. A small door on the east side leads to the manor's small flower pool, for changing clothes and bathing, which outsiders are strictly forbidden to enter.\n"

msgid "这是一间更衣室，你看到许多柜子，衣架上挂了许多的衣服饰\n品。墙上的架上挂了一些丝巾，你可以闻到淡淡的香气围绕四周。\n东侧一蓝青洒花软帘，隔帘望去，隐约可看到小花池，一团的雾气\n你有点想去冲凉沐浴，让精神好些。当然此处是禁止男性进入!\n"
msgstr "This is a changing room. You see many cabinets, and many clothes and ornaments hang on the racks. Some silk scarves hang on the shelves on the wall, and you can smell a faint fragrance all around. To the east a soft blue curtain sprinkled with flowers hangs, and through it you can dimly see the small flower pool, with a cloud of mist. You feel a bit like going for a wash and a bath to refresh your spirit. Of course, men are forbidden here!\n"

msgid "这是一个小花池，清澈的池水含著淡淡的幽香。池周围有许多奇花    \n异草，时如至芝兰之室，清香袭脑，温馨荡魄。缤纷的花瓣飘在池上，\n云幢羽葆中，簇拥著许多师姐妹，有的嘻戏玩耍，有的翩然起舞。你也\n想到小花池中沐浴休憩(take bath)。\n"
msgstr "This is a small flower pool. The clear water carries a faint, hidden fragrance. Many rare flowers and strange plants surround the pool, as if you had entered a room of orchids, the scent rising to your head and warming the soul. Colorful petals drift on the water, and amid the banners and plumes, many Senior and Junior Sisters crowd around, some playing and laughing, some dancing gracefully. You'd like to bathe and rest in the pool too (take bath).\n"

msgid "你走到前院，你看到几块山石，东面一处假山小池。其上植有藤  \n萝、青芷，异草芬芳荔薛。池中几尾小鱼自在的游来游去。假山外隔\n著围篱，有一种山怀中的小花园的感觉。.\n"
msgstr "You come to the front yard and see a few rocks, and to the east a small pool by a rockery. Vines and angelica grow on it, with strange grasses giving off fragrance. A few small fish swim in the pool at ease. Beyond the rockery is a fence, which gives the feeling of a little garden in the arms of the mountain.\n"

msgid "走进月洞门，只见迎面一带翠嶂，挡在南面。只见白石崚嶒，  \n或如鬼怪，或如猛兽，纵横拱立，上边苔藓成斑，藤萝掩映，其\n中微露羊肠小径。往南进入翠嶂，往北是小花厅。\n"
msgstr "Passing through the moon gate, you see a green screen of rock blocking the way to the south. White stones jut sharp, some like ghosts, some like fierce beasts, standing crosswise and in rows, spotted with moss and hung with creepers, with a narrow winding path faintly showing through. To the south you enter the green screen, and to the north is the small flower hall.\n"

msgid "穿过一层竹篱、花嶂编的月洞门，在你眼前出现的是那由粉墙环\n护，绿柳周垂的翠嶂。两边分别是游廊相接通往桃花林与长廊曲洞。\n在这儿一棵西府海棠(flower)吸引你的注意，只见其势若伞，丝垂翠\n缕，葩吐丹砂，十分漂亮。\n"
msgstr "Passing through a moon gate woven of bamboo fence and flower screens, what appears before you is a green screen ringed by pink walls and surrounded by green willows. On either side, covered corridors lead to the peach grove and to the long corridor tunnel. Here a Xifu crabapple tree (flower) draws your attention, its shape like an umbrella, its branches hanging in green threads, its blossoms red as cinnabar, very beautiful.\n"

msgid "湘园的桂花小径是以不同颜色的细石砌成各种图案。路面的\n图案组成，全员是一个整体。但每幅图案又有独立的内容，总计\n花石子路上约有二百幅。沿路观赏，美不胜收。\n"
msgstr "The osmanthus path of Xiang Garden is laid with fine stones of different colors in all sorts of patterns. The patterns on the road form one whole, but each picture has its own content, about two hundred of them in all along the flower-stone path. Walking along and admiring them, you find them beyond beautiful.\n"

msgid "你走入一长廊曲洞，里头略略的有几点山石，种著芭蕉，你可以\n听到潺潺的流水声，这里是园内假山开凿的通道，蜿蜒盘旋，从洞口\n向外望去，是一碧清的水池。顺著曲径走去，转了两个弯子，看见一\n座石板桥。\n"
msgstr "You enter a long, winding grotto. A few rocks sit inside, with plantains growing, and you can hear the murmur of flowing water. This is a passage cut through the garden's rockery, twisting and coiling, and looking out from the mouth you see a clear green pool. Follow the winding path, and after two turns you see a stone slab bridge.\n"

msgid "这是一片桂花园，园内种植桂花树十万多株，枝干苍劲，枝叶  \n茂盛，树冠完整，富有生气。放眼展望，满遍披翠盖绿，葱郁的桂\n花树斑烂绚丽，优雅大方，碧海银花，清香阵阵。薰的游人醉，衣\n发常留馀香。\n"
msgstr "This is an osmanthus garden, planted with over a hundred thousand osmanthus trees, their trunks sturdy, their foliage thick, their crowns whole and full of life. Looking out, everything is draped in green, and the lush osmanthus trees glow in mottled splendor, graceful and generous, a sea of jade with silver flowers, fragrant in waves. It intoxicates the visitor, and the scent lingers in clothes and hair.\n"

msgid "你走至大桥前，见水如晶帘一般奔入，扶著藤栏过去，只见水\n上落花愈多，其水愈清，溶溶荡荡，曲折萦纡，池边两行垂柳，杂\n著桃、杏，遮天蔽日般，真无一些尘土。度过桥去则通往湖心亭。\n"
msgstr "You come before the big bridge, where the water pours in like a crystal curtain. Holding the vine railing, you cross, and the more fallen petals on the water, the clearer it is, brimming and winding, with two rows of weeping willows by the pool, mixed with peach and apricot, shading the sky and the sun, not a speck of dust. Cross the bridge to reach the lake pavilion.\n"

msgid "走在桥上，可以远观山坡帏脉，两边飞楼插空，雕饰绣栏，隐\n于亭园树木之间；俯而视之，则清流泻雪石磴穿云。朱红玉石为栏\n，环抱池沿，柳垂金线，桃吐丹霞。\n"
msgstr "Walking on the bridge, you can look far to the hills and slopes. On both sides towers soar into the sky, carved and embroidered railings hidden among the garden's trees and pavilions. Look down and a clear stream spills like snow, with stone steps threading through the clouds. Vermilion jade rails ring the pool's edge, with willows hanging golden threads and peach blossoms spitting rosy clouds.\n"

msgid "桂花园的石子甬道是以不同颜色的细石砌成各种图案。路面\n的图案组成，全员是一个整体。但每幅图案又有独立的内容，总\n计花石子路上约有二百幅。沿路观赏，美不胜收。\n"
msgstr "The pebble path of the osmanthus garden is laid with fine stones of different colors in all sorts of patterns. The patterns on the road form one whole, but each picture has its own content, about two hundred of them in all along the flower-stone path. Walking along and admiring them, you find them beyond beautiful.\n"

msgid "你一进了小轩内，只觉异香扑鼻，那些奇草仙藤，越冷越苍翠，\n都结了实，似珊瑚豆子一般，累垂可爱。房内雪洞一般，清凉舒适  \n，案上一个土定瓶，中供著数枝菊花，旁边放了两本书、茶瓯茶杯  \n而已，床上只吊著青纱帐幔被褥，也十分朴实。\n"
msgstr "As you enter the little lodge, a strange perfume fills your nose. The rare herbs and fairy vines grow greener the colder it gets, all bearing fruit, hanging down like coral beans, lovely. The room is like a snow cave, cool and comfortable. On the desk is a clay vase holding a few sprays of chrysanthemum, beside it two books, a tea bowl and a cup, and that is all. On the bed hang only green gauze curtains and a quilt, quite plain.\n"

msgid "亭子座落在园内小水池上，亭柱周围以弧形座凳式栏板，内外\n雕刻各种不同样式的梅枝，钻尖式紫琉璃瓦顶，天花板也有雕刻非\n常精细的百花图案。上下担额枋彩画题材是海墁式点金加彩琼花。\n体形别致，色彩丰富。亭边石桥飞架，通萃赏楼，轻灵精巧，为园\n中一大奇景。\n"
msgstr "The pavilion stands over a small pond in the garden. Around its pillars run curved seat-rails, carved inside and out with plum branches of every pattern, and the roof is tiled in pointed purple glaze. The ceiling too is carved with very fine designs of a hundred flowers. The upper and lower beams are painted with gilded, colored jasmine in the sea-spread style. Its shape is distinctive and its colors rich. A stone bridge flies over beside the pavilion to the Cuishang Tower, light and delicate, one of the garden's great wonders.\n"

msgid "暖香榭位于水池东岸，秋水山房之西，依岩为屋，结构曲折，\n极幽致，室小而精，尚朴去华，渊然静修，古香袭人。走进这里\n你有一种心源湛澈，天地虚灵，彷佛置身于仙境的感觉。往西面\n望去，水底亭台，历历可鉴。\n"
msgstr "Warm Scent Bower stands on the east bank of the pond, west of Autumn Water Mountain House. It is built against the rock, winding and twisting, deeply secluded, small but fine, plain and free of show, a place of deep and quiet cultivation, with an air of antiquity. Entering, you feel your mind clear and still, as if heaven and earth had gone hollow and spirit-bright, as if you stood in fairyland. Looking west, you can see terraces and pavilions beneath the water, clearly mirrored.\n"

msgid "转过翠嫣桥，隐隐露出一带黄泥筑就矮墙，墙头用稻茎掩护，\n有几百株杏花，如喷火蒸霞一般，里面数楹茅屋，外面却是桑、\n榆、槿、杉各色树木新条，随其曲折编就两溜青篱，篱外有一土  \n井，旁有一石牌(sign)。旁边有一些佳蔬菜花。\n"
msgstr "Past the Green Grace Bridge, a low wall of yellow mud comes faintly into view, its top shielded with rice straw. Several hundred apricot trees stand like roaring fire and steaming clouds, and inside are a few thatched rooms. Outside grow mulberry, elm, hibiscus and fir, each with new shoots, woven along the bend into two rows of green fence. Beyond the fence is an earthen well, with a stone marker (sign) beside it. Nearby are some fine vegetables and flowers.\n"

msgid "这是一座最精美的桥，全长十二米，宽度恰可走两人。石拱\n是单孔结构，青石桥面，汉白玉雕石栏杆，栏板上刻有精致美丽\n的花纹。二十个望柱头上各有一小孔雀，情态各异，饶有趣味。\n"
msgstr "This is the most exquisite bridge, twelve meters long and just wide enough for two people. The stone arch is a single span, the deck is bluestone, and the railings are carved of Han white jade, with fine and beautiful patterns on the panels. On each of the twenty posts sits a little peacock, each in a different mood, full of charm.\n"

msgid "你走在石子墁的花园甬路上，只见两边翠竹夹路，土地下苍苔\n布满，往东北你看到凤尾森森，龙吟细细，通往暖香榭。南面则是\n一个小门。西方通往园中小桥。\n"
msgstr "You are on a garden path paved with laid stones, with green bamboo crowding both sides and moss spread over the ground. To the northeast you see dense stands of phoenix-tail bamboo, their dragon-songs soft and fine, leading to Warm Scent Bower. To the south is a small door. To the west a way leads to the small bridge in the garden.\n"

msgid "这是晚月庄的后门，在美丽的湘园南侧，这有一个木制的小门。\n走出门外应是通往天山的小径。\n"
msgstr "This is Latemoon Manor's back gate, on the south side of beautiful Xiang Garden, a small wooden door. Outside, the road should lead to a trail up to Tianshan.\n"

msgid "你走在后厅二楼的走廊上，庄内像这样的走廊很多，你若没有地\n理概念很容易迷路。长长的走道中, 纯金铸成的长灯架上挂了一排饰\n丽的宫灯! 入夜之后灯火辉煌! 十分美丽!\n"
msgstr "You are in the corridor on the back hall's upper floor. The manor has many corridors like this, and without a sense of direction you easily get lost. Along the long passage, rows of ornate palace lanterns hang from long lamp stands cast of pure gold! After dark the lights are dazzling! Very beautiful!\n"

msgid "这是晚月庄的舞曲步法研究室, 名曰「翠湘」。墙上刻画著各种\n基本步法与一些诗词曲赋。在每一位美女图的姿态形体之中，那种翩\n然起舞的曼妙舞姿，含蕴许多珍贵奇妙的舞步。你可以看到几位师姐\n一起走著奇特的步法，正在试著模拟这些舞步，一边低头沉思要如何\n运用，十分的投入。\n"
msgstr "This is Latemoon Manor's research room for dance pieces and steps, called \"Green Xiang\". On the walls are carved all kinds of basic steps and some poems, lyrics and verse. In the posture of every beauty in the pictures, in her graceful dancing form, lie many precious, wondrous dance steps. You can see several Senior Sisters walking strange steps together, trying to imitate these dances while lowering their heads to think how to use them, completely absorbed.\n"

msgid "这里是庄院二楼的佛堂门前，你可以闻到一股浓郁的檀香气息。\n走在这里你有一种庄严肃静的感觉，在闲暇之馀你觉得来到这可以\n暂时忘去周遭的烦人琐事，彷佛可以放开一切，所有时空都静止般\n的虚空幽静。西面你看到一扇檀香木门。\n"
msgstr "This is in front of the shrine room on the manor's second floor, and you smell a rich scent of sandalwood. Walking here gives you a solemn, hushed feeling. In your free time, you feel that coming here lets you forget the troublesome affairs around you for a while, as if you could let go of everything, all time and space still, empty and quiet. To the west you see a sandalwood door.\n"

msgid "这是专供庄内祭祀的佛堂，是一座精构楼阁，屋顶覆以琉璃瓦，四\n角钻尖覆以鎏金铜瓦。堂内供奉  人灵「区冥」，旁有雨神「天龙」、\n火神「凤凰」。两翼有琉璃鹤照壁，姿态生动。四周置陈神龛佛像，供\n盘塔磬，及一股檀香的气息。\n"
msgstr "This is the shrine room used for the manor's sacrifices, a finely built pavilion, its roof covered in glazed tiles, its four pointed corners covered in gilded copper tiles. Inside are enshrined the Human Soul \"Ouming,\" with the Rain God \"Heavenly Dragon\" and the Fire God \"Phoenix\" beside him. On both wings are glazed crane screen walls, lively in pose. Shrines and Buddha statues stand all around, with offering plates, pagodas, chimes, and a scent of sandalwood.\n"

msgid "这里是庄院二楼的前堂楼，有著传统的古式建筑风格。由上好的        \n桧木搭建而成, 东面一阵耀眼的的白光由两扇敞开的落地窗口射进来\n，泛映出一种清新幽静的格局。开了楼门出去可以一览庄院内外的山\n川景色，欣赏其美丽景观。\n"
msgstr "This is the front tower hall on the manor's second floor, in the traditional old style. Built of fine cypress, a dazzling white light comes in from the two open floor-length windows on the east, filling the place with a fresh, quiet air. Open the tower door and go out, and you can take in the mountains and rivers inside and out of the manor, and enjoy the beautiful view.\n"

msgid "这是晚月庄的前堂楼观景台，站在台前你可以看到整个庄院的  \n布局，瀚烟山美丽景色尽收眼里。微微的山风轻拂你的脸庞，有种\n说不出的轻爽。远处山寺的钟声，飞鸟的鸣啼，与眼前的景色构成\n一幅山林风光的风景画。正下方是前院。\n"
msgstr "This is Latemoon Manor's front-tower viewing deck. Standing before it you can see the layout of the whole manor, and the beautiful scenery of Hanyan Mountain lies spread before your eyes. A soft mountain wind brushes your face, with a lightness you can't describe. The bell of a mountain temple far off, the cry of birds in flight, and the view before you make a picture of mountain and forest. Directly below is the front yard.\n"

msgid "这是晚月庄让弟子们静修的地方, 名曰「缀芳」。简单的布置加上\n一座檀香炉, 你觉得这绝对是一个静修(ponder)的好场所。空气中弥漫\n著一股肃穆的气息, 使人很容易进入忘我的境界。\n"
msgstr "This is where Latemoon Manor lets its disciples practice quiet cultivation, called \"Blossom\". With simple furnishings and a sandalwood censer, you feel this is certainly a fine place for quiet meditation (ponder). A solemn air fills the room, making it easy to enter a state of selflessness.\n"

msgid "你走在一条蜿蜒的小径, 小径的两旁是半个人高的杂草, 你可以感受\n到清凉的微风从两侧吹来。\n"
msgstr "You walk on a winding trail, with weeds half a person high on either side, and you can feel a cool breeze coming from both sides.\n"

msgid "你走在这条蜿蜒的小径上, 本来向北走的小径被一道峭壁挡住了,\n因此小径从这弯向东边去, 在你的西边是一片杂草和几棵小树。\n"
msgstr "You walk on this winding trail. The trail that once led north is blocked by a sheer cliff, so it bends east here, and to your west is a stretch of weeds and a few small trees.\n"

msgid "条蜿蜒的小径通往东南方, 在你的东面是一道峭壁, 而在你的\n南边是一片浓密的竹林。\n"
msgstr "The winding trail leads southeast. To your east is a sheer cliff, and to your south is a thick bamboo grove.\n"

msgid "这条蜿蜒的小径通往西南方, 西边是一片茂密的竹林, 小\n径两旁是绿油油的草地，凉风从草地上吹拂而过，像嬉戏的儿\n童般溜过你的足畔，使你不知不觉间脚步轻快了起来。\n"
msgstr "This winding trail leads southwest. To the west is a lush bamboo grove, and both sides of the trail are green grass. A cool wind sweeps across the grass, slipping past your feet like playing children, and before you know it your steps have grown light.\n"

msgid "这条蜿蜒的小径通往东南方, 在你的东面是一处陡坡, 而在你的\n西边是一座茂密的竹林。\n"
msgstr "This winding trail leads southeast. To your east is a steep slope, and to your west is a dense bamboo grove.\n"

msgid "这是一座茂密的竹林。当你进入后彷佛迷失了方向！\n"
msgstr "This is a dense bamboo grove. Once inside, you seem to lose your sense of direction!\n"

msgid "你现在的神太少了，无法专注跳出舞步！"
msgstr "You don't have enough Spirit right now to concentrate on the dance steps!"

msgid "你在卦象中跳起舞来。但似乎不得要领！"
msgstr "You dance in the bagua pattern. But you can't seem to get the knack!"

msgid "$N在卦象中跳起舞来..一曲「 有凤来仪 」突然..."
msgstr "$N {N:dance|dances} in the bagua pattern.. a piece, \"The Phoenix Comes to Court\", suddenly..."

msgid "$N在卦象中跳起舞来..一曲「 西出阳关 」突然..."
msgstr "$N {N:dance|dances} in the bagua pattern.. a piece, \"Westward Out of Yangguan\", suddenly..."

msgid "请人替跳"
msgstr "Ask someone to dance for you"

msgid "冰匣已经开了。\n"
msgstr "The ice chest is already open.\n"

msgid "看我的！"
msgstr "Watch me!"

msgid "走到卦象中央，一个姿势，起舞——一曲「有凤来仪」，脚尖从乾到坎没点错一个。"
msgstr " steps into the middle of the bagua, strikes a pose and begins to dance, a piece, \"The Phoenix Comes to Court\", her toes touching every trigram from Qian to Kan without one mistake."

msgid "冰匣的盖子无声地滑开了。一件月白的衣从匣里浮起来，落在地上——寒气扑面，屋里的灯焰都矮了一截。\n"
msgstr "The lid of the ice chest slides open without a sound. A moon-white robe floats up from the chest and settles on the floor. A chill strikes your face, and the lamp flames in the room sink a little lower.\n"

msgid "好不好看！我得回去啦，不然蓝姐姐要骂。"
msgstr "Wasn't that pretty! I have to go back now, or Sister Lan will scold me."

msgid "替你跳一支？好。我舞跳得不好，这一支倒是会的。"
msgstr "Dance for you? Fine. I don't dance well, but this one I do know."

msgid "在卦象中起舞，一曲「有凤来仪」，轻得像没踩在地上。"
msgstr " dances in the bagua pattern, a piece, \"The Phoenix Comes to Court\", so lightly she seems not to touch the floor."

msgid "几百年没人跳对过——原来是要给人跳的。"
msgstr "Hundreds of years and nobody danced it right. It turns out it was meant to be danced for someone."

msgid "这里没有人替你跳。筱薇在隔壁的内厅，芳绫关在前院的禁闭房。\n"
msgstr "There's no one here to dance for you. Xiaowei is in the Inner Hall next door, and Fangling is shut in the Confinement Room in the front yard.\n"

msgid "你在神位前跳起舞来。但似乎不得要领！"
msgstr "You dance before the spirit tablet. But you can't seem to get the knack!"

msgid "舞到最后一转，满堂的檀香烟忽然一齐往上走。区冥神像的眉间亮了一下，像高处有人点了一盏灯。\n"
msgstr "On the last turn of the dance, the sandalwood smoke filling the hall all rises together. Between the brows of the Ouming statue something lights up, as if someone high above had lit a lamp.\n"

msgid "$N在区冥的神位前跳起舞来..一曲「 沧海龙吟 」，步子是图上的，曲子是谱上的..."
msgstr "$N {N:dance|dances} before Ouming's spirit tablet.. a piece, \"Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea\", the steps from the chart, the tune from the score..."

msgid "沧海龙吟已经在神位前跳过了。\n"
msgstr "\"Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea\" has already been danced before the spirit tablet.\n"

msgid "图和谱还没凑齐，谁也跳不出沧海龙吟。\n"
msgstr "Without both the chart and the score, no one can dance \"Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea\".\n"

msgid "走到神位前，照着图上的姿势起舞——一曲「沧海龙吟」，转到第七转时裙角带起了风。"
msgstr " walks up before the spirit tablet and dances, following the poses on the chart, a piece, \"Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea\", and on the seventh turn her skirt hem stirs up a breeze."

msgid "跳成了！跳成了！我要去跟蓝姐姐说——不行，她会骂我偷跑出来。"
msgstr "I did it! I did it! I have to tell Sister Lan... no, she'll scold me for sneaking out."

msgid "沧海龙吟？谱是我让你去找的，这一支我来跳。"
msgstr "\"Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea\"? I'm the one who sent you to find the score, so I'll dance this one."

msgid "在神位前站定，袖子一扬，一曲「沧海龙吟」，满身都是寒谷的幽香。"
msgstr " takes her place before the spirit tablet, flicks her sleeves, and dances, a piece, \"Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea\", her whole body full of the hidden fragrance of Cold Valley."

msgid "几十年没人跳过了——区冥还认得。"
msgstr "Nobody has danced this in decades. Ouming still knows it."

msgid "这里没有人替你跳。翠湘阁的莫欣芳在回廊那头，芳绫关在前院的禁闭房。\n"
msgstr "There's no one here to dance for you. Mo Xinfang of Green Xiang Chamber is at the far end of the gallery, and Fangling is shut in the Confinement Room in the front yard.\n"

msgid "翻找"
msgstr "Search"

msgid "你盲目的找著，但无发现什么!\n"
msgstr "You search blindly but find nothing!\n"

msgid "你翻箱倒柜想找出手镯，但似乎毫无所获。\n"
msgstr "You turn the cabinet upside down looking for the bracelet, but seem to get nothing for it.\n"

msgid "你从橱子内取出玛瑙手镯。"
msgstr "You take an agate bracelet from the cabinet."

msgid "你在石床后面找到了一本舞曲谱！\n"
msgstr "Behind the stone bed you find a dance score!\n"

msgid "你在石床附近找了很久，结果一无所获。\n"
msgstr "You search near the stone bed for a long time and find nothing.\n"

msgid "沐浴"
msgstr "Bathe"

msgid "此处是禁止男性进入！男人下池沐浴会中火玫瑰毒：毒发时不断伤神，伤得重了会丧命。\n确定要下池沐浴吗？"
msgstr "Men are forbidden here! A man who bathes in the pool is poisoned by Fire Rose poison: when it takes hold, it keeps hurting your Spirit, and if badly hurt you can die.\nSure you want to bathe in the pool?"

msgid "确定沐浴"
msgstr "Bathe anyway"

msgid "你觉得池水好像有种奇特的沁凉！\n"
msgstr "The water of the pool feels strangely cool!\n"

msgid "你在池子中尽情沐浴，舒服的泡在池中。\n"
msgstr "You bathe to your heart's content in the pool, soaking comfortably.\n"

msgid "静修"
msgstr "Meditate"

msgid "你双手合掌，安静的坐在地上。\n"
msgstr "You press your palms together and sit quietly on the floor.\n"

msgid "你彷佛变的较为祥合慈善了! \n"
msgstr "You seem to have become a little more gentle and kind! \n"

msgid "一只玄冰雕的匣子，齐膝高，匣盖上结着不化的霜。匣面刻着一行小字：凤仪起，匣自开。几百年没人跳对过。\n"
msgstr "A chest carved of dark ice, knee-high, with a frost on its lid that never melts. A line of small characters is cut in its face: \"When the phoenix rises, the chest opens on its own.\" Hundreds of years and no one has danced it right.\n"

msgid "灯笼上几个娟秀的字迹写著：\n晚霞西照人影依稀 \n月影高挂和风婉约 \n"
msgstr "The lanterns bear a few delicate characters:\nSunset glow in the west, human shadows faint \nMoon high aloft, a soft and gentle breeze \n"

msgid "    你仔细观看石墙，突然发现原本单调的墙上隐隐约约出现了\n一幅渺渺茫茫，似有似无的景像。彷佛是幻境，但又似真实，你\n清楚的看到一首词：「梦里消魂无说处，觉来惆怅消魂误。」\n"
msgstr "    You look closely at the stone wall and suddenly notice that on the once plain wall a faint, hazy scene seems to appear, half there, half not. It seems an illusion, yet also real. You see clearly a lyric: \"In dreams the soul melts, with nowhere to say it; on waking, grief and regret that the soul melted in error.\"\n"

msgid "取出衣服"
msgstr "Take clothes"

msgid "你从橱子内取出布裙。"
msgstr "You take a cloth skirt from the cabinet."

msgid "橱子内的衣服好像被拿光了。"
msgstr "It seems the clothes in the cabinet have all been taken."

msgid "这是一个上等木材作成的小橱子，里面放了一些物品。\n你看到一件件的美丽衣饰，真想取出(take cloth)看看。\n"
msgstr "This is a small cabinet made of fine wood, with some things inside.\nYou see one beautiful garment after another and would like to take (take cloth) a look.\n"

msgid "这是一幅湘绣的彩图，上有几名貌美的女子，以不同的姿态\n舞著，其漫妙之处让你著迷。图旁另绣有一曲名『西出阳关』\n(dancing out)与『有凤来仪 』\n"
msgstr "This is a colorful Xiang embroidery with several beautiful women on it, dancing in different poses, their grace and charm captivating you. Beside the picture are embroidered the names of the pieces 'Westward Out of Yangguan' (dancing out) and 'The Phoenix Comes to Court'.\n"

msgid "摘花蕊"
msgstr "Pick a flower heart"

msgid "你从西府海棠中摘下一朵小花蕊。"
msgstr "You pick a small flower heart from the Xifu crabapple."

msgid "西府海棠上的小花蕊已经被摘光了。"
msgstr "The small flower heart on the Xifu crabapple has all been picked."

msgid "    你仔细看这是一棵形状有些奇特的西府海棠，有一淡淡\n的奇异香气。原来在旁边还有一朵不太起眼，但是略成金黄\n色的小花蕊，你的直觉告诉你它似乎是一种珍贵药材。你想\n把它摘下(pick)。\n"
msgstr "    You look closely: this is a somewhat oddly shaped Xifu crabapple tree, with a faint, strange fragrance. Beside it is also a small flower heart, not very noticeable, a little golden in color, and your instinct tells you it is some kind of precious medicinal herb. You'd like to pick it (pick).\n"

msgid "\n 「六神」、「四鬼」、「三灵」 \n\n         旋芒震日月\n         宝剑护河山\n\n"
msgstr "\n \"Six Gods\", \"Four Fiends\", \"Three Spirits\" \n\n         Whirling Edge shakes sun and moon\n         Treasure sword guards the rivers and hills\n\n"

msgid "此处是禁止男性进入！闯进去的男人会被晚月庄的女弟子撒下火玫瑰毒、一脚踢出来：毒发时不断伤神，伤得重了会丧命。\n确定要进去吗？"
msgstr "Men are forbidden here! A man who barges in is showered with Fire Rose poison by Latemoon Manor's women disciples and kicked out: when it takes hold, it keeps hurting your Spirit, and if badly hurt you can die.\nSure you want to go in?"

msgid "确定进去"
msgstr "Go in anyway"

msgid "你将瓷杯交回给雨梅。\n"
msgstr "You hand the porcelain cup back to Yumei.\n"

msgid "你起身往南离开!"
msgstr "You stand and leave to the south!"

msgid "前庭"
msgstr "Front Court"

msgid "湘园"
msgstr "Xiang Garden"

msgid "跳下前院"
msgstr "Jump down to the front yard"
